{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":112,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1902758,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281974,"Name":"Veevee","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1439887622,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1902758,"PostDate":1439887622,"PostContent":"Hi, \u00a0 I am making final preparations for our wedding in 10 weeks time in Jamaica.\u00a0 So I wanted to...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>London Bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"velmawright@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.40.202.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422825930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Veevee","Id":281974,"Name":"Veevee","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"2.222.172.69","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79498,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebb3f72434fd201419179ab36cb9611b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am making final preparations for our wedding in 10 weeks time in Jamaica.&amp;nbsp; So I wanted to join a forum so that we can share our experiences and hear from others..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have decided to write our own vows has anyone else done this or just gone for the traditional vows?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Vee&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902758,"PostDate":1439887622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am making final preparations for our wedding in 10 weeks time in Jamaica.\u00a0 So I wanted to join a forum so that we can share our experiences and hear from others..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have decided to write our own vows has anyone else done this or just gone for the traditional vows?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Vee<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>London Bride <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"velmawright@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.40.202.106","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422825930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Veevee","Id":281974,"Name":"Veevee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.131.215.221","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79498,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40e334f2faaa66412e669c784b7c476f","RawContent":"we plan to write our own, but to be honest I haven&#039;t even started thinking about them yet.   Our wedding is in June 2016 so I have some time.   Congrats on your wedding!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1902761,"PostDate":1439888687,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                we plan to write our own, but to be honest I haven't even started thinking about them yet.   Our wedding is in June 2016 so I have some time.   Congrats on your wedding!!   \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amyzig2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.131.215.221","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1435828063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amyzig2","Id":283791,"Name":"amyzig2","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.251","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79498,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"faf2f6b0a10d0fb4e701131a227c6c0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a Jamaican bride from 2011. We loved the island and the people and hope sometime to go back. It hasn&#039;t worked out so far but we&#039;ll get there...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re planning a vow renewal this October for very specific reasons and are writing vows for it. It&#039;s two months away and I haven&#039;t even made it to that part yet. I know or have an idea what I want to say but haven&#039;t put the words together yet. I&#039;m going to end up crying anyway! lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902818,"PostDate":1439930507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm a Jamaican bride from 2011. We loved the island and the people and hope sometime to go back. It hasn't worked out so far but we'll get there...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're planning a vow renewal this October for very specific reasons and are writing vows for it. It's two months away and I haven't even made it to that part yet. I know or have an idea what I want to say but haven't put the words together yet. I'm going to end up crying anyway! lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79498","Title":"Getting Married In Hummingbird Hall Jamaica In October 2015","LastPostDate":1439930507},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
