"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.118.50.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6229329d3a1259069003243909d2619b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jsnyder0132\"] The dress looks beautiful on you, and looks like it will be nice and light for a destination wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893582,"PostDate":1429382408,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282571\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282571-jsnyder0132\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jsnyder0132<\/span><\/a> The dress looks beautiful on you, and looks like it will be nice and light for a destination wedding!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421849763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.165.141.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bba9889c54e0820304460429208e6a34","RawContent":"Is this the Katie May Lanai dress?!?!\n\nI have the same dress! I just got it on Friday actually and went for my first alterations appointment on Saturday. It fits like a glove and all I need to do is shorten the straps, hem and bustle. (Although I was hoping it would be a little more snug so I could lose 5 more pounds, but oh well!)\n\nI cannot wait to wear mine either! I am probably going to sleep in it on my wedding night because I won&#039;t want to take it off :)\n\nIt looks stunning on you! Congrats!\n\n[quote name=\"Jsnyder0132\" post=\"1893508\" timestamp=\"1429321755\"]\nHopefully I did this right, but here is my dress!! I can&#039;t wait to wear it!\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31611\"]IMG_1666.jpg[\/url]\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31610\"]IMG_1665.jpg[\/url][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1893608,"PostDate":1429456632,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Is this the Katie May Lanai dress?!?!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have the same dress! I just got it on Friday actually and went for my first alterations appointment on Saturday. It fits like a glove and all I need to do is shorten the straps, hem and bustle. (Although I was hoping it would be a little more snug so I could lose 5 more pounds, but oh well!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I cannot wait to wear mine either! I am probably going to sleep in it on my wedding night because I won't want to take it off <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It looks stunning on you! Congrats!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jsnyder0132, on 17 April 2015 - 09:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hopefully I did this right, but here is my dress!! I can't wait to wear it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31611' class='bbc_url' title=''>IMG_1666.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31610' class='bbc_url' title=''>IMG_1665.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403101687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47a8e8570b69f76b7f359dc290b731b0","RawContent":"@[member=\"Jsnyder0132\"]..omg. you look gorgeous! Love the back","Attachments":[],"Id":1893645,"PostDate":1429487302,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282571\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282571-jsnyder0132\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jsnyder0132<\/span><\/a>..omg. you look gorgeous! Love the back\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keredondo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.225.204.185","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403631619,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278682.jpg?_r=1414954781","PhotoWidth":187,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BecomingaRiggio","Id":278682,"Name":"BecomingaRiggio","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e72f1210467adb249d029fee6bcfcdf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1893608\" timestamp=\"1429471032\"]\nIs this the Katie May Lanai dress?!?!\n\nI have the same dress! I just got it on Friday actually and went for my first alterations appointment on Saturday. It fits like a glove and all I need to do is shorten the straps, hem and bustle. (Although I was hoping it would be a little more snug so I could lose 5 more pounds, but oh well!)\n\nI cannot wait to wear mine either! I am probably going to sleep in it on my wedding night because I won&#039;t want to take it off :)\n\nIt looks stunning on you! Congrats![\/quote]I love Katie May!! I got the Poipu and can&#039;t wait to wear it either!  I have my final fitting this week and might just have to wear it around the house when my fiance is gone :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1893709,"PostDate":1429532802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 19 April 2015 - 03:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Is this the Katie May Lanai dress?!?!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have the same dress! I just got it on Friday actually and went for my first alterations appointment on Saturday. It fits like a glove and all I need to do is shorten the straps, hem and bustle. (Although I was hoping it would be a little more snug so I could lose 5 more pounds, but oh well!)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I cannot wait to wear mine either! I am probably going to sleep in it on my wedding night because I won't want to take it off <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It looks stunning on you! Congrats!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love Katie May!! I got the Poipu and can't wait to wear it either! \u00a0I have my final fitting this week and might just have to wear it around the house when my fiance is gone <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8260,"NextPage":8270,"PreviousPage":8250,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
