{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.53.250.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ca65d607828dadc3bb6b12daf4f76cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I loved my dress! It was the perfect balance of princessy and beachy for me - it was obviously a full-fledged wedding dress, but the material at the bottom was this netting that was amazingly light and easy to move in and wasn&#039;t too hot in the Mexico sun. The back was a little daring for me, and I feel like I look lumpy in some of the pictures, but oh well!&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11665561_10155723526700293_4057853570832729185_n.jpg?oh=fa0c759b409f3adcc528953b49180b1e&amp;amp;oe=56476194\" alt=\"11665561_10155723526700293_4057853570832\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11659297_10155723432830293_4332270046013099028_n.jpg?oh=e21232d72abd5930cab481d0ba8de665&amp;amp;oe=5683CF57\" alt=\"11659297_10155723432830293_4332270046013\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902653,"PostDate":1439799697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I loved my dress! It was the perfect balance of princessy and beachy for me - it was obviously a full-fledged wedding dress, but the material at the bottom was this netting that was amazingly light and easy to move in and wasn't too hot in the Mexico sun. The back was a little daring for me, and I feel like I look lumpy in some of the pictures, but oh well!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11665561_10155723526700293_4057853570832729185_n.jpg?oh=fa0c759b409f3adcc528953b49180b1e&oe=56476194\" alt=\"11665561_10155723526700293_4057853570832\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent.fdtw1-1.fna.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/11659297_10155723432830293_4332270046013099028_n.jpg?oh=e21232d72abd5930cab481d0ba8de665&oe=5683CF57\" alt=\"11659297_10155723432830293_4332270046013\"><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rachelia160@aim.com","IpAddress":"66.61.104.237","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388717497,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275855.jpg?_r=1435853657","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rachelia160","Id":275855,"Name":"rachelia160","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f787b9e1fc4170c23140bb04349dc58","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This was my dress :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A lace mermaid gown with beaded sash, corset, and chapel train from David&#039;s Bridal. &amp;nbsp;(V3680)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Surprisingly I wasn&#039;t too hot in the dress. &amp;nbsp;I felt the heat during the pictures but I stayed hydrated and it seemed to help. &amp;nbsp;One tip, alternations sewed my crinoline skirt into the bottom of the dress. &amp;nbsp;When I tried the dress on at David&#039;s Bridal I was sweating buckets with the material of the crinoline skirt underneath the dress. &amp;nbsp;It really helped me stay cool by eliminating that layer of fabric.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When I saw this dress, I knew it was the one for me.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902660,"PostDate":1439810734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This was my dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A lace mermaid gown with beaded sash, corset, and chapel train from David's Bridal. \u00a0(V3680)<\/p>\n<p>Surprisingly I wasn't too hot in the dress. \u00a0I felt the heat during the pictures but I stayed hydrated and it seemed to help. \u00a0One tip, alternations sewed my crinoline skirt into the bottom of the dress. \u00a0When I tried the dress on at David's Bridal I was sweating buckets with the material of the crinoline skirt underneath the dress. \u00a0It really helped me stay cool by eliminating that layer of fabric.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When I saw this dress, I knew it was the one for me.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902660]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-74680300-1439824648.jpg\" title=\"the dress.jpg -  59.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-74680300-1439824648.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"the dress.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902660]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-98488800-1439824720.jpg\" title=\"kate shoes.jpg -  39.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-98488800-1439824720.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"kate shoes.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902660]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-58761300-1439824695.jpg\" title=\"bride 3.jpg -  38.05KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-58761300-1439824695.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"bride 3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1902660]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-82235600-1439824727.png\" title=\"bride2.png -  545.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-277519-0-82235600-1439824727.png\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"bride2.png\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.232.36.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aacbb885bfeeef106f2234819c4b05ec","RawContent":"These are the shoes I chose...&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/images.tapatalk-cdn.com\/15\/08\/17\/bec8b2f06d5b6cfd09dae90cbe3a3f3e.jpg\" alt=\"bec8b2f06d5b6cfd09dae90cbe3a3f3e.jpg\"&gt;\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1902668,"PostDate":1439812453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r