r\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>!! I loved that about it, also you can't tell much from the lighting but it has beautiful floral lace that peaks up in the neckline, I love how unique it is.<br><br>\nActually this is VERY embarrassing but... I have no idea what the brand is or anything lol. I tried it on, loved it, bought it, and when I got home I was like wow I have no idea what my dress is even called \ud83d\ude33\ud83d\ude31! So if anyone that sees this knows, feel free to educate me lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nwsunshine89@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.31.151.113","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426373150,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282426.jpg?_r=1430637054","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"moonpalacebride2be","Id":282426,"Name":"moonpalacebride2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d8ea056da2932fea074f8945510a4629","RawContent":"[quote name=\"moonpalacebride2be\" post=\"1892437\" timestamp=\"1428549552\"]\nThanks @[member=\"Wafflesmom\"]!! I loved that about it, also you can&#039;t tell much from the lighting but it has beautiful floral lace that peaks up in the neckline, I love how unique it is.\n\nActually this is VERY embarrassing but... I have no idea what the brand is or anything lol. I tried it on, loved it, bought it, and when I got home I was like wow I have no idea what my dress is even called [emoji15][emoji33]! So if anyone that sees this knows, feel free to educate me lol[\/quote]You and me both :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892440,"PostDate":1428535917,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>moonpalacebride2be, on 08 April 2015 - 11:19 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279721\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279721-wafflesmom\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Wafflesmom<\/span><\/a>!! I loved that about it, also you can't tell much from the lighting but it has beautiful floral lace that peaks up in the neckline, I love how unique it is.<br><br>\nActually this is VERY embarrassing but... I have no idea what the brand is or anything lol. I tried it on, loved it, bought it, and when I got home I was like wow I have no idea what my dress is even called [emoji15][emoji33]! So if anyone that sees this knows, feel free to educate me lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nYou and me both <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guest