/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31238\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427494117.418197.jpg[\/url][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=31239\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427494133.859774.jpg[\/url]\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]it looks great on you! and I love how the makeup finishes the look :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1891064,"PostDate":1427489953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>IzzyDeee, on 27 March 2015 - 06:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Went for my fitting today one more to go!!<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31237' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427494100.109967.jpg<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31238' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427494117.418197.jpg<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=31239' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427494133.859774.jpg<\/a><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>it looks great on you! and I love how the makeup finishes the look <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.51.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd9075364146c6a09d497d6a47a52d1e","RawContent":"The girls at the shop keep exploding my ego!![emoji87] they keep telling me how the dress looks better on me than their model!! Makes me feel so bubbly [emoji5]\ufe0f \n\nThank you so much @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] I really feel like a royal maiden from the medieval era [emoji73] kinda like cersie on game of thrones LOL! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891065,"PostDate":1427490137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The girls at the shop keep exploding my ego!![emoji87] they keep telling me how the dress looks better on me than their model!! Makes me feel so bubbly [emoji5]\ufe0f <br>\nThank you so much @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> I really feel like a royal maiden from the medieval era [emoji73] kinda like cersie on game of thrones LOL! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.177.110.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427499673,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"389ee2f6b7e96be3e84e02805a5f9c08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just ordered my dress today! I&#039;m sooooo excited about it! I was able to try it on in person at BHLDN in Seattle and I fell in love. It looks even better on and in person. I wanted something classy, and stylish - but still said &#039;hey, this is my beach wedding in mexico&#039;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80730]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t wait!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891092,"PostDate":1427499587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just ordered my dress today! I'm sooooo excited about it! I was able to try it on in person at BHLDN in Seattle and I fell in love. It looks even better on and in person. I wanted something classy, and stylish - but still said 'hey, this is my beach wedding in mexico'.<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/80730-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17999\/sml_gallery_281545_17999_57623.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='dress'  width='133' height='200'  alt='dress' id='sml_image_view_80730' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>I can't wait!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephlambert63@outlook.com","IpAddress":"192.64.7.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420153049,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281545.jpg?_r=1427512744","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CanuckGal","Id":281545,"Name":"CanuckGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.58.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10e522c014a165fd93919a306dfe9961","RawContent":"@Izzydee Love the dress....does look amazing on you xx\n\n\nJust curious but how does it feel walking in that dress? \n\n\n@[member=\"CanuckGal\"] Wow very glam....looks light....great for a beach wedding xx\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\n\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1891102,"PostDate":1427510506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Izzydee Love the dress....does look amazing on you xx<br><br>\nJust curious but how does it feel walking in that dress? <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281545\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281545-canuckgal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CanuckGal<\/span><\/a> Wow very glam....looks light....great for a beach wedding xx<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.79.116","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6438e22ca385c7574cdc5e7f8cb4151c","RawContent":"Thank you @[member=\"maybeoneday\"] [emoji4]\n\nThe dress feels amazing on. Very easy to sit down in and actually very light since it fits like a glove on the top half! I absolutely love it [emoji7]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891106,"PostDate":1427516023,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> [emoji4]<br>\nThe dress feels amazing on. Very easy to sit down in and actually very light since it fits like a glove on the top half! I absolutely love it [emoji7]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b39c7b939c74e0af7613a55845bd9dc1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"IzzyDeee\"] your dress looks amazing!!!!&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s so nice that you had your make trial and dress fitting at the same time.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891277,"PostDate":1427719959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282430\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282430-izzydeee\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">IzzyDeee<\/span><\/a> your dress looks amazing!!!!\u00a0 It's so nice that you had your make trial and dress fitting at the same time.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396968452,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8230,"NextPage":8240,"PreviousPage":8220,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
