e","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.58.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ce517b5a7b47eac6bfebb55421e2764","RawContent":"Beautiful dresses ladies [emoji141] \n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\n\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1890709,"PostDate":1427242149,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Beautiful dresses ladies [emoji141] <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c2b324bc4031e570fea0da03a10e0bc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"eriddell\" post=\"1890682\" timestamp=\"1427239793\"]\nMy dress :)\n\nCompletely different from what I expected to find, but I&#039;m in love[\/quote]I was between this dress and the one I got. It looks gorgeous when it&#039;s on. It was a tough choice for sure.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890852,"PostDate":1427372817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>eriddell, on 24 March 2015 - 07:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Completely different from what I expected to find, but I'm in love<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I was between this dress and the one I got. It looks gorgeous when it's on. It was a tough choice for sure.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427374014,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ec3b33a0ab1cdf9ad51900d43848dbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wasn&#039;t planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it&#039;s in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:80726]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is the dress on the model since the lighting isn&#039;t great in my pic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/&lt;span&gt;dress&lt;\/span&gt;.aspx?style=4MC844&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1890858,"PostDate":1427373945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wasn't planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it's in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/80726-the-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17998\/sml_gallery_281820_17998_203563.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='The Dress'  width='158' height='200'  alt='The Dress' id='sml_image_view_80726' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is the dress on the model since the lighting isn't great in my pic.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.maggiesot...px?style=4MC844<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421849763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b8e7145ee7dc92a71c9b0a8907f70a1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"krystalball\" post=\"1890858\" timestamp=\"1427388345\"]\nWasn&#039;t planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it&#039;s in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol\n\n\n\nThis is the dress on the model since the lighting isn&#039;t great in my pic. [url=\"http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\"]http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844[\/url]\n\nI love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured  :)[\/quote]I love it!! I love how the fabric just falls. This is exactly how i found mine! Totally unplanned haha","Attachments":[],"Id":1890893,"PostDate":1427377816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>krystalball, on 26 March 2015 - 12:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wasn't planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it's in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is the dress on the model since the lighting isn't great in my pic.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.maggiesot...px?style=4MC844<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love it!! I love how the fabric just falls. This is exactly how i found mine! Totally unplanned haha\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"409de5b7bd3e6554e76df2e02aad0fdf","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1890893\" timestamp=\"1427392216\"]\nI love it!! I love how the fabric just falls. This is exactly how i found mine! Totally unplanned haha[\/quote]\nThanks! I&#039;m seriously obsessing over this dress and how lucky I was they had it at the sample sale. Best part? That ribbon belt comes with the dress and looks perfect as is, so I saved a couple hundred on a separate belt too!\n\nOnly downside to the unplanned dress find is that it was a last minute shopping trip, so my sister (MOH) and Mom weren&#039;t able to make it. Oh well, just creates an opportunity for me to put on the dress again so I can show it to them in person, lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1890895,"PostDate":1427378608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 26 March 2015 - 01:50 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I love it!! I love how the fabric just falls. This is exactly how i found mine! Totally unplanned haha\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks! I'm seriously obsessing over this dress and how lucky I was they had it at the sample sale. Best part? That ribbon belt comes with the dress and\u00a0looks perfect as is, so I saved a couple hundred on a separate belt too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Only downside to the unplanned dress find is that it was a last minute shopping trip, so my sister (MOH) and Mom weren't able to make it. Oh well, just creates an opportunity for me to put on the dress again so I can show it to them in person, lol\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421849763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.98.196.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65ee347017c300f4f924fd092db14ec4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"krystalball\" post=\"1890895\" timestamp=\"1427393008\"]\nThanks! I&#039;m seriously obsessing over this dress and how lucky I was they had it at the sample sale. Best part? That ribbon belt comes with the dress and looks perfect as is, so I saved a couple hundred on a separate belt too!\n\nOnly downside to the unplanned dress find is that it was a last minute shopping trip, so my sister (MOH) and Mom weren&#039;t able to make it. Oh well, just creates an opportunity for me to put on the dress again so I can show it to them in person, lol[\/quote]I&#039;ve had mine forever at home too because it was a sample gown and I think it&#039;ve tried it on like 5 times already haha. Sometimes you just forget what it looks like and it&#039;s nice to have it to try it on ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1890896,"PostDate":1427378757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>krystalball, on 26 March 2015 - 02:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thanks! I'm seriously obsessing over this dress and how lucky I was they had it at the sample sale. Best part? That ribbon belt comes with the dress and\u00a0looks perfect as is, so I saved a couple hundred on a separate belt too!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Only downside to the unplanned dress find is that it was a last minute shopping trip, so my sister (MOH) and Mom weren't able to make it. Oh well, just creates an opportunity for me to put on the dress again so I can show it to them in person, lol\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I've had mine forever at home too because it was a sample gown and I think it've tried it on like 5 times already haha. Sometimes you just forget what it looks like and it's nice to have it to try it on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54904225bcd65bc26a5dc823b754d849","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1890896\" timestamp=\"1427393157\"]\nI&#039;ve had mine forever at home too because it was a sample gown and I think it&#039;ve tried it on like 5 times already haha. Sometimes you just forget what it looks like and it&#039;s nice to have it to try it on ;)[\/quote]\nI&#039;m glad I&#039;m not alone on that! I&#039;ll take your comment as permission to do a party-of-one fashion show in my living room when the FI is out of town  :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1890897,"PostDate":1427379405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 26 March 2015 - 02:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I've had mine forever at home too because it was a sample gown and I think it've tried it on like 5 times already haha. Sometimes you just forget what it looks like and it's nice to have it to try it on <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad I'm not alone on that! I'll take your comment as permission to do a party-of-one fashion show in my living room when the FI is out of town\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20160409\/e\/our+Wedding+Day\/k\/a16a\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n","Email":"krystalball@gmail.com","IpAddress":"158.82.202.5","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421849763,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281820.jpg?_r=1429976010","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"krystalball","Id":281820,"Name":"krystalball","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d48774f0319ef6fc5c0861b901aa8176","RawContent":"[quote name=\"krystalball\" post=\"1890858\" timestamp=\"1427388345\"]\nWasn&#039;t planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it&#039;s in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol\n\n\n\nThis is the dress on the model since the lighting isn&#039;t great in my pic. [url=\"http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844\"]http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844[\/url]\n\nI love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured  :)[\/quote]LOL! That&#039;s not bad at all! I&#039;ve been making appointments just to try my dress on again and again!! At least this Friday is a mandatory visit for my final fitting [emoji5]\ufe0f[emoji38] \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1890899,"PostDate":1427379591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>krystalball, on 26 March 2015 - 12:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Wasn't planning to buy a dress more than a year before my wedding date, but there was a sample sale and the dress of my dreams was $350 off! Now I just need to resist the temptation to try it on again since it's in my house until I get it altered many months from now, lol<br><br><br><br>\nThis is the dress on the model since the lighting isn't great in my pic. <a href='http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=4MC844' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.maggiesot...px?style=4MC844<\/a><br><br>\nI love that the bottom of the dress becomes sand coloured  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nLOL! That's not bad at all! I've been making appointments just to try my dress on again and again!! At least this Friday is a mandatory visit for my final fitting [emoji5]\ufe0f[emoji38] <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.74.55.84","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1033c8a20a04471b24ced08e379ecc24","RawContent":"[quote name=\"eriddell\" post=\"1890682\" timestamp=\"1427239793\"]\nMy dress :)\n\nCompletely different from what I expected to find, but I&#039;m in love[\/quote]LOVE! where did you buy?","Attachments":[],"Id":1890915,"PostDate":1427384294,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>eriddell, on 24 March 2015 - 07:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Completely different from what I expected to find, but I'm in love<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>LOVE! where did you buy?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.craig.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.184.35.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425935501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RJE","Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8220,"NextPage":8230,"PreviousPage":8210,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
