g>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32a899a85bad7b6374265fe4d5f4ba35","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kcole123\" post=\"1884244\" timestamp=\"1422325885\"]\nI am going to try to tough it out too @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]. I want to get as many hours in as I can that day to feel like I didn&#039;t want that money. Haha\nGoing to keep the second one for the trash the dress. I am hoping it won&#039;t be too blistering hot though on the boat for the reception.[\/quote]one of my biggest regrets from my grad was changing into jeans...lame. so I&#039;m not making the same mistake even if I die haha. I&#039;m hoping the wind up in the terrace will help :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1884247,"PostDate":1422311617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kcole123, on 26 January 2015 - 10:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am going to try to tough it out too @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a>. I want to get as many hours in as I can that day to feel like I didn't want that money. Haha<br>\nGoing to keep the second one for the trash the dress. I am hoping it won't be too blistering hot though on the boat for the reception.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>one of my biggest regrets from my grad was changing into jeans...lame. so I'm not making the same mistake even if I die haha. I'm hoping the wind up in the terrace will help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cea2e2b12b93af8def1570318c51be3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"colleentf09\" post=\"1884145\" timestamp=\"1422260186\"]\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=30477\"]ImageUploadedByTapatalk1422260112.048854.jpg[\/url]. This is my dress, I can&#039;t wait to wear it! It might be a little fancy for a beach wedding but it what I&#039;ve always dreamed of wearing![\/quote]\nOh that is so pretty! It isn&#039;t too much for a beach. there are no rules. Whatever you&#039;re comfortable in is what works! And if you love it, then it&#039;s for you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884252,"PostDate":1422312713,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>colleentf09, on 26 January 2015 - 04:16 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=30477' class='bbc_url' title=''>ImageUploadedByTapatalk1422260112.048854.jpg<\/a>. This is my dress, I can't wait to wear it! It might be a little fancy for a beach wedding but it what I've always dreamed of wearing!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Oh that is so pretty! It isn't too much for a beach. there are no rules. Whatever you're comfortable in is what works! And if you love it, then it's for you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6f3038224bbcc27919ddb751fe41902","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1854331\" timestamp=\"1402254746\"]\nI found my dress yesterday! It needs to have a few alterations but I love it![\/quote] That is just soooo beautiful! I really like the lace detail on the veil. \n\n@[member=\"colleentf09\"] that dress will look gorgeous anywhere!\n\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] a towel is a great idea, and you look lovely in your dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884265,"PostDate":1422319024,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 08 June 2014 - 03:12 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I found my dress yesterday! It needs to have a few alterations but I love it!\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0That is just soooo beautiful! I really like the lace detail on the veil.\u00a0<\/p><br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280885\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280885-colleentf09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">colleentf09<\/span><\/a> that dress will look gorgeous anywhere!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> a towel is a great idea, and you look lovely in your dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mmontgom@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407687958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279386.jpg?_r=1416803730","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ydolem","Id":279386,"Name":"Ydolem","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.83.185","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"48e877b08adabe685a42bae64ba0db63","RawContent":"[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1884035\" timestamp=\"1422169093\"]\nHi all bought my dress a couple of years back but due to a bereavement we cancelled! We&#039;ve now decided 