Cheap For Our Trash The Dress. During a davids sale. I was also thinking of putting my dress on when I get back home and take pictures again in the states. Just another excuse to wear it again. We live near a pretty cool town and I&#039;d like to take pictures around the courthouse and in the ice cream parlor. Maybe we will do our legal ceremony when we return and have a friend take our photos in the area and around our Alma mater.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884530,"PostDate":1422478671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm actually selong the dress I purchased because I really like another one. I Plan On Getting A Second Dress For Cheap For Our Trash The Dress. During a davids sale. I was also thinking of putting my dress on when I get back home and take pictures again in the states. Just another excuse to wear it again. We live near a pretty cool town and I'd like to take pictures around the courthouse and in the ice cream parlor. Maybe we will do our legal ceremony when we return and have a friend take our photos in the area and around our Alma mater.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHol