Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4c4331009a86b6f2126de35798d5928","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] I like both dresses, it might be a little dressier than some but I think it still fits a DW perfectly :). I also started shopping for something very \"beachy\", but wen i tried on the more formal dresses I knew I needed to go that route :). Maybe I should think of a short back up dress because I know I&#039;m going to absolutely cook in mine but I want to suck it up because I just love it that much! I saw one today as part of david&#039;s bridal new spring collection and it was beautiful, but close to $1000 :S.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;PS love those glitter shoes and the hair flower!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883791,"PostDate":1421960010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> I like both dresses, it might be a little dressier than some but I think it still fits a DW perfectly <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. I also started shopping for something very \"beachy\", but wen i tried on the more formal dresses I knew I needed to go that route <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>. Maybe I should think of a short back up dress because I know I'm going to absolutely cook in mine but I want to suck it up because I just love it that much! I saw one today as part of david's bridal new spring collection and it was beautiful, but close to $1000 :S.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>PS love those glitter shoes and the hair flower!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5f25358683a4c71646c8acff5504b95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] Oooh so pretty and elegant but can pull it off on the beach too! And the short one is super cute too. If you are doing a trash the dress you could always use the short one as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883797,"PostDate":1421965797,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> Oooh so pretty and elegant but can pull it off on the beach too! And the short one is super cute too. If you are doing a trash the dress you could always use the short one as well.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seriouslyamber@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420758542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Everly","Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2631cdbd8b7443cede60e36296f819a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] I love your entire ensemble! You are going to look great!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is my dress, on a model.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was surprised that I ended up buying a \"destination wedding dress\" as I mostly preferred the more formal\/traditional dresses.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30438,"Name":"5468_alt2_zoom.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-279386-0-68304100-1421992727.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-279386-0-68304100-1421992727_thumb.jpg","Width":753,"Height":1200},{"Id":30440,"Name":"cefa9710e31d4e2b16551d65410cb015.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-279386-0-33714600-1421992740.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-279386-0-33714600-1421992740_thumb.jpg","Width":236,"Height":376}],"Id":1883813,"PostDate":1421978356,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> I love your entire ensemble! You are going to look great!<\/p><br \/><p>This is my dress, on a model.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was surprised that I ended up buying a \"destination wedding dress\" as I mostly preferred the more formal\/traditional dresses.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mmontgom@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407687958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279386.jpg?_r=1416803730","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ydolem","Id":279386,"Name":"Ydolem","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b171f32f08956f6ccd91288917340d1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Ydolem\"] beautiful. It&#039;s funny how that works, I never imagined myself in my dress haha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883815,"PostDate":1421978584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279386\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279386-ydolem\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ydolem<\/span><\/a> beautiful. It's funny how that works, I never imagined myself in my dress haha\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.151.178.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55cf169d360ea3413d752185ff4dc634","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Ydolem\" post=\"1883813\" timestamp=\"1421992756\"]\n@[member=\"JenniferH114\"] I love your entire ensemble! You are going to look great!\n\nThis is my dress, on a model. \nI was surprised that I ended up buying a \"destination wedding dress\" as I mostly preferred the more formal\/traditional dresses.[\/quote]Oh I LOVE that!! It&#039;s gorgeous! is that Eden? Did you get white or ivory?","Attachments":[],"Id":1883823,"PostDate":1422003208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Ydolem, on 23 January 2015 - 01:59 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278395\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278395-jenniferh114\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JenniferH114<\/span><\/a> I love your entire ensemble! You are going to look great!<br><br>\nThis is my dress, on a model. <br>\nI was surprised that I ended up buying a \"destination wedding dress\" as I mostly preferred the more formal\/traditional dresses.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nOh I LOVE that!! It's gorgeous! is that Eden? Did you get white or ivory?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.240.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1422154743,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43f05f26a6d4cb1b88b56be713fc8499","RawContent":"Hi all bought my dress a couple of years back but due to a bereavement we cancelled! We&#039;ve now decided on a DW, Just in the process of booking it!  \n\n\nIs red too OTT for a DW? ? Also saw this one.....","Attachments":[{"Id":30459,"Name":"uploadfromtaptalk1422168990345.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216898983.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216898983_thumb.jpg","Width":474,"Height":655},{"Id":30460,"Name":"uploadfromtaptalk1422168995647.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216899506.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216899506_thumb.jpg","Width":500,"Height":655},{"Id":30461,"Name":"uploadfromtaptalk1422169080371.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216908092.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216908092_thumb.jpg","Width":490,"Height":668},{"Id":30462,"Name":"uploadfromtaptalk1422169086506.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216908688.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-281816-142216908688_thumb.jpg","Width":490,"Height":668}],"Id":1884035,"PostDate":1422154693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all bought my dress a couple of years back but due to a bereavement we cancelled! We've now decided on a DW, Just in the process of booking it!  <br><br>\nIs red too OTT for a DW? ? Also saw this one.....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8419dd6575e85cb690abc2b6dc1b1962","RawContent":"[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1884035\" timestamp=\"1422169093\"]\nHi all bought my dress a couple of years back but due to a bereavement we cancelled! We&#039;ve now decided on a DW, Just in the process of booking it!\n\nIs red too OTT for a DW? ? Also saw this one.....[\/quote]\nI&#039;m so sorry to hear you had to cancel the the walk down the aisle the first time. Awful thing to have to go through! \n\nBut yay for DW planning now!  Honestly I think a DW is one of the best  places to get away with wearing a red dress! I think it just means you have to be more careful with the color of the bridesmaid dresses which is not really a huge issue. The white dress is gorgeous too though. Its what you can envision yourself walking down the aisle in!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884067,"PostDate":1422195955,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maybeoneday, on 25 January 2015 - 02:58 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi all bought my dress a couple of years back but due to a bereavement we cancelled! We've now decided on a DW, Just in the process of booking it!<br><br>\nIs red too OTT for a DW? ? Also saw this one.....<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm so sorry to hear you had to cancel the the walk down the aisle the first time. Awful thing to have to go through!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But yay for DW planning now! \u00a0Honestly I think a DW is one of the best \u00a0places to get away with wearing a red dress!\u00a0I think it just means you have to be more careful with the color of the bridesmaid dresses which is not really a huge issue. The white dress is gorgeous too though. Its what you can envision yourself walking down the aisle in!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"seriouslyamber@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.87.24","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420758542,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281649.jpg?_r=1421027393","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Everly","Id":281649,"Name":"Everly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.42.240.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0154bba1af09ef6d2ec708f98a1f4bb3","RawContent":"Thanks Everly X Our wedding will be just the two of us so no need to worry about colour clashes however just thinking about the brightness of the sun on the red dress!  X","Attachments":[],"Id":1884069,"PostDate":1422196549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Everly X Our wedding will be just the two of us so no need to worry about colour clashes however just thinking about the brightness of the sun on the red dress!  X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5e622cd55c4943801327bd476bf9da1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] Thanks, I&#039;m glad you found a dress you love too! Is there a pic of it here? I&#039;d love to see it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you @[member=\"acw271011\"] - my dress is Stella York in white from their \"beach\" line.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"maybeoneday\"] I&#039;m so glad you&#039;re able to start planning your dream wedding after a difficult time. I agree with&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Everly\"] if you are going to do something non-traditional a DW is the best place to do that. I had a friend who wore red to a traditional church wedding too and it was gorgeous. Her husband&#039;s face was priceless!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884135,"PostDate":1422236335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> Thanks, I'm glad you found a dress you love too! Is there a pic of it here? I'd love to see it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a> - my dress is Stella York in white from their \"beach\" line.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> I'm so glad you're able to start planning your dream wedding after a difficult time. I agree with\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281649\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281649-everly\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Everly<\/span><\/a> if you are going to do something non-traditional a DW is the best place to do that. I had a friend who wore red to a traditional church wedding too and it was gorgeous. Her husband's face was priceless!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mmontgom@connect.carleton.ca","IpAddress":"68.146.92.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407687958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279386.jpg?_r=1416803730","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ydolem","Id":279386,"Name":"Ydolem","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eac247ea302de3d0eb27186225369ddd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Ydolem\"] it is! it&#039;s on page 801 of this thread&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884138,"PostDate":1422237248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279386\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279386-ydolem\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Ydolem<\/span><\/a> it is! it's on page 801 of this thread<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8190,"NextPage":8200,"PreviousPage":8180,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
