 month and I found my dress this week! <br \/><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1882283]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-278186-142076476261.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1420764761.667994.jpg -  240.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2015\/post-278186-142076476261.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1420764761.667994.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nFinally found my dress! Yay! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hkorkovilis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.238.70.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401612892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278186.jpg?_r=1417419505","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"helenk","Id":278186,"Name":"helenk","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.163.47.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a129db5fe59687b81d1df0a31093a32c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So far the ONLY thing I&#039;ve decided on for the wedding is my dress, haha.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=5MS162&amp;amp;page=0&amp;amp;pageSize=36&amp;amp;keywordText=&amp;amp;keywordType=All&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.maggiesottero.com\/dress.aspx?style=5MS162&amp;amp;page=0&amp;amp;pageSize=36&amp;amp;keywordText=&amp;amp;keywordType=All&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1882413,"PostDate":1420824229,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n          