front I want something like a halter top as I have a small bust.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/s-media-cache-ec0.pinimg.com\/736x\/a7\/38\/c5\/a738c52c637f431415c4e396a420efbf.jpg\" alt=\"a738c52c637f431415c4e396a420efbf.jpg\"><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Tell me what you think?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.tickerclub.com\/tickers\/wedding\/preview\/idTicker\/206838\/rulerId\/\/sliderId\/\/\" alt=\"sliderId\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"amanda@roamcanada.com","IpAddress":"41.218.252.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411393687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279936.jpg?_r=1414239845","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":246,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda2016","Id":279936,"Name":"amanda2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.35.35.35","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50ebc6c45f4c7ba57c54120ae1be2598","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"amandankeith\"] No worries! I just thought you might be interested in seeing what some of the other ladies posted. Lots of beautiful dresses in here.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876559,"PostDate":1413977021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/