the WATTERS CINZIA dress. Fall 2014 collection that is will going around in trunk shows. :-)\n[quote name=\"helenk\" post=\"1861171\" timestamp=\"1405919421\"]\n@[member=\"Nycfashionista\"] Wow! Your dress is amazing but even if I had your body my fianc\u00e9e wouldn&#039;t let me wear a dress with that much skin showing! Lol. Gorgeous though![\/quote]hmmm. sounds like a backhanded compliment. But Ok, thanks anyway.\n[quote name=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\" post=\"1868242\" timestamp=\"1408728022\"]\nStunning!\n\nLove this dress.[\/quote]Thank you!","Attachments":[],"Id":1876994,"PostDate":1414349384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Pablou, on 30 July 2014 - 05:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277707\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277707-nycfashionista\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Nycfashionista<\/span><\/a> - absolutely stunning<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you!! I can't wait to wear it....it's hanging in my closet already! eeek<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maredith, on 21 July 2014 - 02:13 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Wow! Beautiful!!! I love backless dresses! If you don't mind me asking, what make and model is the dress?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you! The dress with WATTERS CINZIA from their fall 2014 collection. I believe the dress is still going around in trunk shows.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love at first sight, I saw on instagram.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It arrived only 2 or 3 months after I tried in on and ordered it. It's hanging in my closet! :-)<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>malyna, on 19 July 2014 - 12:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@nucfashionista wow what a sexy back! I want something similar maybe . Who is the designer<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you!! It is the WATTERS CINZIA dress. Fall 2014 collection that is will going around in trunk shows. :-)<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>helenk, on 21 July 2014 - 01:10 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277707\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277707-nycfashionista\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Nycfashionista<\/span><\/a> Wow! Your dress is amazing but even if I had your body my fianc\u00e9e wouldn't let me wear a dress with that much skin showing! Lol. Gorgeous though!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>hmmm. sounds like a backhanded compliment. But Ok, thanks anyway.<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrandMrsBonitto2016, on 22 August 2014 - 01:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Stunning!<\/p>\n<br><p>Love this dress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>NYC fashionist