,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8dace354bc6333d421f0e8a37e176ae","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lia33\" post=\"1874068\" timestamp=\"1412274856\"]\n\nI haven&#039;t been on here in a while! I was unhappy with my original dress that I bought, and am SO happy that I kept looking...I just bought a new dress that I can truly say I am in love with!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n[\/quote]Beautiful!!! and you look so happy!  :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1874074,"PostDate":1412260919,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lia33, on 02 October 2014 - 02:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't been on here in a while! I was unhappy with my original dress that I bought, and am SO happy that I kept looking...I just bought a new dress that I can truly say I am in love with!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Beautiful!!! and you look so happy!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403194476,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\