ue,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c71339121d8b99a8e826a4ee658d688","RawContent":"[quote name=\"A7Xtrish\" post=\"1871712\" timestamp=\"1410673016\"]\nSo the wedding is in 9 days and I&#039;m starting to reconsider a second dress for the reception!  Granted it will only be an hour of dancing, I&#039;m going insane!! Help!?[\/quote]I think if you only plan to wear it an hour save your money and just wear your dress. Get the money&#039;s worth out of that.  Save that money and use it somewhere else :)\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1871746,"PostDate":1410689716,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>A7Xtrish, on 14 September 2014 - 01:36 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So the wedding is in 9 days and I'm starting to reconsider a second dress for the reception!  Granted it will only be an hour of dancing, I'm going insane!! Help!?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI think if you only plan to wear it an hour save your money and just wear your dress. Get the money's worth out of that.  Save that money and use it somewhere else <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya wi