> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1409849936,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8529c8d7181043d983c5f96fe9106e30","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1870585\" timestamp=\"1409863231\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] I personally love braids :) so I&#039;m kind of biased in that regard. I also heard that keratin treatments can help with the frizz in the humidity. They&#039;re expensive but the last about 2 months.[\/quote]\nI&#039;ve had two ladies mention this anti frizz product for humidity - so going to find out the name. These hairstylists swear by it.\nI am definitely open to her trying the braid - just can&#039;t picture it at the moment.\nIt&#039;s tough because I like my shorter bob and think it suits me, but understand it doesn&#039;t leave much room for &#039;wedding hair styles&#039;  I want to still look like myself!    At the end of the day, I am really only worried about my bangs. I know with 100% certainty they will go all freakish on me, and I don&#039;t want that!!!  Unless the spa lady is a miracle worker!\n[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1870585\" timestamp=\"1409863326\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] I personally love braids :) so I&#039;m kind of biased in that regard. I also heard that keratin treatments can help with the frizz in the humidity. They&#039;re expensive but the last about 2 months.\n\nThat&#039;s what my friend did! She made her own hair clip because they were all so darn expensive. I saw some at Claire&#039;s online but I guess I&#039;d have to check out the quality in person. The prices were very good though.[\/quote]\nNot the best quality if it has &#039;pearls&#039; in it.  You can tell they are cheaper and the wrong colors - when I was on the headband kick I almost bought one from there then realized it looked super cheap beside my dress &amp;amp; nice pearl necklace.\nSome of the rhinestone products are fine, they just don&#039;t have what I am looking for!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870586,"PostDate":1409849877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 September 2014 - 04:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> I personally love braids <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> so I'm kind of biased in that regard. I also heard that keratin treatments can help with the frizz in the humidity. They're expensive but the last about 2 months.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've had two ladies mention this anti frizz product for humidity - so going to find out the name. These hairstylists swear by it.<\/p>\n<p>I am definitely open to her trying the braid - just can't picture it at the moment.<\/p>\n<p>It's tough because I like my shorter bob and think it suits me, but understand it doesn't leave much room for 'wedding hair styles' \u00a0I want to still look like myself! \u00a0 \u00a0At the end of the day, I am really only worried about my bangs. I know with 100% certainty they will go all freakish on me, and I don't want that!!! \u00a0Unless the spa lady is a miracle worker!<\/p>\n<br><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 September 2014 - 04:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> I personally love braids <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> so I'm kind of biased in that regard. I also heard that keratin treatments can help with the frizz in the humidity. They're expensive but the last about 2 months.<\/p>\n<br><p>That's what my friend did! She made her own hair clip because they were all so darn expensive. I saw some at Claire's online but I guess I'd have to check out the quality in person. The prices were very good though.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not the best quality if it has 'pearls' in it. \u00a0You can tell they are cheaper and the wrong colors - when I was on the headband kick I almost bought one from there then realized it looked super cheap beside my dress & nice pearl necklace.<\/p>\n<p>Some of the rhinestone products are fine, they just don't have what I am looking for!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22f951bcc81f710222a01a703dd5d73f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1870586\" timestamp=\"1409864277\"]\nI&#039;ve had two ladies mention this anti frizz product for humidity - so going to find out the name. These hairstylists swear by it.\nI am definitely open to her trying the braid - just can&#039;t picture it at the moment.\nIt&#039;s tough because I like my shorter bob and think it suits me, but understand it doesn&#039;t leave much room for &#039;wedding hair styles&#039;  I want to still look like myself!    At the end of the day, I am really only worried about my bangs. I know with 100% certainty they will go all freakish on me, and I don&#039;t want that!!!  Unless the spa lady is a miracle worker!\n\n\nNot the best quality if it has &#039;pearls&#039; in it.  You can tell they are cheaper and the wrong colors - when I was on the headband kick I almost bought one from there then realized it looked super cheap beside my dress &amp;amp; nice pearl necklace.\nSome of the rhinestone products are fine, they just don&#039;t have what I am looking for![\/quote]That&#039;s true. When compared to the dress, especially if it has beading on it, you can tell they&#039;re cheap. I&#039;ll try to find something on etsy, but even then it&#039;s hard to find something under $50\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1870591,"PostDate":1409850082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 04 September 2014 - 04:57 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I've had two ladies mention this anti frizz product for humidity - so going to find out the name. These hairstylists swear by it.<br>\nI am definitely open to her trying the braid - just can't picture it at the moment.<br>\nIt's tough because I like my shorter bob and think it suits me, but understand it doesn't leave much room for 'wedding hair styles'  I want to still look like myself!    At the end of the day, I am really only worried about my bangs. I know with 100% certainty they will go all freakish on me, and I don't want that!!!  Unless the spa lady is a miracle worker!<br><br><br>\nNot the best quality if it has 'pearls' in it.  You can tell they are cheaper and the wrong colors - when I was on the headband kick I almost bought one from there then realized it looked super cheap beside my dress & nice pearl necklace.<br>\nSome of the rhinestone products are fine, they just don't have what I am looking for!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThat's true. When compared to the dress, especially if it has beading on it, you can tell they're cheap. I'll try to find something on etsy, but even then it's hard to find something under $50<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5356222792527f13f2cf594e77a1fa06","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1870591\" timestamp=\"1409864482\"]\nThat&#039;s true. When compared to the dress, especially if it has beading on it, you can tell they&#039;re cheap. I&#039;ll try to find something on etsy, but even then it&#039;s hard to find something under $50\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nYes! the one at David&#039;s Bridal I tried on was $130.\nSo $50 for a hair clip is still savings, hehe!\n\nWhat are you planning to do with your hair? type of hair piece? veil?","Attachments":[],"Id":1870592,"PostDate":1409850288,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 September 2014 - 05:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>That's true. When compared to the dress, especially if it has beading on it, you can tell they're cheap. I'll try to find something on etsy, but even then it's hard to find something under $50<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes! the one at David's Bridal I tried on was $130.<\/p>\n<p>So $50 for a hair clip is still savings, hehe!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What are you planning to do with your hair? type of hair piece? veil?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.172.160.130","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b69f6435fdb79a0a6fa1bfb24785eb54","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1870592\" timestamp=\"1409864688\"]\nYes! the one at David&#039;s Bridal I tried on was $130.\nSo $50 for a hair clip is still savings, hehe!\n\nWhat are you planning to do with your hair? type of hair piece? veil?[\/quote]I&#039;m doing an updo because I think it will be the most comfortable in the heat and humidity and i just think it complements the dress better. I have a veil but i&#039;ll probably get a small hair clip to add some detail to the updo for then I take the veil off. I have really long hair though so my concern is where they&#039;re going to put it all hahah. I really like the half-up styles but I think it will be a mess by the end of the night.","Attachments":[],"Id":1870593,"PostDate":1409850600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 04 September 2014 - 05:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Yes! the one at David's Bridal I tried on was $130.<\/p>\n<p>So $50 for a hair clip is still savings, hehe!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What are you planning to do with your hair? type of hair piece? veil?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I'm doing an updo because I think it will be the most comfortable in the heat and humidity and i just think it complements the dress better. I have a veil but i'll probably get a small hair clip to add some detail to the updo for then I take the veil off. I have really long hair though so my concern is where they're going to put it all hahah. I really like the half-up styles but I think it will be a mess by the end of the night.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1409850750,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9147c123a70e4e8bc26352a7662c69a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1870593\" timestamp=\"1409865000\"]\nI&#039;m doing an updo because I think it will be the most comfortable in the heat and humidity and i just think it complements the dress better. I have a veil but i&#039;ll probably get a small hair clip to add some detail to the updo for then I take the veil off. I have really long hair though so my concern is where they&#039;re going to put it all hahah. I really like the half-up styles but I think it will be a mess by the end of the night.[\/quote]\nSounds great!\n\nWith long hair I would totally do an updo! A hair clip would definitely compliment your hair both with and without the veil.  Even if I tried to grow mine out, in the next 4 months I still wouldn&#039;t even be near my shoulders.  Right now my entire neck is free of hair.","Attachments":[],"Id":1870594,"PostDate":1409850714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 September 2014 - 05:10 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm doing an updo because I think it will be the most comfortable in the heat and humidity and i just think it complements the dress better. I have a veil but i'll probably get a small hair clip to add some detail to the updo for then I take the veil off. I have really long hair though so my concern is where they're going to put it all hahah. I really like the half-up styles but I think it will be a mess by the end of the night.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sounds great!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>With long hair I would totally do an updo! A hair clip would definitely compliment your hair both with and without the veil. \u00a0Even if I tried to grow mine out, in the next 4 months I still wouldn't even be near my shoulders. \u00a0Right now my entire neck is free of hair.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.18.213.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5590bd320c409b5b87f31f17858b326f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll keep my eyes pealed for a hair clip for you Calgarybride! if you do see something you like that is in the states, we make Montana trips every now and then and I get stuff shipped to the border.&amp;nbsp; I could always grab it for you and meet you at Chinook or somewhere. Just an offer. I found that getting stuff I wanted from the states and shipped to the border was extremely cheaper and I didn&#039;t have to sacrifice getting what I wanted.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m all for updo&#039;s. I really really wanted to wear my hair down but it falls out so fast and I know it will look like crap and get sweaty hours later, so updo for this girl. My sister in law is doing photos for us a few days later since our ceremony is at sunset and we won&#039;t have enough time, so I will do my hair down for those ones. Updo&#039;s are so glamorous in my opinion and keep you from getting sweaty.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;OH and PS. You do not even want to know what I paid for my veil.. UGHH. However, I will be using and abusing that thing.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870595,"PostDate":1409851629,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'll keep my eyes pealed for a hair clip for you Calgarybride! if you do see something you like that is in the states, we make Montana trips every now and then and I get stuff shipped to the border.\u00a0 I could always grab it for you and meet you at Chinook or somewhere. Just an offer. I found that getting stuff I wanted from the states and shipped to the border was extremely cheaper and I didn't have to sacrifice getting what I wanted.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm all for updo's. I really really wanted to wear my hair down but it falls out so fast and I know it will look like crap and get sweaty hours later, so updo for this girl. My sister in law is doing photos for us a few days later since our ceremony is at sunset and we won't have enough time, so I will do my hair down for those ones. Updo's are so glamorous in my opinion and keep you from getting sweaty.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>OH and PS. You do not even want to know what I paid for my veil.. UGHH. However, I will be using and abusing that thing.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lcboyko@ualberta.ca","IpAddress":"23.17.180.191","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1304957891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239790.jpg?_r=1434572414","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsktobe","Id":239790,"Name":"Mrsktobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d111e5f29f3389d30a06415db61bb3f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here is both a picture of my wedding dress and my TTD dress.   Yes I got two.&amp;nbsp; Only because we leave the very next morning after our TTD session and I&#039;m afraid my actual gown won&#039;t be dry in time.&amp;nbsp; Plus I don&#039;t want to ruin it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding Gown:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My wedding gown is a Stella York,&amp;nbsp; style # 5986 in ivory.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also posted a pic from their website which only shows champagne.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am planning on adding a sheer\/rhinestone belt to add more bling.&amp;nbsp; Plus will either wear or attach an underskirt to give some poof.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Its sweet-heart neck, lace\/bead work with little bling to it.   Hard to see but the back neckline is actually lower, just hard to tell with the clips holding it on since these are pic&#039;s of me trying it on dress shopping.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TTD Dress:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My TTD dress is a sexy bohemian beach dress I purchased off DHgate for 50% off!&amp;nbsp; So, excited I fell in love with it when I seen it on pintrest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Can&#039;t wait to wear them both!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":29330,"Name":"tn_gallery_274657_17808_32733.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-35434500-1409870040.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-35434500-1409870040.jpg","Width":0,"Height":0},{"Id":29331,"Name":"tn_gallery_274657_17808_710295.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-03748100-1409870057.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-03748100-1409870057.jpg","Width":0,"Height":0},{"Id":29332,"Name":"tn_gallery_274657_17808_1342603.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-68408100-1409870073.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-68408100-1409870073.jpg","Width":0,"Height":0},{"Id":29333,"Name":"2014-sexy-beach-wedding-dresses-spaghetti.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-64402900-1409870190.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_09_2014\/post-274657-0-64402900-1409870190_thumb.jpg","Width":183,"Height":200}],"Id":1870596,"PostDate":1409855877,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here is both a picture of my wedding dress and my TTD dress.\u00a0\u00a0 Yes I got two.\u00a0 Only because we leave the very next morning after our TTD session and I'm afraid my actual gown won't be dry in time.\u00a0 Plus I don't want to ruin it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Gown:<\/p>\n<p>My wedding gown is a Stella York,\u00a0 style # 5986 in ivory.<\/p>\n<p>I also posted a pic from their website which only shows champagne.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am planning on adding a sheer\/rhinestone belt to add more bling.\u00a0 Plus will either wear or attach an underskirt to give some poof.<\/p>\n<p>Its sweet-heart neck, lace\/bead work with little bling to it.\u00a0\u00a0 Hard to see but the back neckline is actually lower, just hard to tell with the clips holding it on since these are pic's of me trying it on dress shopping.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>TTD Dress:<\/p>\n<p>My TTD dress is a sexy bohemian beach dress I purchased off DHgate for 50% off!\u00a0 So, excited I fell in love with it when I seen it on pintrest.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Can't wait to wear them both!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383038867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.158.134.135","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0b003fd0cbdb6b4b62620d0a954346a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know how to view just the photos from this thread? I used to be able to access the photos on the right hand side of the thread. Any ideas?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870607,"PostDate":1409862918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know how to view just the photos from this thread? I used to be able to access the photos on the right hand side of the thread. Any ideas?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jmiller055@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.108.247","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1252438762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221425.jpg?_r=1405787041","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JennyAdele","Id":221425,"Name":"JennyAdele","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.188.148.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea2695ec14e702a839dd259b7367b097","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TinkerSofi\" post=\"1870511\" timestamp=\"1409841671\"]\n@[member=\"Lia33\"] ok that makes sense. For me, even though I had never completely envisioned it I knew I wanted a bit of glam, like some beading or something like that. I wanted something that would make me feel a little bit sexy but sweet at the same time and romantic. When I tried on my dress it was all of those things, even though I didn&#039;t think I would be able to find them all in one dress. I realized I never really wanted a classic \"DW gown\" but I hadn&#039;t thought I would be able to find anything else. When I liked other dresses and they asked me if I was ready to buy them I always felt unsure, like I wasn&#039;t ready to commit to them but for this one I just knew it was the one. At first I did keep wondering \"what if\", but every time I&#039;m more and more convinced that this dress is perfect for me and I really have no need to keep searching (I know this is actually a psychological phenomenon where you reframe things to be happier with your decision rather than wonder about other possibilities haha, but I&#039;m ok with that ;))\n\nDid you like the other dress better but you just didn&#039;t like the fact that it was champagne? Maybe try to find a very similar dress and only try that one on. If you like it more than your dress you might have your answer ;). Also, maybe wait a month or two, if you can, and keep trying yours on. If you still feel like it&#039;s not quite right then maybe it isn&#039;t! \n\n@[member=\"A7Xtrish\"] lovely dress! I had tried the same one on but I didn&#039;t like it on me. It looks gorgeous on you though ;)[\/quote]@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] thank you!! Xox \n[quote name=\"Mrsktobe\" post=\"1870546\" timestamp=\"1409851675\"]\nA7X LOVE the dress! So gorgeous!! Your wedding is coming up so soon, you must be excited!![\/quote]Thank you! Yes! 18 days. Cannot wait!!! \u2661","Attachments":[],"Id":1870623,"PostDate":1409868658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TinkerSofi, on 04 September 2014 - 10:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279182\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279182-lia33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lia33<\/span><\/a> ok that makes sense. For me, even though I had never completely envisioned it I knew I wanted a bit of glam, like some beading or something like that. I wanted something that would make me feel a little bit sexy but sweet at the same time and romantic. When I tried on my dress it was all of those things, even though I didn't think I would be able to find them all in one dress. I realized I never really wanted a classic \"DW gown\" but I hadn't thought I would be able to find anything else. When I liked other dresses and they asked me if I was ready to buy them I always felt unsure, like I wasn't ready to commit to them but for this one I just knew it was the one. At first I did keep wondering \"what if\", but every time I'm more and more convinced that this dress is perfect for me and I really have no need to keep searching (I know this is actually a psychological phenomenon where you reframe things to be happier with your decision rather than wonder about other possibilities haha, but I'm ok with that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>)<br><br>\nDid you like the other dress better but you just didn't like the fact that it was champagne? Maybe try to find a very similar dress and only try that one on. If you like it more than your dress you might have your answer <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>. Also, maybe wait a month or two, if you can, and keep trying yours on. If you still feel like it's not quite right then maybe it isn't! <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274569\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/274569-a7xtrish\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">A7Xtrish<\/span><\/a> lovely dress! I had tried the same one on but I didn't like it on me. It looks gorgeous on you though <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> thank you!! Xox <br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mrsktobe, on 04 September 2014 - 01:27 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>A7X LOVE the dress! So gorgeous!! Your wedding is coming up so soon, you must be excited!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThank you! Yes! 18 days. Cannot wait!!! \u2661\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382734474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b17e64942c0ab62d47de4b014c6b01c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] Loved the hair pin!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"misbosox\"] - beautiful dresses!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] - I&#039;ll be doing an undo as well. My hair is a little long, and frizzes, and I generally hate having it in my face lol After the wedding I plan on chopping my hair off.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870730,"PostDate":1409942244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> Loved the hair pin!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"274657\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/274657-misbosox\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">misbosox<\/span><\/a> - beautiful dresses!!<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> - I'll be doing an undo as well. My hair is a little long, and frizzes, and I generally hate having it in my face lol After the wedding I plan on chopping my hair off.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406462117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8130,"NextPage":8140,"PreviousPage":8120,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
