158011111\"]\nThis is what I wore. I bought it in a very pale blue but apprently it is not in that color anymore. I got it at David&#039;s Bridal for $150.\n\n\n[img]http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/images\/fashions\/full\/s06_F1286_bluevelvettanzanite.jpg[\/img][\/quote]elegant dress\n[quote name=\"JENGONDA9\" post=\"4917\" timestamp=\"1162203647\"]\nI find it too hard to make the pics small enough to upload and i am technologically challenged with the other method so here is a link to see my dress :)\n\n[img]http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg[\/img]\n\nit is all ivory silk chiffon with silver art deco style beading. it goes with the vintage art deco ring my honey bought for me :)\n\nAND I am for sure going to slather myself in baby oil just like the model!!!\n\nmy ladies are wearing a black chiffon dress found here:\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/web1\/b2_3_photo1.asp?id=144\"]http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/we...to1.asp?id=144[\/url]\n[b]12\/18\/08 - LINK NO LONGER VALID[\/b]\n\nAnd by the way AKH - I tried that dress on and it is beautiful! not at all too much for the beach! i bought my dress in june and am STILL obsessed with bridal fashion[\/quote]good dress, simple dress, i like it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1861667,"PostDate":1406071875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jennifer, on 11 September 2006 - 05:45 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is what I wore. I bought it in a very pale blue but apprently it is not in that color anymore. I got it at David's Bridal for $150.<br><br><br><a href='http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/images\/fashions\/full\/s06_F1286_bluevelvettanzanite.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.davidsbridal.com\/images\/fashions\/full\/s06_F1286_bluevelvettanzanite.jpg\" alt=\"s06_F1286_bluevelvettanzanite.jpg\"><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>elegant dress<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JENGONDA9, on 30 October 2006 - 06:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I find it too hard to make the pics small enough to upload and i am technologically challenged with the other method so here is a link to see my dress <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><a href='http:\/\/album.aufeminin.com\/album\/see_136141_31\/pronovias-2006.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/album.aufemin....vias-2006.html<\/a><br><a href='http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i197.photobucket.com\/albums\/aa240\/carlymcmullen\/BDW%20Photos%20for%20Others\/weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg\" alt=\"weddingdress-jengonda9.jpg\"><\/a><br><br>\nit is all ivory silk chiffon with silver art deco style beading. it goes with the vintage art deco ring my honey bought for me <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nAND I am for sure going to slather myself in baby oil just like the model!!!<br><br>\nmy ladies are wearing a black chiffon dress found here:<br><br><a href='http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/html\/web1\/b2_3_photo1.asp?id=144' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jasminebr....to1.asp?id=144<\/a><br><strong>12\/18\/08 - LINK NO LONGER VALID<\/strong><br><br>\nAnd by the way AKH - I tried that dress on and it is beautiful! not at all too much for the beach! i bought my dress in june and am STILL obsessed with bridal fashion<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>good dress, simple dress, i like it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louis.mcwright@gmail.com","IpAddress":"182.253.48.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406070757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"louis123","Id":279132,"Name":"louis123","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":8050,"NextPage":8060,"PreviousPage":8040,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
