"1402748506\"]\nThis is my dress and I ADORE it!!\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/9071\"]http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/9071[\/url][\/quote]Omg wow!! This dress is just breathtaking ...","Attachments":[],"Id":1855254,"PostDate":1402756626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 14 June 2014 - 08:21 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>This is my dress and I ADORE it!!<br><br><a href='http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/9071' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.allurebri...m\/products\/9071<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOmg wow!! This dress is just breathtaking ... \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Using Tapatalk","Email":"kiannabanana69@gmail.com","IpAddress":"200.106.87.106","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1397888214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277650.png?_r=1402827462","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoy","Id":277650,"Name":"MrsRoy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1ec8a483b1c1260326202cf74219daa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This is my dress on the model and me in the dress. It&#039;s actually a bridesmaid dress (hence the black) but I am getting it in ivory, adding a sash and getting it into a strapless sweetheart neckline. There is also a small flower piece that I am adding to the sash on the back to make the back more interesting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:75038]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:75039]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855255,"PostDate":1402759310,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This is my dress on the model and me in the dress. It's actually a bridesmaid dress (hence the black) but I am getting it in ivory, adding a sash and getting it into a strapless sweetheart neckline. There is also a small flower piece that I am adding to the sash on the back to make the back more interesting.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/75038-bg-img01\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17653\/sml_gallery_276338_17653_37498.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Bg img01'  width='141' height='200'  alt='Bg img01' id='sml_image_view_75038' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/75039-imagejpeg-8\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17653\/sml_gallery_276338_17653_40481.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='imagejpeg 8'  width='150' height='200'  alt='imagejpeg 8' id='sml_image_view_75039' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390758531,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2d658ce45cbc387e6e3da2b4c61d329","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MrsRoy\" post=\"1855254\" timestamp=\"1402771026\"]\nOmg wow!! This dress is just breathtaking ...[\/quote]\n\nThank you!  It was the first I tried on, and the sample fit like  a glove!","Attachments":[],"Id":1855259,"PostDate":1402762602,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrsRoy, on 14 June 2014 - 02:37 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Omg 