{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c754c397c61880e50846fc3f6235d568","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jackielemman\"] thank you! I&#039;m so glad I kept an open mind because it is totally different from the other dresses I was looking at :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855134,"PostDate":1402677511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"273651\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/273651-jackielemman\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jackielemman<\/span><\/a> thank you! I'm so glad I kept an open mind because it is totally different from the other dresses I was looking at <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.52.95.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1402684920,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"757a05e69c85cfd675c1b900e7ceb7c7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have changed my dress.....I liked the first one but the bubble hem was driving me crazy so I returned it and was able to do an exchange for a different dress.&amp;nbsp; I am now so happy and actually feel like a bride ready for a DW.  I had to order a larger size because I am a curvy girl (I couldn&#039;t breathe in the picture!&amp;nbsp; Haha! ) However, had I looked at this dress on line I wouldn&#039;t have tried it on.....the model doesn&#039;t do the dress justice.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":28261,"Name":"P_16979_5_411400.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-277534-0-38148600-1402699061.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-277534-0-38148600-1402699061.jpg","Width":0,"Height":0},{"Id":28262,"Name":"photo (8).JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-277534-0-85675400-1402699108.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2014\/post-277534-0-85675400-1402699108_thumb.jpg","Width":811,"Height":1043}],"Id":1855157,"PostDate":1402684832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have changed my dress.....I liked the first one but the bubble hem was driving me crazy so I returned it and was able to do an exchange for a different dress.\u00a0 I am now so happy and actually feel like a bride ready for a DW.\u00a0\u00a0I had to order a larger size because I am a curvy girl (I couldn't breathe in the picture!\u00a0 Haha! ) However, had I looked at this dress on line I wouldn't have tried it on.....the model doesn't do the dress justice.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.155.94.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"874def834cd79db2ac2982857c8e4b87","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsGlover\" post=\"1855157\" timestamp=\"1402699232\"]\nI have changed my dress.....I liked the first one but the bubble hem was driving me crazy so I returned it and was able to do an exchange for a different dress.  I am now so happy and actually feel like a bride ready for a DW.  I had to order a larger size because I am a curvy girl (I couldn&#039;t breathe in the picture!  Haha! ) However, had I looked at this dress on line I wouldn&#039;t have tried it on.....the model doesn&#039;t do the dress justice.  :)[\/quote]I like! I&#039;m not a big fan of bubble hems so you made the right choice, at least in my opinion :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1855162,"PostDate":1402687222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsGlover, on 13 June 2014 - 06:40 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have changed my dress.....I liked the first one but the bubble hem was driving me crazy so I returned it and was able to do an exchange for a different dress.\u00a0 I am now so happy and actually feel like a bride ready for a DW.\u00a0\u00a0I had to order a larger size because I am a curvy girl (I couldn't breathe in the picture!\u00a0 Haha! ) However, had I looked at this dress on line I wouldn't have tried it on.....the model doesn't do the dress justice.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I like! I'm not a big fan of bubble hems so you made the right choice, at least in my opinion <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.99.194.189","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e83e512ea078d0b58e48aee3c710cb1e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow that dress is gorgeous&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855170,"PostDate":1402690158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow that dress is gorgeous<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.52.95.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd306e0b40d48feda9921c302123a402","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TinkerSofi\"]...I agree also.&amp;nbsp; I am not a fan of bubble hems either but my entourage and the consultant loved the dress on me....but after I left I realized that was not the vision I had for my wedding.&amp;nbsp; I kept looking and then finally made another appointment and returned to the store.&amp;nbsp; The dress was in the front of the store when I went in the second time and I told the consultant I want to try this on.&amp;nbsp; This time I had a glow and I knew it would be perfect.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kcole123\"]...thank you!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855184,"PostDate":1402700473,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_