F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Dreamteam17, on 05 June 2014 - 08:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>This is my dress. I am not doing the bow in the back and getting them to make just the belt in the front so it won't be too bulky.<br><br><a href='http:\/\/moonlightbridal.com\/Product\/MoonlightCollection\/J6260\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/moonlightbrid...llection\/J6260\/<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is absolutely gorgeous! And yet like @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> I agree - no bow.<\/p><br \/><p>@lucy1210\u00a0 @muneera0302\u00a0 @ModeRNBride\u00a0 All beautiful dresses! Ladies - you are all going to look stunning for your weddings!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.101.152.253","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4ed6d23a5388890534bfd65d9877c61","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lucy1210\" post=\"1850242\" timestamp=\"1400058056\"]\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.dresshop.com.au\/a-line-sweetheart-floor-length-ruffles-bead