onwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/270979-modernbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ModeRNBride<\/span><\/a> STUNNING<br>\nthis looks amazing on you. Great choice.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was in the same boat as you, wanted the princess one as well And I went with a drop waisted A-line, almost mermaid style as well!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jlynnmape@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.202.144.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389380770,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jayejayelynn","Id":275997,"Name":"jayejayelynn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.118.82.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9eb8cbe1a33877f1d252123d32e994d8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LilyPotter\" post=\"1838285\" timestamp=\"1394895503\"]\nThe dress! Finally figured out how to post pics! :)\n\n\nFront of dress.\n\n\nDetails of the front.\n\n\nBack of the dress.[\/quote]\n\nLove, love, love this dress. Can&#039;t wait too see you in it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1851801,"PostDate":1400783253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margi