","Email":"muneera0302@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.113.120.30","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357557872,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263996.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"muneera0302","Id":263996,"Name":"muneera0302","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.205.170.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd8c736437121869143e20588483d1e2","RawContent":"It&#039;s still very blurry. Can&#039;t really see it [emoji17]\nThat&#039;s the kind if style I&#039;m looking at also","Attachments":[],"Id":1850362,"PostDate":1400088382,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                It's still very blurry. Can't really see it [emoji17]<br \/>That's the kind if style I'm looking at also\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390383454,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c9011c49977101423628e7742f68236c","RawContent":"Luv that dress @[member=\"lucy1210\"]","Attachments":[],"Id":1850581,"PostDate":1400195478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Luv that dress @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275268\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/275268-lucy1210\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">lucy1210<\/span><\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latanyabryant@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391296404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276443.jpg?_r=1391315507","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tanya81","Id":276443,"Name":"Tanya81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.168.184.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5101a30af95cf46b1dcb260a01b58258","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve loved looking at all the dresses posted here and thought I&#039;d share mine! I was the girl who always dreamed of the day I&#039;d get to try on wedding dresses... and in my dreams, I was always wearing a big, princess-y ballgown! I&#039;m glad I went shopping with an open mind, though, because it turns out I&#039;m more of a mermaid girl. When I tried on this dress (\"Ethel,\" by Vera Wang) I know it was the one! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i1295.photobucket.com\/albums\/b628\/Dawn_Leadens\/vera_zps36c98573.jpg\" alt=\"vera_zps36c98573.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1850893,"PostDate":1400334746,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've loved looking at all the dresses posted here and thought I'd share mine! I was the girl who always dreamed of the day I'd get to try on wedding dresses... and in my dreams, I was always wearing a big, princess-y ballgown! I'm glad I went shopping with an open mind, though, because it turns out I'm more of a mermaid girl. When I tried on this dress (\"Ethel,\" by Vera Wang) I know it was the one! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i1295.photobucket.com\/albums\/b628\/Dawn_Leadens\/vera_zps36c98573.jpg\" alt=\"vera_zps36c98573.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dawn.leadens@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.168.191.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1372336293,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270979.jpg?_r=1398290100","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ModeRNBride","Id":270979,"Name":"ModeRNBride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7980,"NextPage":7990,"PreviousPage":7970,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
