Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1399288073,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cec4eb60267f2117d17022fb771a5843","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My dress is in and I got to try it on this weekend. &amp;nbsp;I was very scared not to like myself in the dress because first of all when I bought the dress it wasn&#039;t my size it was probably 3 sizes too small so it took some imagination to really get the look of the dress on me. &amp;nbsp;Secondly I didn&#039;t quite lose the weight I had hoped to before the dress came in so I didn&#039;t think it would fit right and lastly I just wasn&#039;t sure it was still the one since I bought it 7 months earlier. &amp;nbsp;Well I got to my appointment saw the dress again and fell in love with it when I saw it hanging there then came the moment of truth trying the sucker on. &amp;nbsp;It fit!! &amp;nbsp;I could still lose some pounds and definitely need to go buy the right undergarments for the dress to smooth some areas out but I did love the dress on me and that&#039;s what matters. &amp;nbsp;I think I also picked out the veil I want to wear with it. &amp;nbsp;Here are some photos let me know what you think.   &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848282,"PostDate":1399287795,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My dress is in and I got to try it on this weekend. \u00a0I was very scared not to like myself in the dress because first of all when I bought the dress it wasn't my size it was probably 3 sizes too small so it took some imagination to really get the look of the dress on me. \u00a0Secondly I didn't quite lose the weight I had hoped to before the dress came in so I didn't think it would fit right and lastly I just wasn't sure it was still the one since I bought it 7 months earlier. \u00a0Well I got to my appointment saw the dress again and fell in love with it when I saw it hanging there then came the moment of truth trying the sucker on. \u00a0It fit!! \u00a0I could still lose some pounds and definitely need to go buy the right undergarments for the dress to smooth some areas out but I did love the dress on me and that's what matters. \u00a0I think I also picked out the veil I want to wear with it. \u00a0Here are some photos let me know what you think. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1848282]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-83816000-1399302110.jpg\" title=\"IMG_8803.jpg -  110.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-83816000-1399302110.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_8803.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1848282]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-63242500-1399302133.jpg\" title=\"IMG_8808.jpg -  106.77KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-63242500-1399302133.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_8808.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n\u00a0<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1848282]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-01990600-1399302326.jpg\" title=\"IMG_88051.jpg -  101.13KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_05_2014\/post-264077-0-01990600-1399302326.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"IMG_88051.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"046cdd8f849a82fad07a49951b7975ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"NJBride2014\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;GORGEOUS!&lt;\/p&gt;