:1848324,"PostDate":1399305606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow that's really nice. And that belt really finishes the look.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>I am soooooo hoping I find a dress this weekend. When\/if I do I will surely post it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.118.82.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51225c3b1fe8a7d23709216eb5ae94c8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I wannna see... 150 where are tho :-(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848358,"PostDate":1399318998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I wannna see... 150 where are tho :-(<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latanyabryant@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.37.216.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391296404,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276443.jpg?_r=1391315507","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tanya81","Id":276443,"Name":"Tanya81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.138.102.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78c1dc2bf3e6dfd56a67aa12a0addbc5","RawContent":"@[member=\"NJBride2014\"] you look gorgeous!!\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1848386,"PostDate":1399346432,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264077-njbride2014\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NJBride2014<\/span><\/a> you look gorgeous!!<br><br><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383890954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41303203f982c9d636da00c7a789fc7c","RawContent":"Beautiful!\n[quote name=\"rednlovinit21\" post=\"1843868\" timestamp=\"1397222669\"]\nOkay so these aren&#039;t the best pictures and I actually bought a dress before this and had to sell it because after seeing this I just knew it would never be the one. Going to my fitting in 2 weeks!\n[\/quote]I LOVE your dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848403,"PostDate":1399371009,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Beautiful!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>rednlovinit21, on 11 April 2014 - 09:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Okay so these aren't the best pictures and I actually bought a dress before this and had to sell it because after seeing this I just knew it would never be the one. Going to my fitting in 2 weeks!<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI LOVE your dress! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falontubman@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"47.54.40.212","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399367976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277857.jpg?_r=1399384355","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bridetobe771","Id":277857,"Name":"Bridetobe771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.221.122.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"035a3ad14a70bd845d43bdc4df02cd57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Bridetobe771\"] thank you so much!!! I went this past saturday for my fitting and I absolutely fell in love all over again, it&#039;s so great nowing you made the right decision! Go back in a month to see how it all went!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is before she took the scissors to the bottom and pinned it all up! haha scariest moment ever!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:75088]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848973,"PostDate":1399548952,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hov