{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3288d638a03050bf3df409ed617024a9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have yet to buy my dress. I have went looking a couple of times but it&#039;s not the same when I go myself. My fianc\u00e9 and I just moved to a new province and I don&#039;t know many people here. The couple of girls I work with offered to come with me but it won&#039;t be the same. I have just known these girls a couple of months really so it just wouldn&#039;t feel the same. I am not looking forward to wedding dress shopping so much because of this.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;any of you girls have gone by yourselves? just so I know I wouldn&#039;t be the only person doing this.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846027,"PostDate":1398343309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have yet to buy my dress. I have went looking a couple of times but it's not the same when I go myself. My fianc\u00e9 and I just moved to a new province and I don't know many people here. The couple of girls I work with offered to come with me but it won't be the same. I have just known these girls a couple of months really so it just wouldn't feel the same. I am not looking forward to wedding dress shopping so much because of this.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>any of you girls have gone by yourselves? just so I know I wouldn't be the only person doing this.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd1318f62149daa70dd0496ce685ca21","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a dress that I love in my head but I have yet to try it on. I love this dress. Hope it&#039;s flattering when I finally hunt it down and try it on.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":27644,"Name":"Dress.gif","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277264-0-56821900-1398374270.gif.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-277264-0-56821900-1398374270_thumb.gif.png","Width":346,"Height":500}],"Id":1846084,"PostDate":1398359874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a dress that I love in my head but I have yet to try it on. I love this dress. Hope it's flattering when I finally hunt it down and try it on.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"562c5fe0d161df60b0ec1e9b246c8473","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kcole123\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That is GORGEOUS!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846086,"PostDate":1398360146,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277264-kcole123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kcole123<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is GORGEOUS!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01097ecfe60541922ea5a141e4a368f2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;thanks @[member=\"forevertogether\"]. I just hope it will look nice on me. I am calling a couple of shops today in the Edmonton area that carries Da Vinci dresses and hopefully they will have this particular one there. I will try it on and then maybe order it online because most likely it will be cheaper that way. But I have to see what it looks like on first. I am not a dare devil to just order it and hope for the best.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846180,"PostDate":1398420974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277216\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277216-forevertogether\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">forevertogether<\/span><\/a>. I just hope it will look nice on me. I am calling a couple of shops today in the Edmonton area that carries Da Vinci dresses and hopefully they will have this particular one there. I will try it on and then maybe order it online because most likely it will be cheaper that way. But I have to see what it looks like on first. I am not a dare devil to just order it and hope for the best.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Kristy and Nathan<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Melia Caribe Tropical <\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>April 17, 2015<\/strong>","Email":"colek_64@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"199.180.174.8","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395332214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277264.jpg?_r=1429937323","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kcole123","Id":277264,"Name":"kcole123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b91ff52f4f6981f0ebde8c0a87f5b5f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kcole123\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t blame you! I&#039;d never be brave enough for that either!!! It&#039;s too dangerous!! Especially for a wedding gown!! It&#039;s way too important of a decision for bravery!!! :) &amp;nbsp;I really hope it works out for you!! I love the dress and I&#039;m sure you&#039;ll look beautiful no matter which dress you choose!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1846181,"PostDate":1398421121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277264\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277264-kcole123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kcole123<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I don't blame you! I'd never be brave enough for that either!!! It's too dangerous!! Especially for a wedding gown!! It's way too important of a decision for bravery!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I really hope it works out for you!! I love the dress and I'm sure you'll look beautiful no matter which dress you choose!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2345d990aaab63de5db4a2ae99f5513b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I got the call yesterday my dress is in and I need to make an appointment to go see it and try it on. I&#039;m nervous that I won&#039;t fit it in and that I might not love it as much as I did when I bought it, It was 7 months ago. &amp;nbsp;Ahh the anxiety is too much. I guess its salads and watching what I eat from now on, seriously. lol&amp;nbsp; :rolleyes:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s my dress. &amp;nbsp;I still love it in the picture but will I love it on me. &amp;nbsp;Crossing my fingers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":27646,"Name":"Dress1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264077-0-08258200-1398436409.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-264077-0-08258200-1398436409_thumb.jpg","Width":581,"Height":1032}],"Id":1846187,"PostDate":1398422059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I got the call yesterday my dress is in and I need to make an appointment to go see it and try it on. I'm nervous that I won't fit it in and that I might not love it as much as I did when I bought it, It was 7 months ago. \u00a0Ahh the anxiety is too much. I guess its salads and watching what I eat from now on, seriously. lol\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/><\/p>\n<p>Here's my dress. \u00a0I still love it in the picture but will I love it on me. \u00a0Crossing my fingers.\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.114.98.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91ceab9af06dccd678b7448a4fd47585","RawContent":"@[member=\"NJBride2014\"] - it&#039;s GORGEOUS! I can&#039;t wait to see it on you.\n\n[quote name=\"NJBride2014\" post=\"1846187\" timestamp=\"1398436459\"]\nSo I got the call yesterday my dress is in and I need to make an appointment to go see it and try it on. I&#039;m nervous that I won&#039;t fit it in and that I might not love it as much as I did when I bought it, It was 7 months ago.  Ahh the anxiety is too much. I guess its salads and watching what I eat from now on, seriously. lol  :rolleyes:\nHere&#039;s my dress.  I still love it in the picture but will I love it on me.  Crossing my fingers.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1846195,"PostDate":1398423413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"264077\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/264077-njbride2014\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">NJBride2014<\/span><\/a> - it's GORGEOUS! I can't wait to see it on you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>NJBride2014, on 25 April 2014 - 10:34 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I got the call yesterday my dress is in and I need to make an appointment to go see it and try it on. I'm nervous that I won't fit it in and that I might not love it as much as I did when I bought it, It was 7 months ago. \u00a0Ahh the anxiety is too much. I guess its salads and watching what I eat from now on, seriously. lol\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/rolleyes.gif' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':rolleyes:' \/><\/p>\n<p>Here's my dress. \u00a0I still love it in the picture but will I love it on me. \u00a0Crossing my fingers.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.30.25.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1398424037,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":fa