/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"83923308576a79805d832e3daa696e0d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;That is so cute!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you!!! You do as well!!! I love the ruffles in your dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844242,"PostDate":1397471873,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is so cute!!!<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277031\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277031-mrandmrsbonitto2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">MrandMrsBonitto2016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!!! You do as well!!! I love the ruffles in your dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.221.122.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f9f7a13489b937226d7c524d792b59f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cubanaboliviana\"] thank you! the back is what sold it for me! and I absolutely love the bottom of your dress. I originially was trying to find a stella york&amp;nbsp;dress with a similar bottom but no where around me had one that I could try on. It looks so light weight for july!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844244,"PostDate":1397472311,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277561\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277561-cubanaboliviana\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cubanaboliviana<\/span><\/a> thank you! the back is what sold it for me! and I absolutely love the bottom of your dress. I originially was trying to find a stella york\u00a0dress with a similar bottom but no where around me had one that I could try on. It looks so light weight for july!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rednlovinit21@verizon.net","IpAddress":"173.221.122.142","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1382439065,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274449.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rednlovinit21","Id":274449,"Name":"rednlovinit21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1398350680,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d9827c6d67109e33577751379606610","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I need some help. I think I&#039;m in love.... times 3. I&#039;m so torn. The Allure might be too fru fruy (??) for Mexico. The Crawley I&#039;m not sure I like the closed back even though I love everything else about it and the Picabo I would add the optional cap sleeves to make it a keyhole back because I&#039;m absolutely in love with that style. I know I&#039;m going to do something with colour, either a champagne or a blush but definitely colour.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Comments????? Please????&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845829,"PostDate":1398267683,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I need some help. I think I'm in love.... times 3. I'm so torn. The Allure might be too fru fruy (??) for Mexico. The Crawley I'm not sure I like the closed back even though I love everything else about it and the Picabo I would add the optional cap sleeves to make it a keyhole back because I'm absolutely in love with that style. I know I'm going to do something with colour, either a champagne or a blush but definitely colour.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Comments????? Please????<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1845829]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-86351800-1398281882.jpg\" title=\"Allure 8955.jpg -  153.78KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-86351800-1398281882.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Allure 8955.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1845829]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-78473100-1398281896.jpg\" title=\"Crawley.jpg -  42.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-78473100-1398281896.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Crawley.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1845829]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-68865300-1398281914.jpg\" title=\"Picabo.jpg -  45.56KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-232000-0-68865300-1398281914.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Picabo.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"347449db62b45ddd37b667aa7743c8ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are all gorgeous!!! You&#039;ve got a hard decision ahead of you!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Personally, I would go with option 3 just because it seems less poofy of the 3... And I&#039;m not a poofy kinda girl... But no matter which one you choose, I know you&#039;ll look beautiful!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, stay true to your own style, go with something that you can be comfortable in and feel the most beautiful!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know this wasn&#039;t very much help!!! SORRY! :) &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good LUCK!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845834,"PostDate":1398267975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are all gorgeous!!! You've got a hard decision ahead of you!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Personally, I would go with option 3 just because it seems less poofy of the 3... And I'm not a poofy kinda girl... But no matter which one you choose, I know you'll look beautiful!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Most importantly, stay true to your own style, go with something that you can be comfortable in and feel the most beautiful!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know this wasn't very much help!!! SORRY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good LUCK!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3964289e2ca6de4511f11c0a02ee156f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"forevertogether\" post=\"1845834\" timestamp=\"1398282375\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"]\n\nThese are all gorgeous!!! You&#039;ve got a hard decision ahead of you!!!\n\nPersonally, I would go with option 3 just because it seems less poofy of the 3... And I&#039;m not a poofy kinda girl... But no matter which one you choose, I know you&#039;ll look beautiful!!! \n\nMost importantly, stay true to your own style, go with something that you can be comfortable in and feel the most beautiful!!\n\nI know this wasn&#039;t very much help!!! SORRY! :)\n\nGood LUCK![\/quote]\nI know about the choice! lol No idea what I&#039;m going to do. But I agree about option 3, just adding the keyhole back to it. My wedding dress when we got married was so simple and very plain even though I totally loved it! Since our vow renewal is going to be a celebration of life too I want his jaw to drop! lol I want drama! Now to find it.....","Attachments":[],"Id":1845837,"PostDate":1398268217,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>forevertogether, on 23 April 2014 - 03:46 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These are all gorgeous!!! You've got a hard decision ahead of you!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Personally, I would go with option 3 just because it seems less poofy of the 3... And I'm not a poofy kinda girl... But no matter which one you choose, I know you'll look beautiful!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Most importantly, stay true to your own style, go with something that you can be comfortable in and feel the most beautiful!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know this wasn't very much help!!! SORRY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good LUCK!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know about the choice! lol No idea what I'm going to do. But I agree about option 3, just adding the keyhole back to it. My wedding dress when we got married was so simple and very plain even though I totally loved it! Since our vow renewal is going to be a celebration of life too I want his jaw to drop! lol I want drama! Now to find it.....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0ef8ea85def1c360c3423c9c137e8a7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"acw271011\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I agree!!! Since you&#039;re looking for the WOW factor... #1 or #2... I&#039;m torn! They are so beautiful!! I&#039;m loving the sleeves on #2 and the fitted silhouette is beautiful!! OK I just fell in love with #2!! My vote is on 2!!! Good thing I already paid for my dress in full otherwise, I may have considered switching! LOL!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845849,"PostDate":1398269605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree!!! Since you're looking for the WOW factor... #1 or #2... I'm torn! They are so beautiful!! I'm loving the sleeves on #2 and the fitted silhouette is beautiful!! OK I just fell in love with #2!! My vote is on 2!!! Good thing I already paid for my dress in full otherwise, I may have considered switching! LOL!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bambiderby@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.132.110.2","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1395161860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277216.jpg?_r=1395766815","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":218,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"forevertogether","Id":277216,"Name":"forevertogether","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.138.102.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6864ee0bba818b52b64daeb118ee2a87","RawContent":"I love 1 and 2! I think I slightly prefer 2 just because of the drama :)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1845856,"PostDate":1398271581,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love 1 and 2! I think I slightly prefer 2 just because of the drama <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383890954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60eae762ae0130957b82862f573ff887","RawContent":"[quote name=\"forevertogether\" post=\"1845849\" timestamp=\"1398284005\"]\n@[member=\"acw271011\"]\n\nI agree!!! Since you&#039;re looking for the WOW factor... #1 or #2... I&#039;m torn! They are so beautiful!! I&#039;m loving the sleeves on #2 and the fitted silhouette is beautiful!! OK I just fell in love with #2!! My vote is on 2!!! Good thing I already paid for my dress in full otherwise, I may have considered switching! LOL!!![\/quote]\nThe thing is these aren&#039;t the final choices! lol  I&#039;m looking through 4 different designers - Essense, Allure, Mori Lee and David Tutera for Mon Cheri. These 3 are top contenders but it will come down to the trying on, and that again won&#039;t be until after the next surgery. No point otherwise. I know I&#039;m leaning towards a couple of styles. The ruffles as long as there is bling! The keyhole back, again with bling. And strapless drop waist. Essense has 2 beautiful ones that are in colour. I figure anything I find I&#039;ll probably take a layer of crinoline out of to tone it down and so that it won&#039;t be so hot. Plus the fabric for Mexico in October, which usually is still pretty warm. Chiffon is out though!! I got married in chiffon so it&#039;s a definite no go!!! Has to be a lot blingier (?)","Attachments":[],"Id":1845859,"PostDate":1398272260,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>forevertogether, on 23 April 2014 - 04:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"232000\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/232000-acw271011\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">acw271011<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I agree!!! Since you're looking for the WOW factor... #1 or #2... I'm torn! They are so beautiful!! I'm loving the sleeves on #2 and the fitted silhouette is beautiful!! OK I just fell in love with #2!! My vote is on 2!!! Good thing I already paid for my dress in full otherwise, I may have considered switching! LOL!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The thing is these aren't the final choices! lol\u00a0 I'm\u00a0looking through 4 different designers - Essense, Allure, Mori Lee and David Tutera for Mon Cheri. These 3 are top contenders but it will come down to the trying on, and that again won't be until after the next surgery. No point otherwise. I know I'm leaning towards a couple of styles. The ruffles as long as there is bling! The keyhole back, again with bling. And strapless drop waist. Essense has 2 beautiful ones that are in colour. I figure anything I find I'll probably take a layer of crinoline out of to tone it down and so that it won't be so hot. Plus the fabric for Mexico in October, which usually is still pretty warm. Chiffon is out though!! I got married in chiffon so it's a definite no go!!! Has to be a lot blingier (?)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.229.104.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f01a3bc6955eb3b24bee1c2a7859ba1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I wanna see!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845951,"PostDate":1398294988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I wanna see!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"malyna@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.235.105.205","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397425622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277580.jpg?_r=1397779480","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"malyna","Id":277580,"Name":"malyna","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7930,"NextPage":7940,"PreviousPage":7920,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
