l-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.138.102.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88634ad01f03550e37ae3b9e15d78308","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AllieH\" post=\"1843193\" timestamp=\"1396967400\"]\nlove the ruffles!![\/quote]Thank you!!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1843362,"PostDate":1397009627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AllieH, on 08 April 2014 - 10:30 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>love the ruffles!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThank you!!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rvalenka@gmail.com","IpAddress":"166.137.12.120","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383890954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274900.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rvalenka","Id":274900,"Name":"rvalenka","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"252637a7f0a6b8247bc64f9d432d750f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LilyPotter\"] This dress is gorg!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843602,"PostDate":1397121048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276952-lilypotter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LilyPotter<\/span><\/a> This dress is gorg!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3fd6ec11869f6c7e9fa7f70af96ebfd7","RawContent":"I just bought my dress! Haha within the first week of getting engaged, I was already making dress appointments :D . I think buying the dress was one of the things I was most looking forward to!\n \nI debated a while about what style to get, but then decided to go w\/ the shape I love but still try to keep it light weight. I got lucky and scored a Monique Lhuillier sample! It&#039;s the Sahara from her 2012 collection. I LOVE it and cannot wait to wear it - it&#039;s very light and romantic, which is exactly what I wanted. And I&#039;m so happy with what I paid\n\n\n[img]http:\/\/www.idealbridemagazine.co.uk\/img\/dress_enlargement\/monique-lhuillier\/sahara.jpg[\/img]\n\n\n\nThe other dress I was in love with was a Martina Liana, but I was afraid the fabric was going to be too heavy for Mexico, so I decided to get the ML Sahara. If I was having my wedding in November in Toronto, I would have gotten this one:\n\n[img]http:\/\/3.bp.blogspot.com\/-zPG6nZJ1oac\/UOx-QVO4csI\/AAAAAAAATnI\/J3o8MwrEK3M\/s1600\/wedding-dresses-martina-liana-2013-style-444_alt2_zoom.jpg[\/img]\n[quote name=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\" post=\"1843075\" timestamp=\"1396895160\"]\n@[member=\"Tammy Host\"] Very cute.\n\nWhat do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?\n\n@[member=\"LilyPotter\"] did you order online or at a shop? I can&#039;t find a shop that has this brand:([\/quote]\nI love blush dresses! I think they are so gorgeous and romantic. My all time favourite dream dress is the Monique Lhuillier Peony in blush if i could afford it!\n\nI was very close to getting one, but I&#039;ve found the quality makes a huge difference. I tried on 2 Maggie Sottero blush ones that were AMAZING in real life and I was so close to buying one. But in pics, it didn&#039;t look as nice and even looked a bit tacky\/cheap. So I decided to go away from it.\n\nIf you go blush, try to see if the salon will let you take pics so you can see how it will look in pictures","Attachments":[],"Id":1843656,"PostDate":1397130296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just bought my dress! Haha within the first week of getting engaged, I was already making dress appointments <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> . I think buying the dress was one of the things I was most looking forward to!<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I debated a while about what style to get, but then decided to go w\/ the shape I love but still try to keep it light weight. I got lucky and scored a Monique Lhuillier sample! It's the Sahara from her 2012 collection. I LOVE it and cannot wait to wear it - it's very light and romantic, which is exactly what I wanted. And I'm so happy with what I paid<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.idealbridemagazine.co.uk\/img\/dress_enlargement\/monique-lhuillier\/sahara.jpg\" alt=\"sahara.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The other dress I was in love with was a Martina Liana, but I was afraid the fabric was going to be too heavy for Mexico, so I decided to get the ML Sahara. If I was having my wedding in November in Toronto, I would have gotten this one:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/3.bp.blogspot.com\/-zPG6nZJ1oac\/UOx-QVO4csI\/AAAAAAAATnI\/J3o8MwrEK3M\/s1600\/wedding-dresses-martina-liana-2013-style-444_alt2_zoom.jpg\" alt=\"wedding-dresses-martina-liana-2013-style\"><\/span><\/p>\n<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrandMrsBonitto2016, on 07 April 2014 - 02:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@Tammy Host Very cute.<\/p>\n<br><p>What do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276952-lilypotter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LilyPotter<\/span><\/a> did you order online or at a shop? I can't find a shop that has this brand:(<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I love blush dresses! I think they are so gorgeous and romantic. My all time favourite dream dress is the Monique Lhuillier Peony in blush if i could afford it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was very close to getting one, but I've found the quality makes a huge difference. I tried on 2 Maggie Sottero blush ones that were AMAZING in real life and I was so close to buying one. But in pics, it didn't look as nice and even looked a bit tacky\/cheap. So I decided to go away from it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you go blush, try to see if the salon will let you take pics so you can see how it will look in pictures<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395594948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1600bc7a48dad98c174f220c940fb670","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] I love your choice! It&#039;s perfect and absolutely beautiful!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843661,"PostDate":1397130756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\