  So many gorgeous dresses!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crspoon10@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.227.116.159","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1388235069,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"crspoon10","Id":275760,"Name":"crspoon10","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1393665978,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f01f1ed7f05fd4f64063348a9122bd2d","RawContent":"Here is my beautiful Mori Lee Voyage gown! \n\n\nI wanted something beachy yet formal, but when I saw this dress, I fell in love and could not think about anything else! I&#039;m really offbeat, and with my undercut, tattoos and royal blue shoes, this was just the dress for me! Somewhat simple, but I can really pump it up with accessories and my personality! \n\n\nAs soon as I get it, I&#039;ll post with me in it :)\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nHmmm... How do I upload so the pics show without the downloading part? New to this! ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1836104,"PostDate":1393665500,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is my beautiful Mori Lee Voyage gown! <br><br>\nI wanted something beachy yet formal, but when I saw this dress, I fell in love and could not think about anything else! I'm really offbeat, and with my undercut, tattoos and royal blue shoes, this was just the dress for me! Somewhat simple, but I can really pump it up with accessories and my personality! <br><br>\nAs soon as I get it, I'll post with me in it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1836104]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-82652400-1393679121.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  163.36KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-82652400-1393679121.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1836104]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-54857200-1393679404.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  89.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-54857200-1393679404.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1836104]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-16488600-1393680343.jpg\" title=\"image.jpg -  149.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-276952-0-16488600-1393680343.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"image.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nHmmm... How do I upload so the pics show without the downloading part? New to this! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"July 14th 2014, Taveuni Island, Fiji ","Email":"lilyaltier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393663563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276952.jpg?_r=1393789452","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilyPotter","Id":276952,"Name":"LilyPotter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"588c9e6feb91e60dcaccb3e426921016","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LilyPotter\" post=\"1836104\" timestamp=\"1393679900\"]\nHere is my beautiful Mori Lee Voyage gown!\n\nI wanted something beachy yet formal, but when I saw this dress, I fell in love and could not think about anything else! I&#039;m really offbeat, and with my undercut, tattoos and royal blue shoes, this was just the dress for me! Somewhat simple, but I can really pump it up with accessories and my personality!\n\nAs soon as I get it, I&#039;ll post with me in it :)[\/quote]\nThe dress! Finally figured out how to post pics! :) \n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74290]\nFront of dress.\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74291]\nDetails of the front.\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74292]\nBack of the dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1838285,"PostDate":1394881103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>LilyPotter, on 01 March 2014 - 09:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Here is my beautiful Mori Lee Voyage gown!<br><br>\nI wanted something beachy yet formal, but when I saw this dress, I fell in love and could not think about anything else! I'm really offbeat, and with my undercut, tattoos and royal blue shoes, this was just the dress for me! Somewhat simple, but I can really pump it up with accessories and my personality!<br><br>\nAs soon as I get it, I'll post with me in it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The dress! Finally figured out how to post pics! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74290-mori-lee-style-6772\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17593\/sml_gallery_276952_17593_444365.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Mori Lee style 6772'  width='134' height='200'  alt='Mori Lee style 6772' id='sml_image_view_74290' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>Front of dress.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74291-mori-lee-style-6772\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17593\/sml_gallery_276952_17593_149099.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Mori Lee style 6772'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Mori Lee style 6772' id='sml_image_view_74291' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>Details of the front.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74292-mori-lee-style-6772\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17593\/sml_gallery_276952_17593_16405.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Mori Lee style 6772'  width='151' height='200'  alt='Mori Lee style 6772' id='sml_image_view_74292' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>Back of the dress.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"July 14th 2014, Taveuni Island, Fiji ","Email":"lilyaltier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393663563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276952.jpg?_r=1393789452","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilyPotter","Id":276952,"Name":"LilyPotter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.108.212.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1396740020,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b89a41e354d9dcb88685774beb6b145e","RawContent":"Pardon the look on my face lol dress shopping takes a lot out of you!","Attachments":[{"Id":27317,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-268382-0-39304400-1396754415.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2014\/post-268382-0-39304400-1396754415_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200}],"Id":1842868,"PostDate":1396739991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body 