/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74832-dress-from-back\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17638\/sml_gallery_276400_17638_1396780.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Dress from back'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Dress from back' id='sml_image_view_74832' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74831-dress-from-front\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17638\/sml_gallery_276400_17638_1284803.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Dress from front'  width='150' height='200'  alt='Dress from front' id='sml_image_view_74831' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tebbswedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"137.186.146.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391033009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276400.jpg?_r=1396405141","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LissaSou","Id":276400,"Name":"LissaSou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"161.185.157.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a03070c60c6a6f65ce89ece34860d3d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Tammy Host\"] Very cute.&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;What do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LilyPotter\"] did you order online or at a shop? I can&#039;t find a shop that has this brand:(&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843075,"PostDate":1396880760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Tammy Host Very cute.<\/p>\n<br \/><p>What do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?<\/p>\n<br \/><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276952-lilypotter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LilyPotter<\/span><\/a> did you order online or at a shop? I can't find a shop that has this brand:(<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 Future Mrs. Bonitto 10\/14\/16<\/p>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.theknot.com\/?utm_source=ticker&utm_medium=UBB&utm_campaign=tickers\"><img src=\"http:\/\/global.theknot.com\/tickers\/tt1c2490.aspx\" alt=\"tt1c2490.aspx\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"shamicaglover@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"161.185.157.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1394118776,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277031.jpg?_r=1397251056","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":203,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","Id":277031,"Name":"MrandMrsBonitto2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d37bab65616610a72d85a3e76116e95e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MrandMrsBonitto2016\" post=\"1843075\" timestamp=\"1396895160\"]\n@[member=\"Tammy Host\"] Very cute.\n\nWhat do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?\n\n@[member=\"LilyPotter\"] did you order online or at a shop? I can&#039;t find a shop that has this brand:([\/quote]\nI ordered it at [url=\"http:\/\/madamebridal.com\/\"]Madame Bridal[\/url] (Madame Butterfly)!!! They are a certified Mori Lee retailer, that has both an online- and a Florida-based shop :) I ordered it early February, and got it late March! I think they rushed it for me, since I kept nagging about when they expected to ship it x) I was told late April\/early May, but it arrived as a complete surprise in March!\n\nI&#039;m going to get some alterations early May, so I&#039;ll post pics with me in it then! Oh, and the dress is 100% more flattering on an actual person, than the superskinny, supertall model ;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1843114,"PostDate":1396895276,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrandMrsBonitto2016, on 07 April 2014 - 02:26 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@Tammy Host Very cute.<\/p>\n<br><p>What do you ladies think of blush dresses? Yah or Nah?<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276952-lilypotter\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LilyPotter<\/span><\/a> did you order online or at a shop? I can't find a shop that has this brand:(<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I ordered it at <a href='http:\/\/madamebridal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Madame Bridal<\/a> (Madame Butterfly)!!! They are a certified Mori Lee retailer, that has both an online- and a Florida-based shop <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I ordered it early February, and got it late March! I think they rushed it for me, since I kept nagging about when they expected to ship it x) I was told late April\/early May, but it arrived as a complete surprise in March!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm going to get some alterations early May, so I'll post pics with me in it then! Oh, and the dress is 100% more flattering on an actual person, than the superskinny, supertall model <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"July 14th 2014, Taveuni Island, Fiji ","Email":"lilyaltier@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"79.160.23.45","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393663563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276952.jpg?_r=1393789452","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LilyPotter","Id":276952,"Name":"LilyPotter","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7900,"NextPage":7910,"PreviousPage":7890,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
