,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa92bca6ae972fd68116facfce4c2660","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My dress- by David Tutera...Florrie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":25859,"Name":"florrie.PNG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-275695-0-19952100-1390318152.png","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_01_2014\/post-275695-0-19952100-1390318152_thumb.png","Width":351,"Height":499}],"Id":1827745,"PostDate":1390303773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My dress- by David Tutera...Florrie<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"talicea7812@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.114.237.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387560154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275695.jpg?_r=1398892094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"talicea7812","Id":275695,"Name":"talicea7812","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.15.160.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3640a252811d4941d588933ab1323fb","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kdnolan\" post=\"1826109\" timestamp=\"1389764186\"]\nI have a Mori Lee dress ordered and can&#039;t wait to get it![\/quote]I alos have a mori lee dress!!  Its at the bridal store now!! and its so hard not to want to go there everyday and try it on again and again!  I start fittings next month!  Will post pics after the wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":1828874,"PostDate":1390733183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kdnolan, on 15 January 2014 - 01:36 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have a Mori Lee dress ordered and can't wait to get it!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I alos have a mori lee dress!! \u00a0Its at the bridal store now!! and its so hard not to want to go there everyday and try it on again and again! \u00a0I start fittings next month! \u00a0Will post pics after the wedding!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angus.kayla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"12.15.160.6","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1363593213,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267482.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"soontobeawalsh","Id":267482,"Name":"soontobeawalsh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.157.37.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"640201e99592441cadcbd44e61db57e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have a martina liana dress style number 474 the picture doesn&#039;t really do it justice..look so much better irl&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1828929,"PostDate":1390755427,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have a martina liana dress style number 474 the picture doesn't really do it justice..look so much better irl<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaclynwalsh@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"162.157.37.105","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389818975,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276121.jpg?_r=1391065312","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jwalsh","Id":276121,"Name":"jwalsh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c09cdebab1ad170cd2e086143e817248","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I&#039;m rather behind in my planning. I hadn&#039;t realized how far behind I was until I was finally able to go dress shopping last week. The wedding is 4\/19\/2014, so less than three months. Turns out it usually takes 6-8 months to get a dress. Surprise!&amp;nbsp; :blink:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The dress shops I went to we&#039;re giving me limited selections to try on as they wouldn&#039;t be able to order them in time and the selection wasn&#039;t all that great. I had a general idea of what I was looking for and they didn&#039;t have it. Everyone says you know the dress when you put it on but I wasn&#039;t getting that. I had originally fallen in love with the Justin Alexander 9552&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73583]&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But the only shop nearby that carried it gave me the runaround for months. So I gave up&amp;nbsp; :(&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let&#039;s just say I began to get slightly worried. So I went to a shop that I had been trying to get to for about 6 months and the first dress I saw, I fell in love! It was everything I wanted! Turned out they just received the dress as it is the 2014 line and they can have it in by the beginning of March! Hooorrraaayyy!We were meant to be&amp;nbsp; :D&amp;nbsp;I don&#039;t have any pics on here of me trying it on but here&#039;s from the website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73584]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:73585]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1829706,"PostDate":1391005818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I'm rather behind in my planning. I hadn't realized how far behind I was until I was finally able to go dress shopping last week. The wedding is 4\/19\/2014, so less than three months. Turns out it usually takes 6-8 months to get a dress. Surprise!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/><\/p>\n<p>The dress shops I went to we're giving me limited selections to try on as they wouldn't be able to order them in time and the selection wasn't all that great. I had a general idea of what I was looking for and they didn't have it. Everyone says you know the dress when you put it on but I wasn't getting that. I had originally fallen in love with the Justin Alexander 9552\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/73583-justin-alexander-ball-gown-9552-ivory-2010-79621\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17544\/sml_gallery_271167_17544_14775.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Justin Alexander Ball Gown 9552 Ivory 2010 79621'  width='200' height='150'  alt='Justin Alexander Ball Gown 9552 Ivory 2010 79621' id='sml_image_view_73583' \/><\/a>\n<br \/>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.justinale...ng_dresses\/9552<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But the only shop nearby that carried it gave me the runaround for months. So I gave up\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let's just say I began to get slightly worried. So I went to a shop that I had been trying to get to for about 6 months and the first dress I saw, I fell in love! It was everything I wanted! Turned out they just received the dress as it is the 2014 line and they can have it in by the beginning of March! Hooorrraaayyy!We were meant to be\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0I don't have any pics on here of me trying it on but here's from the website.\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/73584-allure-2701\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17544\/sml_gallery_271167_17544_83472.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Allure 2701'  width='160' height='200'  alt='Allure 2701' id='sml_image_view_73584' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/73585-2701b\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17544\/sml_gallery_271167_17544_84058.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='2701B'  width='160' height='200'  alt='2701B' id='sml_image_view_73585' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.allurebri...m\/products\/2701<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifermemet@gmail.com","IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372875987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271167.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferM","Id":271167,"Name":"JenniferM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.114.98.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0d39f35ae587fd078a0a4f0a7b4904c","RawContent":"it&#039;s GORGEOUS!!!!!\n[quote name=\"JenniferM\" post=\"1829706\" timestamp=\"1391020218\"]\nSo I&#039;m rather behind in my planning. I hadn&#039;t realized how far behind I was until I was finally able to go dress shopping last week. The wedding is 4\/19\/2014, so less than three months. Turns out it usually takes 6-8 months to get a dress. Surprise!  :blink:\nThe dress shops I went to we&#039;re giving me limited selections to try on as they wouldn&#039;t be able to order them in time and the selection wasn&#039;t all that great. I had a general idea of what I was looking for and they didn&#039;t have it. Everyone says you know the dress when you put it on but I wasn&#039;t getting that. I had originally fallen in love with the Justin Alexander 9552 \n\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552\"]http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552[\/url]\n\n\nBut the only shop nearby that carried it gave me the runaround for months. So I gave up  :(\n\n\nLet&#039;s just say I began to get slightly worried. So I went to a shop that I had been trying to get to for about 6 months and the first dress I saw, I fell in love! It was everything I wanted! Turned out they just received the dress as it is the 2014 line and they can have it in by the beginning of March! Hooorrraaayyy!We were meant to be  :D I don&#039;t have any pics on here of me trying it on but here&#039;s from the website. \n\n\n\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701\"]http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701[\/url][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1830016,"PostDate":1391085055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>it's GORGEOUS!!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JenniferM, on 29 January 2014 - 02:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So I'm rather behind in my planning. I hadn't realized how far behind I was until I was finally able to go dress shopping last week. The wedding is 4\/19\/2014, so less than three months. Turns out it usually takes 6-8 months to get a dress. Surprise!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/blink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':blink:' \/><\/p>\n<p>The dress shops I went to we're giving me limited selections to try on as they wouldn't be able to order them in time and the selection wasn't all that great. I had a general idea of what I was looking for and they didn't have it. Everyone says you know the dress when you put it on but I wasn't getting that. I had originally fallen in love with the Justin Alexander 9552\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a href='http:\/\/www.justinalexanderbridal.com\/signature_wedding_dresses\/9552' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.justinale...ng_dresses\/9552<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But the only shop nearby that carried it gave me the runaround for months. So I gave up\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let's just say I began to get slightly worried. So I went to a shop that I had been trying to get to for about 6 months and the first dress I saw, I fell in love! It was everything I wanted! Turned out they just received the dress as it is the 2014 line and they can have it in by the beginning of March! Hooorrraaayyy!We were meant to be\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0I don't have any pics on here of me trying it on but here's from the website.\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.allurebridals.com\/products\/2701' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.allurebri...m\/products\/2701<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fede1abfc76aa9136bb08a4d228171a3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"AllieH\"] Thanks! I originally thought it would be too much for El Dorado but I don&#039;t care. I love it too much. I&#039;m sad I only get to wear it the one day&amp;nbsp; :( Maybe we can have an AHR&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1830085,"PostDate":1391092783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"241884\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/241884-allieh\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AllieH<\/span><\/a> Thanks! I originally thought it would be too much for El Dorado but I don't care. I love it too much. I'm sad I only get to wear it the one day\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> Maybe we can have an AHR\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifermemet@gmail.com","IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372875987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271167.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferM","Id":271167,"Name":"JenniferM","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7890,"NextPage":7900,"PreviousPage":7880,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
