{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88648e57bc77096ee6fcadf8598cb5f8","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7670#post_1958483\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my dress&amp;nbsp;and belt&amp;nbsp;I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.&amp;nbsp; This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.&amp;nbsp; Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Here are some pictures with me in it.&amp;nbsp;Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.&amp;nbsp; Also this is not the veil since they didn&#039;t have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.&amp;nbsp; I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I&#039;m busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.&amp;nbsp; What do you guys think?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love your dress! The straps a beautiful. Who is the designer?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811009,"PostDate":1383305103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7670#post_1958483\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my dress\u00a0and belt\u00a0I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.\u00a0 This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.\u00a0 I'm glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.\u00a0 Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>Here are some pictures with me in it.\u00a0Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.\u00a0 Also this is not the veil since they didn't have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.\u00a0 I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I'm busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.\u00a0 What do you guys think?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>I love your dress! The straps a beautiful. Who is the designer?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krisdaversa@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"70.29.31.208","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382024686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274333.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"krisdaversa","Id":274333,"Name":"krisdaversa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"770527b3cf96fec0407a9883f9171b74","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7690#post_1959079\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;krisdaversa&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;I love your dress! The straps a beautiful. Who is the designer?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks!&amp;nbsp; The designer is Pronovias and the style is Land its from their new 2014 collection.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1811035,"PostDate":1383308192,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7690#post_1959079\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>krisdaversa<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>I love your dress! The straps a beautiful. Who is the designer?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Thanks!\u00a0 The designer is Pronovias and the style is Land its from their new 2014 collection.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPos