 Image'  \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephanie@durhamtravel.ca","IpAddress":"70.31.37.164","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1353620232,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262602.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"STemple","Id":262602,"Name":"STemple","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33a437e15ad295cf9825325cbf1b35dc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I recieved my dress on time and conviently packed into its box. It is absolutley beautiful I could not ask for anything more elegant and wonderful. I will be very proud to wear this dress on my big day and I am so glad I had the guts to just order it!! It saved me a lot of money.&amp;nbsp;You will be surprised. The quality of the dress far surpassed my expectations.You can get your perfect&amp;nbsp;weddingdress here.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:164pt\"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr style=\"height:15.0pt\"&gt; &lt;td style=\"height:15.0pt; width:164pt\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.vadress.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.vadress.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/tbody&gt; &lt;\/table&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1816986,"PostDate":1385433953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n              