{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"612f152c9107e3dd6cbcd777c7322feb","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957296\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;What a unique dress! It fits your beautifully! You can tell you love the dress - you&#039;re glowing :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810420,"PostDate":1383066222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7650#post_1957296\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"> <p>What a unique dress! It fits your beautifully! You can tell you love the dress - you're glowing <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chantel.c.short@gmail.com","IpAddress":"207.47.253.12","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357902437,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264260.jpg?_r=1398219642","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Chantel","Id":264260,"Name":"Chantel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49664b1ea2f1672c47506978642e5444","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7670#post_1958483\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my dress&amp;nbsp;and belt&amp;nbsp;I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.&amp;nbsp; This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.&amp;nbsp; Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Here are some pictures with me in it.&amp;nbsp;Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.&amp;nbsp; Also this is not the veil since they didn&#039;t have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.&amp;nbsp; I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I&#039;m busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.&amp;nbsp; What do you guys think?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love the straps of this dress and the belt. It&#039;s great for your bust.&amp;nbsp;Can I be honest? I think a lace veil clashes and you should go with a more simple veil without a lace trim but if you want a little something on it, you can get a veil with rhinestones on the trim or rhinestones scattered throughout. My dress was bust like this and had a lot going on. Your dress seems to have a textured change on the bottom. I think the lace on the veil too makes it look so busy and takes away from you. Just my opinion, hope you aren&#039;t offended. I love veils so even though I think a flower clip goes great with this dress, I can&#039;t discourage you from a veil totally lol. I think they look super in pictures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810426,"PostDate":1383068398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7670#post_1958483\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225268\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225268\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225267\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225267\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225269\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my dress\u00a0and belt\u00a0I love it so much totally not what I had pictured myself in but when I tried it on everything just worked so perfectly.\u00a0 This was mine and all my bridesmaids\/mother favorite dress.\u00a0 I'm glad to have this part or the wedding planning finally done with.\u00a0 Now just have to wait for it to come in uh 8 months is a long time.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225270\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225271\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"225272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/225272\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>Here are some pictures with me in it.\u00a0Note the the best pics because the sample dress was a couple sizes to small but you get the effect.\u00a0 Also this is not the veil since they didn't have the right veil that matched my lace but very close.\u00a0 I really wanted a lace dress with some kind of strap as I'm busty up top and also wanted a mermaid cut with a fun bottom and this dress was perfect for me.\u00a0 What do you guys think?<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I love the straps of this dress and the belt. It's great for your bust.\u00a0Can I be honest? I think a lace veil clashes and you should go with a more simple veil without a lace trim but if you want a little something on it, you can get a veil with rhinestones on the trim or rhinestones scattered throughout. My dress was bust like this and had a lot going on. Your dress seems to have a textured change on the bottom. I think the lace on the veil too makes it look so busy and takes away from you. Just my opinion, hope you aren't offended. I love veils so even though I think a flower clip goes great with this dress, I can't discourage you from a veil totally lol. I think they look super in pictures.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343669362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b62c6abfe990e7d8191a27811c2fb3c6","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958496\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;EVKnowsitall&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love the straps of this dress and the belt. It&#039;s great for your bust.&amp;nbsp;Can I be honest? I think a lace veil clashes and you should go with a more simple veil without a lace trim but if you want a little something on it, you can get a veil with rhinestones on the trim or rhinestones scattered throughout. My dress was bust like this and had a lot going on. Your dress seems to have a textured change on the bottom. I think the lace on the veil too makes it look so busy and takes away from you. Just my opinion, hope you aren&#039;t offended. I love veils so even though I think a flower clip goes great with this dress, I can&#039;t discourage you from a veil totally lol. I think they look super in pictures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks for being honest, its cool I actually agree the lace veil&amp;nbsp;is a little much with the lace dress. &amp;nbsp;I tried on two veils a much simpler one with no lace or embelishments and the one in the picture. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still not sure what i&#039;m doing yet about the veil but I have time to think about it. &amp;nbsp;I always wanted a lace veil because I thought it looked&amp;nbsp;romantic and very spanish which was the look I was going for but it might have to change that. &amp;nbsp;I agree with a veil looking good in pictures I mostly just want to wear it for the ceremony and for pictures on the beach.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810442,"PostDate":1383073347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958496\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>EVKnowsitall<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>I love the straps of this dress and the belt. It's great for your bust.\u00a0Can I be honest? I think a lace veil clashes and you should go with a more simple veil without a lace trim but if you want a little something on it, you can get a veil with rhinestones on the trim or rhinestones scattered throughout. My dress was bust like this and had a lot going on. Your dress seems to have a textured change on the bottom. I think the lace on the veil too makes it look so busy and takes away from you. Just my opinion, hope you aren't offended. I love veils so even though I think a flower clip goes great with this dress, I can't discourage you from a veil totally lol. I think they look super in pictures.\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Thanks for being honest, its cool I actually agree the lace veil\u00a0is a little much with the lace dress. \u00a0I tried on two veils a much simpler one with no lace or embelishments and the one in the picture. \u00a0I'm still not sure what i'm doing yet about the veil but I have time to think about it. \u00a0I always wanted a lace veil because I thought it looked\u00a0romantic and very spanish which was the look I was going for but it might have to change that. \u00a0I agree with a veil looking good in pictures I mostly just want to wear it for the ceremony and for pictures on the beach. \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34212dff74c374e90ae087f564737b77","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958512\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Thanks for being honest, its cool I actually agree the lace veil&amp;nbsp;is a little much with the lace dress. &amp;nbsp;I tried on two veils a much simpler one with no lace or embelishments and the one in the picture. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m still not sure what i&#039;m doing yet about the veil but I have time to think about it. &amp;nbsp;I always wanted a lace veil because I thought it looked&amp;nbsp;romantic and very spanish which was the look I was going for but it might have to change that. &amp;nbsp;I agree with a veil looking good in pictures I mostly just want to wear it for the ceremony and for pictures on the beach.   &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Whew! Ok LOL I am always scared to be honest on these boards. I love how I can look at different styles of dresses and like them for different reasons. I could never wear a simple gown or a poofy ball gown- but I love the way they look on others. I like your gown because it has a lot going on- I like variety- but mostly since I cannot decide and stick to one style myself. I like a visually stimulating dress and yours certainly is that. How are you planning to wear your hair? You need to showcase those straps! I had straps too but I&#039;m not a fan of up do&#039;s for my face so I did half up and half down. If you won&#039;t wear the veil long, I guess it doesn&#039;t matter. I love the romantic feel of lace and wanted a mantilla cathedral veil but it was too jarring with my dress.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810446,"PostDate":1383074445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958512\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Thanks for being honest, its cool I actually agree the lace veil\u00a0is a little much with the lace dress. \u00a0I tried on two veils a much simpler one with no lace or embelishments and the one in the picture. \u00a0I'm still not sure what i'm doing yet about the veil but I have time to think about it. \u00a0I always wanted a lace veil because I thought it looked\u00a0romantic and very spanish which was the look I was going for but it might have to change that. \u00a0I agree with a veil looking good in pictures I mostly just want to wear it for the ceremony and for pictures on the beach. \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Whew! Ok LOL I am always scared to be honest on these boards. I love how I can look at different styles of dresses and like them for different reasons. I could never wear a simple gown or a poofy ball gown- but I love the way they look on others. I like your gown because it has a lot going on- I like variety- but mostly since I cannot decide and stick to one style myself. I like a visually stimulating dress and yours certainly is that. How are you planning to wear your hair? You need to showcase those straps! I had straps too but I'm not a fan of up do's for my face so I did half up and half down. If you won't wear the veil long, I guess it doesn't matter. I love the romantic feel of lace and wanted a mantilla cathedral veil but it was too jarring with my dress.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343669362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e191a9c66494ac1e33b75e00b21e8bd6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love this dress! Where did you find it?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810461,"PostDate":1383079965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love this dress! Where did you find it?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thompson-karen@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.179.137.120","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1377036674,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272775.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsRoberts","Id":272775,"Name":"MrsRoberts","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57565b44b07672e4ac7a224923831f1b","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958516\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;EVKnowsitall&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Whew! Ok LOL I am always scared to be honest on these boards. I love how I can look at different styles of dresses and like them for different reasons. I could never wear a simple gown or a poofy ball gown- but I love the way they look on others. I like your gown because it has a lot going on- I like variety- but mostly since I cannot decide and stick to one style myself. I like a visually stimulating dress and yours certainly is that. How are you planning to wear your hair? You need to showcase those straps! I had straps too but I&#039;m not a fan of up do&#039;s for my face so I did half up and half down. If you won&#039;t wear the veil long, I guess it doesn&#039;t matter. I love the romantic feel of lace and wanted a mantilla cathedral veil but it was too jarring with my dress.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;LOL No, honesty is good that&#039;s what the board is for feedback and information.&amp;nbsp; Yeah I&#039;m not a ball gown or simple gown person myself I needed a little fun with my dress I mean you only get to wear a wedding dress once (hopefully) so I wanted something different.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not sure yet on the hair but maybe up for the cermony very soft looking so you can see the straps and the back of the dress which has nice buttons going&amp;nbsp; down the back with a simple veil might look nice.&amp;nbsp; Then for the reception put my hair down and leave it in soft beachy waves.&amp;nbsp; Half up Half down could work too but I might be too hot for the ceremony if I have it down.&amp;nbsp; I love the mantilla veil that was what I always wanted but things change and it doesn&#039;t go with my dress also I&#039;m getting married at the resort in&amp;nbsp;front of a gazebo I feel like the mantilla might be more suitable for a church setting.&amp;nbsp; So much to think about.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810520,"PostDate":1383128755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958516\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>EVKnowsitall<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Whew! Ok LOL I am always scared to be honest on these boards. I love how I can look at different styles of dresses and like them for different reasons. I could never wear a simple gown or a poofy ball gown- but I love the way they look on others. I like your gown because it has a lot going on- I like variety- but mostly since I cannot decide and stick to one style myself. I like a visually stimulating dress and yours certainly is that. How are you planning to wear your hair? You need to showcase those straps! I had straps too but I'm not a fan of up do's for my face so I did half up and half down. If you won't wear the veil long, I guess it doesn't matter. I love the romantic feel of lace and wanted a mantilla cathedral veil but it was too jarring with my dress.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>LOL No, honesty is good that's what the board is for feedback and information.\u00a0 Yeah I'm not a ball gown or simple gown person myself I needed a little fun with my dress I mean you only get to wear a wedding dress once (hopefully) so I wanted something different.\u00a0 I'm not sure yet on the hair but maybe up for the cermony very soft looking so you can see the straps and the back of the dress which has nice buttons going\u00a0 down the back with a simple veil might look nice.\u00a0 Then for the reception put my hair down and leave it in soft beachy waves.\u00a0 Half up Half down could work too but I might be too hot for the ceremony if I have it down.\u00a0 I love the mantilla veil that was what I always wanted but things change and it doesn't go with my dress also I'm getting married at the resort in\u00a0front of a gazebo I feel like the mantilla might be more suitable for a church setting.\u00a0 So much to think about.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8df9cb8d1d62e71ff04170c05dfa7137","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000FF\"&gt;Super cute! It looks very similar to the dress I&#039;m looking at getting&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Originally Posted by&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;jointurks&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;I love it with the sash!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Here&#039;s mine! Haven&#039;t decided on sash or no-sash yet :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:204px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223785\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223785\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1810855,"PostDate":1383236855,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:#0000FF\">Super cute! It looks very similar to the dress I'm looking at getting\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Originally Posted by\u00a0<strong>jointurks<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">I love it with the sash!!!!<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Here's mine! Haven't decided on sash or no-sash yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:204px\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223785\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223785\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennifermemet@gmail.com","IpAddress":"151.142.207.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372875987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-271167.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferM","Id":271167,"Name":"JenniferM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ee645ad71798b3d1f864c30a8a2a37f","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958925\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;JenniferM&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;br\/&gt;&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#0000FF\"&gt;Super cute! It looks very similar to the dress I&#039;m looking at getting&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Originally Posted by&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;jointurks&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;I love it with the sash!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;Here&#039;s mine! Haven&#039;t decided on sash or no-sash yet :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:204px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223785\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223785\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; I vote for the sash. It gives it a lil something","Attachments":[],"Id":1810868,"PostDate":1383240279,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\" data-huddler-embed=\"\/t\/85\/show-us-your-wedding-dress\/7680#post_1958925\" data-huddler-embed-placeholder=\"false\"><span>Quote:<\/span><div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>JenniferM<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" class=\"inlineimg\" alt=\"View Post\"\/><\/span><br\/><br\/><p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-size:16px\"><span  style=\"color:#0000FF\">Super cute! It looks very similar to the dress I'm looking at getting\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Originally Posted by\u00a0<strong>jointurks<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">I love it with the sash!!!!<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">Here's mine! Haven't decided on sash or no-sash yet <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"LEAD Technologies Inc. V1.01\" data-id=\"223783\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223783\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:204px\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223784\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223784\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"border:1px solid rgb(208, 208, 208); margin:0px 1px 1px 0px; padding:1px; width:350px\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"color:rgb(24, 24, 24)\">\u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"