{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbb1289c7453ac02dc5ccd539d85b9ee","RawContent":"[quote name=\"IrieBride08\"]\n*Sigh* Ok, here&#039;s my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I&#039;m still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img] [img]http:\/\/&lt;img%20alt=[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1810177,"PostDate":1383000608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"IrieBride08\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/90#post_162102\"><p>*Sigh* Ok, here's my wedding dress. I was originally looking for the slim, sleek, beachy, sexy look, but those looked super crappy on me. (I was so disappointed!) I tried this dress on and it made me feel so petite (when I totally am NOT!) LOL!! I'm still getting used to this different silhouette, which could change the tone of my whole wedding! It is a Monique Luo \"three tier\" organza dress. It was suprising light and airy! All I have is this crappy cell phone shot, but I just found a pic online to show some of the detail. The best part is I got it for $349, so if I find something better, I have options! Whatcha think? <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/GiWeddingDress.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i241.photobucket.com\/albums\/ff230\/Gigi36_2007\/moniqueluocouture.jpg\" style=\"border:0px solid;\"><\/span><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lashaundra95@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.204.222.48","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1381958116,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274312.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MickeyMouse","Id":274312,"Name":"MickeyMouse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1d9a6bc95cad15f285049b87eeb7698","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MickeyMouse\"][\/quote] Where did you purchase your dress?","Attachments":[],"Id":1810178,"PostDate":1383000675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n               