a-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"391dc6929a95cc987c9490de1204747b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AllieH\"]\nKara - this dress is stunning on you!!! and I think it&#039;s going to look amazing on the beach and at the resort. You have nothing at all to worry about.  [\/quote] you look beautiful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1809101,"PostDate":1382531089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"AllieH\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/6900#post_1885418\"><p>Kara - this dress is stunning on you!!! and I think it's going to look amazing on the beach and at the resort. You have nothing at all to worry about. \u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> you look beautiful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dfrey607@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"100.1.103.157","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1370080327,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270172.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wedding2014","Id":270172,"Name":"Wedding2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cbb159eebe718269509490cd8ba2d99","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;shugapop1&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n I love it. I&#039;m lookng for second dress&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;csho&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n Wow that is gorgeous! I love it! Who makes it? and whats the style?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Wedding2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n \n very pretty! I&#039;m looking for one for my ttd&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks!! Its a Demetrios short wedding dress not sure what the style is it doesn&#039;t say on the tag.&amp;nbsp; I did find it online though on some site but the name wasn&#039;t on their either it was going for around $150 I think.&amp;nbsp; In person the dress is so nice so many details some lace, beading and the cute flower perfect for a beach wedding after party.&amp;nbsp; The orginal price was $1,000.00.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809110,"PostDate":1382533170,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>shugapop1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> I love it. I'm lookng for second dress<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>csho<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Wow that is gorgeous! I love it! Who makes it? and whats the style?<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Wedding2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> very pretty! I'm looking for one for my ttd<\/div> <\/div> <p>Thanks!! Its a Demetrios short wedding dress not sure what the style is it doesn't say on the tag.\u00a0 I did find it online though on some site but the name wasn't on their either it was going for around $150 I think.\u00a0 In person the dress is so nice so many details some lace, beading and the cute flower perfect for a beach wedding after party.\u00a0 The orginal price was $1,000.00.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\n<p>43 guests plus bride and groom.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Engagement Photos - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76051-engagement-pictures-by-del-sol-photography-pic-heavy\/#entry1827276<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77563-njbride2014-planning-thread-leblanc-spa-resort-91314-pic-heavy\/#entry1860630<\/a>","Email":"sandyycaza@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"66.246.139.68","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1357660461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264077.jpg?_r=1415048239","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NJBride2014","Id":264077,"Name":"NJBride2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee75ae2d6fbfdab7ff8933af0a681c90","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Thanks!! Its a Demetrios short wedding dress not sure what the style is it doesn&#039;t say on the tag.&amp;nbsp; I did find it online though on some site but the name wasn&#039;t on their either it was going for around $150 I think.&amp;nbsp; In person the dress is so nice so many details some lace, beading and the cute flower perfect for a beach wedding after party.&amp;nbsp; The orginal price was $1,000.00.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Wow that was a steal!!! Its super gorgeous! I paid more for my secondary dress and I bought it on Modcloth! I wish I had of seen a dress like that!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809186,"PostDate":1382549609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Thanks!! Its a Demetrios short wedding dress not sure what the style is it doesn't say on the tag.\u00a0 I did find it online though on some site but the name wasn't on their either it was going for around $150 I think.\u00a0 In person the dress is so nice so many details some lace, beading and the cute flower perfect for a beach wedding after party.\u00a0 The orginal price was $1,000.00.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>Wow that was a steal!!! Its super gorgeous! I paid more for my secondary dress and I bought it on Modcloth! I wish I had of seen a dress like that!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4319c83f272606ebbfa2dabc5cf49c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809226,"PostDate":1382559592,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pacynamarta@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.22.189.192","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359326538,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265239.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"martap7","Id":265239,"Name":"martap7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcbcaa509d1e5551448279118acf61ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Such a unique dress, Martap7!!! It&#039;s so unique and the detail is awesome! Looks great on you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809234,"PostDate":1382560938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Such a unique dress, Martap7!!! It's so unique and the detail is awesome! Looks great on you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"humrz28@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381062008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274038.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SkyHighT100","Id":274038,"Name":"SkyHighT100","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce2758914a154237eac87da8f1e81709","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;NJBride2014&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is my second dress\/party dress. &amp;nbsp;Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann&#039;s bridal event. &amp;nbsp;I didn&#039;t buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn&#039;t want to pass it up. &amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a surprise for my fiance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;NJBride - Love the party dress!&amp;nbsp; You&#039;re going to have so much fun in this!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Wow!!!&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s beautiful!!&amp;nbsp; Who is the maker of your dress?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809291,"PostDate":1382599227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>NJBride2014<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224386\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224386\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224387\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224387\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>This is my second dress\/party dress. \u00a0Got a good deal on it at a Loehmann's bridal event. \u00a0I didn't buy my actual dress yet but I just thought this was so fun and perfect for Mexico I didn't want to pass it up. \u00a0It's a surprise for my fiance.\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\":cheer2:\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheer2.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>NJBride - Love the party dress!\u00a0 You're going to have so much fun in this!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Wow!!!\u00a0 It's beautiful!!\u00a0 Who is the maker of your dress?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m8chow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.227.202","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362599328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":175,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"m8chow","Id":266988,"Name":"m8chow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfee0c41cb99b298997a3c5b7ef66664","RawContent":"[quote name=\"martap7\"]\nWent in for my first dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :) [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"&gt; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/\"]&lt;img alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\"[\/url] style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"&gt; [\/url][\/quote] Wow that is a gorgeous dress!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1809293,"PostDate":1382599882,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"martap7\" url=\"\/t\/85\/show&#045;us&#045;your&#045;wedding&#045;dress\/7650#post_1957296\"><p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"><\/span> <\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" class=\"lightbox-enabled\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\/flags\/LL\" style=\"; width: 350px; height: 467px\"><\/span> <\/a><\/p><\/blockquote> Wow that is a gorgeous dress!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happily Married!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/74669-destination-engagement-photos-dubrovnik-croatia\/?hl=%2Bcroatia+%2Bengagement+%2Bphotos<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76346-carinas-csho-iberostar-laguna-azul-planning-journal-050514\/<\/a>","Email":"crins_15@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.63.146","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1351766568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261965.jpg?_r=1400781457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"csho","Id":261965,"Name":"csho","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1e918e2edb48203356dfef51dfbe056","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;martap7&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n &amp;nbsp; &lt;p&gt;Went in for my first&amp;nbsp;dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;This is so pretty! LOVE the train on it!! Have you thought about just having cups sewn into the dress so that you don&#039;t have to worry about finding a low back bra?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1809318,"PostDate":1382608527,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>martap7<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>Went in for my first\u00a0dress fitting this weekend, I just am in love with this dress...has to be taken in and have to find the right bra for it due to the back being so low, but I cannot wait to see it when its all said and done <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224432\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224432\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"&#10;\" data-id=\"224433\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224433\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p>This is so pretty! LOVE the train on it!! Have you thought about just having cups sewn into the dress so that you don't have to worry about finding a low back bra?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannasauchuk@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.111.32.194","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317206559,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245941.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dzaccaria","Id":245941,"Name":"dzaccaria","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7830,"NextPage":7840,"PreviousPage":7820,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
