                 body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>they are lovely x<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pennyltaylor186@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"77.98.22.59","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1356777599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-263605.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sky186","Id":263605,"Name":"sky186","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"06a6a99e82ccb515801ad5e582ed6270","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mrs. Martin\"]\nHere&#039;s my dress!! It is a Pronovias Spring &#039;08 dress in off-white. This sample had just came in (that&#039;s why it is super wrinkly) and it fit me. So, I was able to purchase this dress for a about $300 less than if I would have ordered it. Plus, they are going to steam it and dry clean it for free! I&#039;m sooo in love with it; I want to wear it all the time! [url=\"http:\/\/i278.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk92\/lezsoto\/dress2.jpg\"]&lt;img alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i278.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk92\/lezsoto\/dress2.jpg\"]http:\/\/i278.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk92\/lezsoto\/dress2.jpg\"[\/url] style=\"border:0px solid;\"&gt; [\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/i278.photobucket.com\/albums\/kk92\/lezsoto\/weddingdress.jpg\"]