Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.179.4.254","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427889374,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3119d5f9fba2f1793913c739670d28ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I found this site to order linen men&#039;s suits and wedding attire.&amp;nbsp; It is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.islandimporter.com&#039;&gt;www.islandimporter.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I thought the prices were reasonable.&amp;nbsp; :)   And&amp;nbsp;they do custom based on measurements you submit to them.&amp;nbsp; So if you have an athletic build man, then you can get a suit that fits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They also have some bridal dresses and some casual wear for the beach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891548,"PostDate":1427888836,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I found this site to order linen men's suits and wedding attire.\u00a0 It is <a href='http:\/\/www.islandimporter.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.islandimporter.com<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I thought the prices were reasonable.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0 And\u00a0they do custom based on measurements you submit to them.\u00a0 So if you have an athletic build man, then you can get a suit that fits.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They also have some bridal dresses and some casual wear for the beach.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ccbe58415ba52d76266fbd15135ca2d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Are these fully linen or linen blend?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891549,"PostDate":1427888926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Are these fully linen or linen blend?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419423414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.179.4.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"650bcc7e454edcc9ea8cf667c89a1ed9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"]....they have both.&amp;nbsp; The suits are 100% linen and they also have a silk blend suit.   They also have different shirts - 100% linen, 100% cotton or a blend.&amp;nbsp; You can choose.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891551,"PostDate":1427889330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a>....they have both.\u00a0 The suits are 100% linen and they also have a silk blend suit.\u00a0\u00a0 They also have different shirts - 100% linen, 100% cotton or a blend.\u00a0 You can choose.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"letitia_leaks@verizon.net","IpAddress":"63.119.183.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1397052122,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277534.jpg?_r=1397086760","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsGlover","Id":277534,"Name":"FutureMrsGlover","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bfc8726cf8e534b692c6f072de87727","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you for sharing this. My FI is always so warm so linen is the best option for him I think. We were just out this past weekend looking for his attire and we didnt find much. I am definitely going to show him this as an option.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891552,"PostDate":1427889378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you for sharing this. My FI is always so warm so linen is the best option for him I think. We were just out this past weekend looking for his attire and we didnt find much. I am definitely going to show him this as an option.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jen.tipler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.247.221.156","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1404859344,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278914.jpg?_r=1427504777","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissJen3","Id":278914,"Name":"MissJen3","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1310c9bdb0469e07a01a3bda3157df30","RawContent":"If you are a Canadian bride Le chateaux has linen and linen blend suits you can try on there! That&#039;s where my FI and uncle got both their outfits! \n\n\nLinen blend suit for my FI:\n\n\n\n\nFull linen suit for my uncle who is walking me down the aisle:\n\n\n\n\nThen the groomsmen are wearing outfits from old navy! Cost them about 40$:\n\n\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891562,"PostDate":1427892819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                If you are a Canadian bride Le chateaux has linen and linen blend suits you can try on there! That's where my FI and uncle got both their outfits! <br><br>\nLinen blend suit for my FI:<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891562]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790712573.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907124.621046.jpg -  174.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790712573.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907124.621046.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891562]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14279071383.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907136.672319.jpg -  177.83KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-14279071383.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907136.672319.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nFull linen suit for my uncle who is walking me down the aisle:<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891562]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790716705.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907165.750544.jpg -  290.75KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790716705.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907165.750544.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891562]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790717664.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907175.341305.jpg -  287.42KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790717664.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907175.341305.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nThen the groomsmen are wearing outfits from old navy! Cost them about 40$:<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1891562]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790721565.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907214.792305.jpg -  188.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2015\/post-282430-142790721565.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1427907214.792305.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427895589,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7894a6335849891ada4373aeafd08232","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great website! The prices are excellent - and just what we&#039;re looking for.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t want him to wear shorts (too tacky in my opinion...just me!) so linen is a great option. Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891572,"PostDate":1427895571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great website! The prices are excellent - and just what we're looking for.\u00a0 I don't want him to wear shorts (too tacky in my opinion...just me!) so linen is a great option. Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0803ac1b9b72644a1d6d57e63d4989eb","RawContent":"I saw some at le chateau this past week. They look nice! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891635,"PostDate":1427926646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I saw some at le chateau this past week. They look nice! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1440029562","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.130.168","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"166c4d6b0e720b47900875da85a2af9c","RawContent":"They look really nice on! @[member=\"TinkerSofi\"] [emoji4] and they also have a grey as well, but since beige looks awesome we went with that [emoji5]\ufe0f! (Especially with the gold, purple, and ivory look we have going for our wedding)\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1891640,"PostDate":1427926884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They look really nice on! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265511\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/265511-tinkersofi\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TinkerSofi<\/span><\/a> [emoji4] and they also have a grey as well, but since beige looks awesome we went with that [emoji5]\ufe0f! (Especially with the gold, purple, and ivory look we have going for our wedding)<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"izabella.david@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.237.26.51","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1426447978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282430.jpg?_r=1434377756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":287,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IzzyDeee","Id":282430,"Name":"IzzyDeee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c263546acf8a87234870c624590f436e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I ordered hubby&#039;s outfit from Islandimporter.com yesterday, thanks to the suggestion from this site! I can&#039;t wait to see how he looks in it - I ordered the grey linen pants, grey linen vest and a coral dress shirt to match our wedding colors. Thank you for the suggestion!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898625,"PostDate":1434391268,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I ordered hubby's outfit from Islandimporter.com yesterday, thanks to the suggestion from this site! I can't wait to see how he looks in it - I ordered the grey linen pants, grey linen vest and a coral dress shirt to match our wedding colors. Thank you for the suggestion!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a2084ed777033219e0a45015c8d0a08","RawContent":"[quote name=\"KatieMcBride\" post=\"1898625\" timestamp=\"1434405668\"]\nI ordered hubby&#039;s outfit from Islandimporter.com yesterday, thanks to the suggestion from this site! I can&#039;t wait to see how he looks in it - I ordered the grey linen pants, grey linen vest and a coral dress shirt to match our wedding colors. Thank you for the suggestion!!![\/quote]\nI&#039;ve been looking at this website, wondering if they&#039;re a reliable company. Are you shipping to the US or Canada (or other)? I&#039;m concerned about shipping to Canada... Please post back when you receive them and let us know how everything turned out!  :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1900092,"PostDate":1436444789,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KatieMcBride, on 15 June 2015 - 06:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I ordered hubby's outfit from Islandimporter.com yesterday, thanks to the suggestion from this site! I can't wait to see how he looks in it - I ordered the grey linen pants, grey linen vest and a coral dress shirt to match our wedding colors. Thank you for the suggestion!!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I've been looking at this website, wondering if they're a reliable company. Are you shipping to the US or Canada (or other)? I'm concerned about shipping to Canada... Please post back when you receive them and let us know how everything turned out!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410528713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":24,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
