{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"369faecdb5ec50113e1df583452e7b3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I was wondering the same thing. I always order from the states and have never had to pay custom fees...who knows!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900589,"PostDate":1437058431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I was wondering the same thing. I always order from the states and have never had to pay custom fees...who knows!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b6695fd9f16896390fb12abd7edda2f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Has anyone seen a linen shirt tucked into linen pants (no vest)? Wondering if linen is a weird material to tuck in.. or if another type of shirt can be tucked into linen pants.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900771,"PostDate":1437399551,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Has anyone seen a linen shirt tucked into linen pants (no vest)? Wondering if linen is a weird material to tuck in.. or if another type of shirt can be tucked into linen pants.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410528713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.34.35.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7382f5714ab4509cb117b310e63b9e28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"KatieMcBride\"] did they add tax onto the order on the website? and are the prices in USD? (they don&#039;t tell you either of these things on the website)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a bridal shop here who carries this same stuff and orders from this site, but since they&#039;re covering the customs and exchange rate - they mark up the prices substantially... I&#039;m trying to figure out if it would actually be cheaper for me to just order the 3 suits I need online myself!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902181,"PostDate":1439122006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282132\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282132-katiemcbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatieMcBride<\/span><\/a> did they add tax onto the order on the website? and are the prices in USD? (they don't tell you either of these things on the website)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a bridal shop here who carries this same stuff and orders from this site, but since they're covering the customs and exchange rate - they mark up the prices substantially... I'm trying to figure out if it would actually be cheaper for me to just order the 3 suits I need online myself!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#800080;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;\">Jessica<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span>","Email":"jessiker05@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.222.45.206","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410528713,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279800.jpg?_r=1432039880","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":164,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jessiker05","Id":279800,"Name":"jessiker05","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79010,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e6e40e9157844fb18916342e5246193d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sorry it took me so long to get back to you! I was on holidays - they charge in USD - it was $250-ish, but ended up being $320 once they converted it to Canadian $ unfortunately.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902805,"PostDate":1439918416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sorry it took me so long to get back to you! I was on holidays - they charge in USD - it was $250-ish, but ended up being $320 once they converted it to Canadian $ unfortunately.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":24,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
