> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.19.128.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"599ed5c40aaf62cacb5284552c369d14","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1887117\" timestamp=\"1424619112\"]\nThey are all beautiful :) I can see why you are struggling. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]I know!! I&#039;m just going to wait and once I&#039;ve lost my last bit of weight I&#039;ll try a few on in a store near me to see what style suits best and get proper measurements taken. Might even find something better there!  I have been to quite a few shops but nothings grabbed my attention yet...\n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1887125,"PostDate":1424611983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 22 February 2015 - 11:31 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>They are all beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can see why you are struggling. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI know!! I'm just going to wait and once I've lost my last bit of weight I'll try a few on in a store near me to see what style suits best and get proper measurements taken. Might even find something better there!  I have been to quite a few shops but nothings grabbed my attention yet...<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9773a6f97ed6a607f67af91e38490bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"maybeoneday\"] They are all lovely. I&#039;m a fan of strapped dresses myself so I would choose the 2nd one. Also, why do you think red is too bright for a DW wedding? You&#039;re getting married in Mexico. I would think that&#039;s a great spot for a red wedding dress!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887196,"PostDate":1424684522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> They are all lovely. I'm a fan of strapped dresses myself so I would choose the 2nd one. Also, why do you think red is too bright for a DW wedding? You're getting married in Mexico. I would think that's a great spot for a red wedding dress!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.49.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c98e7aaeb5275400421b4fddbe4ca695","RawContent":"[quote name=\"yj2cute\" post=\"1887196\" timestamp=\"1424698922\"]\n@[member=\"maybeoneday\"] They are all lovely. I&#039;m a fan of strapped dresses myself so I would choose the 2nd one. Also, why do you think red is too bright for a DW wedding? You&#039;re getting married in Mexico. I would think that&#039;s a great spot for a red wedding dress![\/quote]I completely agree but I just think the shade of the red looks a little bit orange in the sunlight xx When i initially got it i tried it on in a duller room and it looked lovrly. If it was a touch darker I would be happy as it is my favourite colour xx\n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[{"Id":30723,"Name":"uploadfromtaptalk1424713841277.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142471384761.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142471384761_thumb.jpg","Width":500,"Height":655}],"Id":1887225,"PostDate":1424699483,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>yj2cute, on 23 February 2015 - 09:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281816\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281816-maybeoneday\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">maybeoneday<\/span><\/a> They are all lovely. I'm a fan of strapped dresses myself so I would choose the 2nd one. Also, why do you think red is too bright for a DW wedding? You're getting married in Mexico. I would think that's a great spot for a red wedding dress!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI completely agree but I just think the shade of the red looks a little bit orange in the sunlight xx When i initially got it i tried it on in a duller room and it looked lovrly. If it was a touch darker I would be happy as it is my favourite colour xx<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a469936978774625a626424638f64ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I looked in to buying a knock off Inbal Dror dress from DHgate. The shops I looked in to had good reviews, but none on the specific dress I was going to order. I emailed them and asked if they had pictures of THEIR work, not the stock photo of the real dress. Their response was that \"it would look like the photo\". That response terrified me! I did a little more research and saw a couple &#039;fails&#039; of the dress I wanted and quickly changed my mind! Even if I was getting a very expensive dress for $200 it wasn&#039;t worth it if it wasn&#039;t wearable. I looked for several weeks on Ebay and found someone that actually received the knockoff dress I wanted. She decided on another dress. I bought the dress for cheaper AND I got to see the actual dress before hand! My point is, search ebay and other used wedding dress sites before you risk spending hundreds of dollars and get and unwearable dress!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=blog:entries:174]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887227,"PostDate":1424699977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I looked in to buying a knock off Inbal Dror dress from DHgate. The shops I looked in to had good reviews, but none on the specific dress I was going to order. I emailed them and asked if they had pictures of THEIR work, not the stock photo of the real dress. Their response was that \"it would look like the photo\". That response terrified me! I did a little more research and saw a couple 'fails' of the dress I wanted and quickly changed my mind! Even if I was getting a very expensive dress for $200 it wasn't worth it if it wasn't wearable. I looked for several weeks on Ebay and found someone that actually received the knockoff dress I wanted. She decided on another dress. I bought the dress for cheaper AND I got to see the actual dress before hand! My point is, search ebay and other used wedding dress sites before you risk spending hundreds of dollars and get and unwearable dress!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/118\/entry-174-found-my-dream-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/sharedmedia\/entries.png' alt='Entry' class='sharedmedia_screenshot' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/118\/entry-174-found-my-dream-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Found My Dream Dress!<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/118-planning-for-jamaica-2016\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Blog: Planning for Jamaica 2016<\/a><\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>Last Update Jun 23 2015 08:42 AM<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aricalizx3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.213.47.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415706284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jamaica2016","Id":281097,"Name":"Jamaica2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.49.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86cea4efd829627ce0124818ebb75b4a","RawContent":"@[member=\"Jamaica2016\"] \n\n\nWell done on finding your dream dress. Yayyy! It is beautiful xx Some good advice there x\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\n\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1887296,"PostDate":1424734166,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281097\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281097-jamaica2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jamaica2016<\/span><\/a> <br><br>\nWell done on finding your dream dress. Yayyy! It is beautiful xx Some good advice there x<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.210.37.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e2d4e1e85d6e21d7bf8aaaf45a925ec","RawContent":"I&#039;m Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com.  its this one.  &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html&lt;\/a&gt;I just love the ball gown what do u think?","Attachments":[],"Id":1890820,"PostDate":1427333242,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com.  its this one.  <a href='http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dressilym...dress-1915.html<\/a>I just love the ball gown what do u think? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chloeeggleston@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.210.37.140","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427332901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282546.jpg?_r=1427903725","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":196,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Chloefaithe","Id":282546,"Name":"Chloefaithe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.181.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67537434993df30841c61abff51476d3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Chloefaithe\" post=\"1890820\" timestamp=\"1427347642\"]\nI&#039;m Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com.  its this one.  [url=\"http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html\"]http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html[\/url]I just love the ball gown what do u think?[\/quote]Wow love it!! Great price as well!! \n\nMaybeoneday\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1890822,"PostDate":1427341141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Chloefaithe, on 26 March 2015 - 01:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com.  its this one.  <a href='http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dressilym...dress-1915.html<\/a>I just love the ball gown what do u think?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nWow love it!! Great price as well!! <br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e88a988b9a4d7b330bf8860854152e0e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Chloefaithe\" post=\"1890820\" timestamp=\"1427347642\"]\nI&#039;m Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com. its this one. [url=\"http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html\"]http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html[\/url]I just love the ball gown what do u think?[\/quote]\nIt&#039;s beautiful! There are several excellent reviews so you should be fine. And will save lots of money! Be sure to come and post updates.","Attachments":[],"Id":1890831,"PostDate":1427363526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Chloefaithe, on 26 March 2015 - 01:27 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm Almost 100% sure I want this dress from dressilyme.com. its this one. <a href='http:\/\/www.dressilyme.com\/p-satin-tulle-ball-gown-sweetheart-wedding-dress-1915.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dressilym...dress-1915.html<\/a>I just love the ball gown what do u think?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It's beautiful! There are several excellent reviews so you should be fine. And will save lots of money! Be sure to come and post updates.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0c941631570effff765dde3ccebae8d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Does anyone have any information or reviews about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.weddingdressesmall.co.uk\/%C2%A0&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingdressesmall.co.uk\/&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tried on a wedding dress and don&#039;t know what the make and model is, but found it on this website.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any info will be appreciated.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893643,"PostDate":1429485114,"PostContent":null,"Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"82.231.41.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"155a5d3f23f4bf08c29ac59f3ca12396","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am about to order a dress with Mermaidbridal and I would like to know if someone has already received a dress from them?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you very much!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1894420,"PostDate":1430040991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am about to order a dress with Mermaidbridal and I would like to know if someone has already received a dress from them?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you very much!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mlle.severineroy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"82.231.41.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430040715,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Calistawhite","Id":282864,"Name":"Calistawhite","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6380,"NextPage":6390,"PreviousPage":6370,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
