{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa8015b91e39d5aaeaa5776101f5e603","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1884447\" timestamp=\"1422465466\"]\nOh we do have the same dates!  Congratulations to you as well!  I will have to check out Mermaid Bridal.  Thanks for the response![\/quote]You&#039;re welcome. FYI, China will be shut down for a  month beginning in a couple of weeks for Chinese New Year so your production time will be extended by that long. Don&#039;t wait too long to get your order in. Come back and post what you decide to go with!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884448,"PostDate":1422451509,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 28 January 2015 - 01:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh we do have the same dates! \u00a0Congratulations to you as well! \u00a0I will have to check out Mermaid Bridal. \u00a0Thanks for the response!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\nYou're welcome. FYI, China will be shut down for a\u00a0 month beginning in a couple of weeks for Chinese New Year so your production time will be extended by that long. Don't wait too long to get your order in. Come back and post what you decide to go with!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4959cca04f8fc053c0b3172cf4267310","RawContent":"[quote name=\"yj2cute\" post=\"1884448\" timestamp=\"1422465909\"]\nYou&#039;re welcome. FYI, China will be shut down for a  month beginning in a couple of weeks for Chinese New Year so your production time will be extended by that long. Don&#039;t wait too long to get your order in. Come back and post what you decide to go with![\/quote]\nWHAT! I will be ordering this week then. Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884449,"PostDate":1422451756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>yj2cute, on 28 January 2015 - 01:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>You're welcome. FYI, China will be shut down for a\u00a0 month beginning in a couple of weeks for Chinese New Year so your production time will be extended by that long. Don't wait too long to get your order in. Come back and post what you decide to go with!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWHAT! I will be ordering this week then. Thanks! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"109.130.167.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a2ef22b75fb9df9d6d929913e88d429","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1884449\" timestamp=\"1422466156\"]\nWHAT! I will be ordering this week then. Thanks![\/quote]Don&#039;t worry, it&#039;s not really for a month. They have Chinese New Year mid of February, I would count on 1-2 weeks delay max. But indeed, if you need it soon, don&#039;t wait to long! My wedding is May 9th already so am also planning to order asap. Once I make up my mind that is :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1884475,"PostDate":1422462022,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 28 January 2015 - 01:29 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>WHAT! I will be ordering this week then. Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Don't worry, it's not really for a month. They have Chinese New Year mid of February, I would count on 1-2 weeks delay max. But indeed, if you need it soon, don't wait to long! My wedding is May 9th already so am also planning to order asap. Once I make up my mind that is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mivb1@hotmail.be","IpAddress":"109.130.167.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422298032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Miek","Id":281882,"Name":"Miek","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1422463700,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d1557b0157fd65cccdcffa8f8d04645","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Miek\" post=\"1884475\" timestamp=\"1422476422\"]\nDon&#039;t worry, it&#039;s not really for a month. They have Chinese New Year mid of February, I would count on 1-2 weeks delay max. But indeed, if you need it soon, don&#039;t wait to long! My wedding is May 9th already so am also planning to order asap. Once I make up my mind that is :)[\/quote] Well some vendors may be different, but I&#039;ve been told 1 month from several of the dress makers on Etsy. Here&#039;s what she wrote me:\n\n[color=#0000ff][i]Dear Yxxx\nSince we&#039;ll have 1 month off for our CNY holidays, this is the most important festival in our country, the processing time would be much longer, maybe 6-8 weeks, dose it work for u?\nAny questions, pls feel free to contact me at any time:)\nLinna[\/i][\/color]","Attachments":[],"Id":1884486,"PostDate":1422463659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Miek, on 28 January 2015 - 04:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Don't worry, it's not really for a month. They have Chinese New Year mid of February, I would count on 1-2 weeks delay max. But indeed, if you need it soon, don't wait to long! My wedding is May 9th already so am also planning to order asap. Once I make up my mind that is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0Well some vendors may be different, but I've been told 1 month from several of the dress makers on Etsy. Here's what she wrote me:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#0000ff\"><em>Dear Yxxx<br>\nSince we'll have 1 month off for our CNY holidays, this is the most important festival in our country, the processing time would be much longer, maybe 6-8 weeks, dose it work for u?<br>\nAny questions, pls feel free to contact me at any time:)<br>\nLinna<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.139.159.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6607cabf672cab5214791442a5eefde8","RawContent":"Hello all, anyone go with a Galia Lahav knock off?  If so, which vendor did you order from and are you happy with it? Please include pix in your response.  I&#039;m looking to shop with babyonline but still looking into aliexpress, dressilyme, and upon reading the threads, carabridal, and jasmine.  I&#039;ve seen some nice knockoffs and I&#039;m not hesitant to purchase, however, I would like a nice experience and to receive a product that looks like the Galia I want.  Going to a Galia trunk show this sat 1\/31\/15 to try on her styles.  Sadly, the dress I want is from last year but I&#039;m hoping the bridal shop still carries it.  Hope they don&#039;t treat me like a plebeian when they realize I don&#039;t have or want to spend 5, 000-10, 000 on a dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884691,"PostDate":1422604923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello all, anyone go with a Galia Lahav knock off?  If so, which vendor did you order from and are you happy with it? Please include pix in your response.  I'm looking to shop with babyonline but still looking into aliexpress, dressilyme, and upon reading the threads, carabridal, and jasmine.  I've seen some nice knockoffs and I'm not hesitant to purchase, however, I would like a nice experience and to receive a product that looks like the Galia I want.  Going to a Galia trunk show this sat 1\/31\/15 to try on her styles.  Sadly, the dress I want is from last year but I'm hoping the bridal shop still carries it.  Hope they don't treat me like a plebeian when they realize I don't have or want to spend 5, 000-10, 000 on a dress.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mtgbronx13@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.26.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422536650,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mtgbronx13","Id":281930,"Name":"Mtgbronx13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e273d9fb6a942a491d55d8c0776456f7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"2monthweddingplanner\" post=\"1880390\" timestamp=\"1418677509\"]\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Verdana][size=2]Ok because I had such a hard time finding info on buying a Chinese knock off I want to post a detailed review. This dress is gorgeous. Really well made. Great details, there are little beading details that are very well done. The ruching is lovely. The fabric is really soft and pretty. I paid $200 including rush shipping and processing for a custom made wedding dress. There&#039;s a ribbed bodice, nice satin inner lining, beautiful chiffon outer layer. And it&#039;s exactly what I ordered. The waist could be taken in a bit but that&#039;s because I mismeasured my natural waist (took it too low and therefore the number was larger) and I meant to tell them to remove the train but I forgot. But they made exactly what I ordered and did an excellent job of copying the original. Honestly, it fits wonderfully and really doesn&#039;t need any alterations just that one little 1\/2 inch or so! Best purchase I&#039;ve ever made! Couldn&#039;t love it more. [\/size][\/font][\/color]\n\n\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Verdana][size=2]They were super responsive when I asked them to remove the sequins, always answering my emails promptly. I could [\/size][\/font][\/color][color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Verdana][size=2]not recommend dressilyme.com more for a wedding dress. Not sure about bigger poofy ones but for this fairly simple sheath one I couldn&#039;t have done better. The quality is way better than most of the dresses I tried on at David&#039;s Bridal.[\/size][\/font][\/color]\n[color=rgb(0,0,0)][font=Verdana][size=2]\n[url=\"http:\/\/youtu.be\/d2P-XpT_ZOU\"]http:\/\/youtu.be\/d2P-XpT_ZOU[\/url][\/size][\/font][\/color][\/quote]\nOMGSH That&#039;s amazing!! I&#039;ve definitely saving that link for when I order, wow!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884796,"PostDate":1422703939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>2monthweddingplanner, on 15 December 2014 - 05:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">Ok because I had such a hard time finding info on buying a Chinese knock off I want to post a detailed review. This dress is gorgeous. Really well made. Great details, there are little beading details that are very well done. The ruching is lovely. The fabric is really soft and pretty. I paid $200 including rush shipping and processing for a custom made wedding dress. There's a ribbed bodice, nice satin inner lining, beautiful chiffon outer layer. And it's exactly what I ordered. The waist could be taken in a bit but that's because I mismeasured my natural waist (took it too low and therefore the number was larger) and I meant to tell them to remove the train but I forgot. But they made exactly what I ordered and did an excellent job of copying the original. Honestly, it fits wonderfully and really doesn't need any alterations just that one little 1\/2 inch or so! Best purchase I've ever made! Couldn't love it more. <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">They were super responsive when I asked them to remove the sequins, always answering my emails promptly. I could\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">not recommend dressilyme.com more for a wedding dress. Not sure about bigger poofy ones but for this fairly simple sheath one I couldn't have done better. The quality is way better than most of the dresses I tried on at David's Bridal.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\"><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/d2P-XpT_ZOU?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p><br>\nOMGSH That's amazing!! I've definitely saving that link for when I order, wow!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"empty_xo@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.244.52.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416683137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brandii","Id":281229,"Name":"Brandii","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.5.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a4aa8e615770cef14707726fcde4567","RawContent":"[quote name=\"atoney86\" post=\"1862414\" timestamp=\"1406341452\"]\nHi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn&#039;t have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.\n \n [img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28799\"]melovely1 (1).JPG[\/url][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28800\"]melovely2 (1).JPG[\/url][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28801\"]melovely3 (1).JPG[\/url][\/quote]\nVery pretty!\n[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1862823\" timestamp=\"1406573695\"]\nDo a reverse google image search- it should tell you all the info you need.[\/quote]This helps me, too! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887006,"PostDate":1424460388,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>atoney86, on 25 July 2014 - 10:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn't have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28799' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely1 (1).JPG<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28800' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely2 (1).JPG<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28801' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely3 (1).JPG<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br><br>\nVery pretty!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 28 July 2014 - 02:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Do a reverse google image search- it should tell you all the info you need.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThis helps me, too! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geanievakaye@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.243.220.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424378988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282170.jpg?_r=1424471931","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GeanievaKaye","Id":282170,"Name":"GeanievaKaye","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.243.220.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbad2b1f494caa1c6d8c58a9e22071d9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1880030\" timestamp=\"1418152898\"]\nI know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.[\/quote]I love that designer and I&#039;m hoping to see examples of the workmanship from some of the more well-known sites like Jasmines.  I&#039;ll be following and cheering for your success in your search!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887012,"PostDate":1424465641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 09 December 2014 - 03:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I love that designer and I'm hoping to see examples of the workmanship from some of the more well-known sites like Jasmines. \u00a0I'll be following and cheering for your success in your search!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geanievakaye@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.243.220.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424378988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282170.jpg?_r=1424471931","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GeanievaKaye","Id":282170,"Name":"GeanievaKaye","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.19.128.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"19ac2588c1a45173a2facd2b0a693a93","RawContent":"Hi everyone. Congratulations to all you brides and brides-to-be out there!  I bought a dress a few years ago but we cancelled our plans due to ill health in the family.  Now that we are ready again I want to get a new dress as I think the original one will be too bright for a DW (it&#039;s red). Not sure of the original designers but can&#039;t decide between these.\n\n\n#1 \n\n\n# Joint 1\n\n\n\n\n#2\n\n\n\n\nDecisions, decisions! !\n\n\nMaybeoneday\n\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation\n\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico","Attachments":[],"Id":1887106,"PostDate":1424577419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone. Congratulations to all you brides and brides-to-be out there!  I bought a dress a few years ago but we cancelled our plans due to ill health in the family.  Now that we are ready again I want to get a new dress as I think the original one will be too bright for a DW (it's red). Not sure of the original designers but can't decide between these.<br><br>\n#1 <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459156021.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591559166.jpg -  5.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459156021.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591559166.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459157923.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591578233.jpg -  5.63KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459157923.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591578233.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n# Joint 1<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459165491.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591652454.jpg -  154.2KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459165491.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591652454.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459167167.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591669143.jpg -  165.42KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459167167.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591669143.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\n#2<br>\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459175046.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591748082.jpg -  152.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459175046.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591748082.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1887106]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459176084.jpg\" title=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591758579.jpg -  148.26KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2015\/post-281816-142459176084.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"uploadfromtaptalk1424591758579.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<br><br>\nDecisions, decisions! !<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 October 2015....waiting confirmation<br>\nRoyalton Riviera Cancun, Mexico\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelina_nessa@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"149.254.56.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421807139,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"maybeoneday","Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e936e34ec5a5e34a86ba500e1fa8c72d","RawContent":"They are all beautiful :) I can see why you are struggling. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1887117,"PostDate":1424604712,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They are all beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I can see why you are struggling. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6370,"NextPage":6380,"PreviousPage":6360,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
