{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.53.168.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5675ce04e360d1dd7362733442df073d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"TheBHolders\" post=\"1880030\" timestamp=\"1418152898\"]\nI know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.[\/quote]\nCheck the weddingbee forum. They can likely help!","Attachments":[],"Id":1880038,"PostDate":1418144671,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>TheBHolders, on 09 December 2014 - 03:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCheck the weddingbee forum. They can likely help! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.213.224.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbdf5a58ac1921d35d366c3e487debe6","RawContent":"Looking for a galia Lahav  replica not having much lock with it","Attachments":[],"Id":1880272,"PostDate":1418407438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Looking for a galia Lahav  replica not having much lock with it \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nice-looks@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"200.7.90.96","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418320731,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281388.jpg?_r=1419257078","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KalifaDuncan89","Id":281388,"Name":"KalifaDuncan89","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"104.6.140.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":5,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"163f55238e864b4600524395f5acdec5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"&gt;Ok because I had such a hard time finding info on buying a Chinese knock off I want to post a detailed review. This dress is gorgeous. Really well made. Great details, there are little beading details that are very well done. The ruching is lovely. The fabric is really soft and pretty. I paid $200 including rush shipping and processing for a custom made wedding dress. There&#039;s a ribbed bodice, nice satin inner lining, beautiful chiffon outer layer. And it&#039;s exactly what I ordered. The waist could be taken in a bit but that&#039;s because I mismeasured my natural waist (took it too low and therefore the number was larger) and I meant to tell them to remove the train but I forgot. But they made exactly what I ordered and did an excellent job of copying the original. Honestly, it fits wonderfully and really doesn&#039;t need any alterations just that one little 1\/2 inch or so! Best purchase I&#039;ve ever made! Couldn&#039;t love it more. &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"&gt;They were super responsive when I asked them to remove the sequins, always answering my emails promptly. I could&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"&gt;not recommend dressilyme.com more for a wedding dress. Not sure about bigger poofy ones but for this fairly simple sheath one I couldn&#039;t have done better. The quality is way better than most of the dresses I tried on at David&#039;s Bridal.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px;\"&gt;http:\/\/youtu.be\/d2P-XpT_ZOU&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":30231,"Name":"IMG_0352.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-45369200-1418677467.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-45369200-1418677467_thumb.jpg","Width":864,"Height":1152},{"Id":30232,"Name":"IMG_0354.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-84007800-1418677476.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-84007800-1418677476_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":30233,"Name":"IMG_1193.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-43845000-1418677483.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-43845000-1418677483_thumb.jpg","Width":366,"Height":510},{"Id":30234,"Name":"IMG_1194.JPG","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-45435700-1418677489.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-45435700-1418677489_thumb.jpg","Width":366,"Height":510},{"Id":30235,"Name":"IMG_1210.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-13736100-1418677494.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2014\/post-281416-0-13736100-1418677494_thumb.jpg","Width":864,"Height":648}],"Id":1880390,"PostDate":1418663109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">Ok because I had such a hard time finding info on buying a Chinese knock off I want to post a detailed review. This dress is gorgeous. Really well made. Great details, there are little beading details that are very well done. The ruching is lovely. The fabric is really soft and pretty. I paid $200 including rush shipping and processing for a custom made wedding dress. There's a ribbed bodice, nice satin inner lining, beautiful chiffon outer layer. And it's exactly what I ordered. The waist could be taken in a bit but that's because I mismeasured my natural waist (took it too low and therefore the number was larger) and I meant to tell them to remove the train but I forgot. But they made exactly what I ordered and did an excellent job of copying the original. Honestly, it fits wonderfully and really doesn't need any alterations just that one little 1\/2 inch or so! Best purchase I've ever made! Couldn't love it more. <\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">They were super responsive when I asked them to remove the sequins, always answering my emails promptly. I could\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">not recommend dressilyme.com more for a wedding dress. Not sure about bigger poofy ones but for this fairly simple sheath one I couldn't have done better. The quality is way better than most of the dresses I tried on at David's Bridal.<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:11px\"><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/d2P-XpT_ZOU?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueeyedlass2012@gmail.com","IpAddress":"104.6.140.150","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418663000,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"2monthweddingplanner","Id":281416,"Name":"2monthweddingplanner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"41e03d4577205a2fa2cffdc57713f04e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;2monthweddingplanner, excellent update! Thanks so much. And your dress is beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880422,"PostDate":1418722103,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>2monthweddingplanner, excellent update! Thanks so much. And your dress is beautiful!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.116.100.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03410dec2ab7ba63b27a35fc50d140ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TheBHolders\"] Yes go to the wedding bee, I got my Galia and LOVE IT!!! got mid production pics BUT it is under final revisions now. I truly loved it&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880555,"PostDate":1418804347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278146\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278146-thebholders\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TheBHolders<\/span><\/a> Yes go to the wedding bee, I got my Galia and LOVE IT!!! got mid production pics BUT it is under final revisions now. I truly loved it\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396867157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1431203346","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"109.130.167.164","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1504f418728b26315c32918f25e3e3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m new here on this forum. I am getting married in May 2015 but still have to find a dress! Because of time&amp;nbsp; (purchasing one here in Europe in bridal stores takes about 3-4 months to get it...) and budget constraints (well, you only wear it just once &amp;amp; I would rather spend more on the honeymoon than on the dress) I was leaning towards ordering one online... I found one I like on lightinthebox.com (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html&lt;\/a&gt;). There are quite a lot of &#039;real&#039; pictures on the website from brides who have posted their pictures. I would have it custom made to my measurements plus it has the lace-up in the back which should ensure it to fit nicely even if the size isn&#039;t perfect. &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have never really ordered clothes online before though and especially for a wedding dress I do have some reservations... Does anyone have experience with this website at all?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It is really cheap for a wedding dress but if this does not work out, I really wont have any time left to go find something else...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice\/thoughts\/ideas you girls have to share would be very much appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884216,"PostDate":1422298996,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm new here on this forum. I am getting married in May 2015 but still have to find a dress! Because of time\u00a0 (purchasing one here in Europe in bridal stores takes about 3-4 months to get it...) and budget constraints (well, you only wear it just once & I would rather spend more on the honeymoon than on the dress) I was leaning towards ordering one online... I found one I like on lightinthebox.com (<a href='http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.lightinth...ijn_p80720.html<\/a>). There are quite a lot of 'real' pictures on the website from brides who have posted their pictures. I would have it custom made to my measurements plus it has the lace-up in the back which should ensure it to fit nicely even if the size isn't perfect. <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have never really ordered clothes online before though and especially for a wedding dress I do have some reservations... Does anyone have experience with this website at all?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is really cheap for a wedding dress but if this does not work out, I really wont have any time left to go find something else...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice\/thoughts\/ideas you girls have to share would be very much appreciated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mivb1@hotmail.be","IpAddress":"109.130.167.164","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422298032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Miek","Id":281882,"Name":"Miek","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"691e6392ce1bdc189b8c0ae2b16314c4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Miek\" post=\"1884216\" timestamp=\"1422313396\"]\nHello everyone,\n\nI&#039;m new here on this forum. I am getting married in May 2015 but still have to find a dress! Because of time  (purchasing one here in Europe in bridal stores takes about 3-4 months to get it...) and budget constraints (well, you only wear it just once &amp;amp; I would rather spend more on the honeymoon than on the dress) I was leaning towards ordering one online... I found one I like on lightinthebox.com ([url=\"http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html\"]http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html[\/url]). There are quite a lot of &#039;real&#039; pictures on the website from brides who have posted their pictures. I would have it custom made to my measurements plus it has the lace-up in the back which should ensure it to fit nicely even if the size isn&#039;t perfect.\n\nI have never really ordered clothes online before though and especially for a wedding dress I do have some reservations... Does anyone have experience with this website at all?\n\nIt is really cheap for a wedding dress but if this does not work out, I really wont have any time left to go find something else...\n\nAny advice\/thoughts\/ideas you girls have to share would be very much appreciated!\n\nThanks![\/quote]\nI looked at this site as well. I would go ahead and take the chance and order it. As you said, there are many good reviews with actual photos so your chances of getting something you&#039;re happy with is pretty good. I ended up ordering a dress from a Chinese dress maker through Etsy. Instead of using designer photos they post their own designs. I was pleased with that because I was looking at photos of their acutal work. That plus almost 300 5-star reviews gave me confidence. I just placed my order on Monday so I&#039;m keeping my fingers crossed!\n\nGood luck.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884438,"PostDate":1422449226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Miek, on 26 January 2015 - 07:03 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm new here on this forum. I am getting married in May 2015 but still have to find a dress! Because of time\u00a0 (purchasing one here in Europe in bridal stores takes about 3-4 months to get it...) and budget constraints (well, you only wear it just once & I would rather spend more on the honeymoon than on the dress) I was leaning towards ordering one online... I found one I like on lightinthebox.com (<a href='http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/nl\/MADISEN---Trouwjurk-van-Satijn_p80720.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.lightinth...ijn_p80720.html<\/a>). There are quite a lot of 'real' pictures on the website from brides who have posted their pictures. I would have it custom made to my measurements plus it has the lace-up in the back which should ensure it to fit nicely even if the size isn't perfect.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have never really ordered clothes online before though and especially for a wedding dress I do have some reservations... Does anyone have experience with this website at all?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It is really cheap for a wedding dress but if this does not work out, I really wont have any time left to go find something else...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice\/thoughts\/ideas you girls have to share would be very much appreciated!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I looked at this site as well. I would go ahead and take the chance and order it. As you said, there are many good reviews with actual photos so your chances of getting something you're happy with is pretty good. I ended up ordering a dress from a Chinese dress maker through Etsy. Instead of using designer photos they post their own designs. I was pleased with that because I was looking at photos of their acutal work. That plus almost 300 5-star reviews gave me confidence. I just placed my order on Monday so I'm keeping my fingers crossed!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca946f00bdb831a76553361e42339fb4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"yj2cute\" post=\"1884438\" timestamp=\"1422463626\"]\nI looked at this site as well. I would go ahead and take the chance and order it. As you said, there are many good reviews with actual photos so your chances of getting something you&#039;re happy with is pretty good. I ended up ordering a dress from a Chinese dress maker through Etsy. Instead of using designer photos they post their own designs. I was pleased with that because I was looking at photos of their acutal work. That plus almost 300 5-star reviews gave me confidence. I just placed my order on Monday so I&#039;m keeping my fingers crossed!\n\nGood luck.[\/quote]Who did you use from Etsy?  I&#039;m leaning towards Misdress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1884442,"PostDate":1422450454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>yj2cute, on 28 January 2015 - 12:47 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I looked at this site as well. I would go ahead and take the chance and order it. As you said, there are many good reviews with actual photos so your chances of getting something you're happy with is pretty good. I ended up ordering a dress from a Chinese dress maker through Etsy. Instead of using designer photos they post their own designs. I was pleased with that because I was looking at photos of their acutal work. That plus almost 300 5-star reviews gave me confidence. I just placed my order on Monday so I'm keeping my fingers crossed!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Who did you use from Etsy? \u00a0I'm leaning towards Misdress.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1422450870,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d6217e06e9cb975eb8b0e8ac411fcd74","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1884442\" timestamp=\"1422464854\"]\nWho did you use from Etsy?  I&#039;m leaning towards Misdress.[\/quote]\nMisdress was in the running and I had many communications with them but ultimately ordering from Mermaid bridal. I am ordering 2 dresses from Misdress for my daughters though. Misdress has many excellent reviews as well.\n\nI see we have the same date! Congrats date twin. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1884444,"PostDate":1422450791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 28 January 2015 - 01:07 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Who did you use from Etsy? \u00a0I'm leaning towards Misdress.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Misdress was in the running and I had many communications with them but ultimately ordering from Mermaid bridal. I am ordering 2 dresses from Misdress for my daughters though. Misdress has many excellent reviews as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see we have the same date! Congrats date twin. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f4e759a308aa2731dac5a40c35c1726","RawContent":"[quote name=\"yj2cute\" post=\"1884444\" timestamp=\"1422465191\"]\nMisdress was in the running and I had many communications with them but ultimately ordering from Mermaid bridal. I am ordering 2 dresses from Misdress for my daughters though. Misdress has many excellent reviews as well.\n\nI see we have the same date! Congrats date twin. :)[\/quote]Oh we do have the same dates!  Congratulations to you as well!  I will have to check out Mermaid Bridal.  Thanks for the response!","Attachments":[],"Id":1884447,"PostDate":1422451066,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>yj2cute, on 28 January 2015 - 01:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Misdress was in the running and I had many communications with them but ultimately ordering from Mermaid bridal. I am ordering 2 dresses from Misdress for my daughters though. Misdress has many excellent reviews as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I see we have the same date! Congrats date twin. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh we do have the same dates! \u00a0Congratulations to you as well! \u00a0I will have to check out Mermaid Bridal. \u00a0Thanks for the response!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6360,"NextPage":6370,"PreviousPage":6350,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
