Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d8ca58502b69a5b8f90885963e06c64","RawContent":"[quote name=\"AyeWatSoon\" post=\"1875356\" timestamp=\"1413117737\"]\nAny recent updates from those who ordered a dress from Jasmine?[\/quote]\nThere have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure!","Attachments":[],"Id":1875357,"PostDate":1413103502,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>AyeWatSoon, on 12 October 2014 - 08:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Any recent updates from those who ordered a dress from Jasmine?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThere have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbf96152fd805c47c7f1f1b76a47f975","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1875357\" timestamp=\"1413117902\"]\nThere have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure![\/quote]\nThanks! I&#039;ll take a peek.","Attachments":[],"Id":1875358,"PostDate":1413103731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 12 October 2014 - 08:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>There have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks! I'll take a peek. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.116.100.158","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1413113361,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbec5dc5f243291c9a6196c9a7216010","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1875357\" timestamp=\"1413117902\"]\nThere have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure![\/quote]\nThreads have been removed, the latest was #19. The wedding bee administrators have removed them because they did not want any particular replica bridal shop name on the threads, also to avoid any legal issues. There is a new thread created for all the girls interested, everyone&#039;s plan is to continue with their posts and reviews. the new thread does not contain the name of the replica shop","Attachments":[],"Id":1875377,"PostDate":1413113052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 12 October 2014 - 08:45 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>There have been a ton of recent brides posting their mid-production pics over on wedding bees. The forum is dreadfully snarky but the jasmines threads are worth a peek as they are so active. Some beautiful work being done for sure!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Threads have been removed, the latest was #19. The wedding bee administrators have removed them because they did not want any particular replica bridal shop name on the threads, also to avoid any legal issues. There is a new thread created for all the girls interested, everyone's plan is to continue with their posts and reviews. the new thread does not contain the name of the replica shop<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396867157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1431203346","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"816b55228f7f41254cc4dacdea79eef4","RawContent":"Oh wow thanks for the headsup! I was just there yesterday and didn&#039;t notice!","Attachments":[],"Id":1875378,"PostDate":1413113533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Oh wow thanks for the headsup! I was just there yesterday and didn't notice! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"146.71.110.107","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e45295ad21e2e2a539855166cea04d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just ordered my wedding gown from here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.alizeedress.com\/trumpet-mermaid-tank-top-court-train-satin-wedding-dress-adwpb0046.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.alizeedress.com\/trumpet-mermaid-tank-top-court-train-satin-wedding-dress-adwpb0046.html&lt;\/a&gt;   I love its lace design, hope it won&#039;t let me down.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876339,"PostDate":1413846871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just ordered my wedding gown from here: <a href='http:\/\/www.alizeedress.com\/trumpet-mermaid-tank-top-court-train-satin-wedding-dress-adwpb0046.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.alizeedre...-adwpb0046.html<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0 I love its lace design, hope it won't let me down.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/plus.google.com\/104220257203424350449\/posts'>G+ Page<\/a>","Email":"melody.chen27@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"203.185.31.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1404343088,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Melody743281","Id":278805,"Name":"Melody743281","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.27.141","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e95ad388299cfe9c62cef78aa3912902","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calmlywilde\" post=\"1789955\" timestamp=\"1376210904\"]\nI read every page of this thread and finally got my plus-size Vera Wang Gemma inspired dress based on the reviews from \"alj\" at around page 340.  It&#039;s from Vivian Xu, an eBay who sells under noble_dress and vivian_dress and cost $179USD including shipping to NZ.  I&#039;m pretty happy with the result - def doesn&#039;t look like a cheap dress!  The Gemma-gurus out there will realise it&#039;s not an *exact* replica, but I got the \"look\" I was after.      I&#039;m bridal size 16W and 5&#039;6 with 3\" heels.     Full details [url=\"http:\/\/boards.weddingbee.com\/topic\/picsplus-size-gemma-replica-from-ebay-vivian-xu-vivian-dress-noble-dress#axzz2beEakOrl\"]here[\/url] for anyone who&#039;s looking at buying ;)       [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/216291\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/216291\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][\/url][\/quote]\nI know this post is old but I wanted to say she looks amazing in this dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1876575,"PostDate":1413979938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calmlywilde, on 11 August 2013 - 04:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I read every page of this thread and finally got my plus-size Vera Wang Gemma inspired dress based on the reviews from \"alj\" at around page 340.\u00a0 It's from Vivian Xu, an eBay who sells under noble_dress and vivian_dress and cost $179USD including shipping to NZ.\u00a0 I'm pretty happy with the result - def doesn't look like a cheap dress!\u00a0 The Gemma-gurus out there will realise it's not an *exact* replica, but I got the \"look\" I was after.\u00a0  \u00a0  I'm bridal size 16W and 5'6 with 3\" heels.  \u00a0  Full details <a href='http:\/\/boards.weddingbee.com\/topic\/picsplus-size-gemma-replica-from-ebay-vivian-xu-vivian-dress-noble-dress#axzz2beEakOrl' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a> for anyone who's looking at buying <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/> \u00a0  \u00a0  <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/216291\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/216291\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" alt=\"1000\"><\/span><\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI know this post is old but I wanted to say she looks amazing in this dress!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393524530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.105.163.238","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1416237188,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84f0cfac3a3073a4ecce7714551cccad","RawContent":"[quote name=\"atennille\" post=\"1862821\" timestamp=\"1406573377\"]\nI have searched everywhere for this dress. Does anyone know where I can find the designer or more pics ? This is the only pic I have found on a few websites. Please help ! I love and want this dress ![img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28825\"]image.jpg[\/url][\/quote]I know this post is really old and I apologize. This is a dress that I saw in Suzhou, China over the summer. I didn&#039;t try it on, but it&#039;s made in a factory in that city. I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll be able to find it in the United States but with some work you might find it on Alibaba or on TaoBao. You just run the risk of getting a poorly done replica. (this is not a comment on replicas, this is just saying that the dress you order could be made by a different factory with indifferent workers who don&#039;t pay attention to detail... there is just a lot of this behavior in china.)","Attachments":[],"Id":1878599,"PostDate":1416236678,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>atennille, on 28 July 2014 - 02:49 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have searched everywhere for this dress. Does anyone know where I can find the designer or more pics ? This is the only pic I have found on a few websites. Please help ! I love and want this dress !<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28825' class='bbc_url' title=''>image.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I know this post is really old and I apologize. This is a dress that I saw in Suzhou, China over the summer. I didn't try it on, but it's made in a factory in that city. I don't think you'll be able to find it in the United States but with some work you might find it on Alibaba or on TaoBao. You just run the risk of getting a poorly done replica. (this is not a comment on replicas, this is just saying that the dress you order could be made by a different factory with indifferent workers who don't pay attention to detail... there is just a lot of this behavior in china.)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahaparrott@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.105.163.238","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415641320,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Penny905","Id":281078,"Name":"Penny905","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.37.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a13a4d51c753d65d5df50c587ca5aad6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Penny905\" post=\"1878599\" timestamp=\"1416251078\"]\nI know this post is really old and I apologize. This is a dress that I saw in Suzhou, China over the summer. I didn&#039;t try it on, but it&#039;s made in a factory in that city. I don&#039;t think you&#039;ll be able to find it in the United States but with some work you might find it on Alibaba or on TaoBao. You just run the risk of getting a poorly done replica. (this is not a comment on replicas, this is just saying that the dress you order could be made by a different factory with indifferent workers who don&#039;t pay attention to detail... there is just a lot of this behavior in china.)[\/quote]\nRandomly ordering an inspiration dress from a factory in China would be foolish and ill advised, but if you do your homework and document everything along the way, there are some amazing dress makers located all over the world- including China- and you can definitely get a beautiful dress for a reasonable price.","Attachments":[],"Id":1878602,"PostDate":1416238088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Penny905, on 17 November 2014 - 03:04 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I know this post is really old and I apologize. This is a dress that I saw in Suzhou, China over the summer. I didn't try it on, but it's made in a factory in that city. I don't think you'll be able to find it in the United States but with some work you might find it on Alibaba or on TaoBao. You just run the risk of getting a poorly done replica. (this is not a comment on replicas, this is just saying that the dress you order could be made by a different factory with indifferent workers who don't pay attention to detail... there is just a lot of this behavior in china.)<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nRandomly ordering an inspiration dress from a factory in China would be foolish and ill advised, but if you do your homework and document everything along the way, there are some amazing dress makers located all over the world- including China- and you can definitely get a beautiful dress for a reasonable price. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58996493bf64a5c8886dbeb68ed8f66a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"natalie77\" post=\"1807154\" timestamp=\"1381839801\"]\n\nQuote:\nOriginally Posted by [b]amarylka[\/b] [img]http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif[\/img]\n \nhello, looked through all the pictures in this topic, and I decided zam\u00b3iw\u00c4\u2021 dress from babyonline.\nHere it is:\nThis original Esme by Jenny Packham\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222957\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n\nthis image that I got before ordering,\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222958\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222959\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]\n\nmy dress has to be white but other than that I&#039;m very impressed.\nI hope that my will as beautiful and I am looking forward to it.\nI&#039;ll brag about my pictures when the dress arrives there.\nthe dress is beautiful!! I like the top of the replica dress even more than the oryginal...Btw I&#039;m new here too and I&#039;m planing to get married in 2015 and I&#039;m already doing invastigation where to make my dress and I think I will also go for Jasmine bridal shop. Since I can&#039;t decide which dress to buy I think I will combine few dresses into one, there are so many to choose from! \n[\/quote]Hello, all. I&#039;m new to this site. I came across this post and would like to know where this replica was made. I love this dress and the replica is gorgeous. Thanks in advance.","Attachments":[],"Id":1880028,"PostDate":1418135493,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>natalie77, on 15 October 2013 - 08:23 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>Quote:\n<div>Originally Posted by <strong>amarylka<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" alt=\"go_quote.gif\"><\/span><br>\n\u00a0\n<p>hello, looked through all the pictures in this topic, and I decided zam\u00b3iw\u00c4\u2021 dress from babyonline.<br>\nHere it is:<br>\nThis original Esme by Jenny Packham<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222957\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>this image that I got before ordering,<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222958\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/222959\/width\/350\/height\/700\" alt=\"700\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>my dress has to be white but other than that I'm very impressed.<br>\nI hope that my will as beautiful and I am looking forward to it.<br>\nI'll brag about my pictures when the dress arrives there.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>the dress is beautiful!! I like the top of the replica dress even more than the oryginal...Btw I'm new here too and I'm planing to get married in 2015 and I'm already doing invastigation where to make my dress and I think I will also go for Jasmine bridal shop. Since I can't decide which dress to buy I think I will combine few dresses into one, there are so many to choose from!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello, all. I'm new to this site. I came across this post and would like to know where this replica was made. I love this dress and the replica is gorgeous. Thanks in advance.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yjam208@aol.com","IpAddress":"173.161.129.93","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418135287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"yj2cute","Id":281357,"Name":"yj2cute","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87510dc50b919191ed4ba035ab8ee32c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880030,"PostDate":1418138498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I know this page is old, but I hope we can revive it. I am on the hunt for a galia lahav replica, in blush.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"So far 41 guests + bride and groom + 10 kids = 95 room nights.    Focused on planning without stressing.","Email":"bush.chanel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"170.115.248.23","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401288470,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"TheBHolders","Id":278146,"Name":"TheBHolders","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6350,"NextPage":6360,"PreviousPage":6340,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
