Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"182.253.49.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a50d97e966670615dd24ea1539e3c628","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;how much budget if i want buy?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864371,"PostDate":1407103185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>how much budget if i want buy?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louis.mcwright@gmail.com","IpAddress":"182.253.48.94","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406070757,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"louis123","Id":279132,"Name":"louis123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1525206b12c4e6190f517e4e8dd44881","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ok... well I have reached my 150 posts Yay for me!!! I have been looking through this thread and although it was extremely informative I somehow feel more confused. Or maybe it is just too much information in too little time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For last week or so I have been looking through online stores that had good reviews and fell in love with a dress sold by babyonline, and I keep going back to it. one&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/store\/product\/2013-sexy-a-line-sweetheart-chiffon-strapless\/84928910.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/store\/product\/2013-sexy-a-line-sweetheart-chiffon-strapless\/84928910.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My main concern with ordering from babyonline is the beading. This dress is fairly simple and In my opinion the beading makes this dress. If it ends up with cheap looking beads I think it could make a huge difference in the overall look. I did email Jasmins tonight with the info, waiting for a reply. But now am thinking of dressilyme.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"candle23\"] I really like your dress and the outcome of it. but trying to see more of the beading at the neckline if you have close up pictures. What are your thoughts about it?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not really in a hurry, i&#039;m going to try on dresses for the first time in 2 or 3 weeks, and maybe my thoughts about what I like and suits me are way off. But I just cannot stop thinking about this dress.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Help!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864374,"PostDate":1407106536,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ok... well I have reached my 150 posts Yay for me!!! I have been looking through this thread and although it was extremely informative I somehow feel more confused. Or maybe it is just too much information in too little time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For last week or so I have been looking through online stores that had good reviews and fell in love with a dress sold by babyonline, and I keep going back to it. one\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/store\/product\/2013-sexy-a-line-sweetheart-chiffon-strapless\/84928910.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dhgate.co...s\/84928910.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My main concern with ordering from babyonline is the beading. This dress is fairly simple and In my opinion the beading makes this dress. If it ends up with cheap looking beads I think it could make a huge difference in the overall look. I did email Jasmins tonight with the info, waiting for a reply. But now am thinking of dressilyme.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272291\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272291-candle23\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">candle23<\/span><\/a> I really like your dress and the outcome of it. but trying to see more of the beading at the neckline if you have close up pictures. What are your thoughts about it?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not really in a hurry, i'm going to try on dresses for the first time in 2 or 3 weeks, and maybe my thoughts about what I like and suits me are way off. But I just cannot stop thinking about this dress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Help!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43a0af5688ce2a1bae73eec867a57bd5","RawContent":"@Lillian84 just look back, I did post pictures of the dress I bought in January. It is from Dressilyme. I would definitely recommend them, I think they did a great job on my dress. But...I did just order a second dress! I was just having a lot of mixed feeling about the dress, I think it is beautiful and really do love it, but the style that it is (slight mermaid) it isn&#039;t the most comfortable thing to move around in. I know that most wedding dresses aren&#039;t, but I want to feel a little comfy!! \n\n\nI would for sure say to go and try on dresses and get a good feel for what you are looking for before deciding! \n\n\nWill keep everyone posted on how this dress turns out! Even better too is that I am not telling anyone besides my sisters about this dress....so it will be a surprise!","Attachments":[],"Id":1864504,"PostDate":1407175733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @Lillian84 just look back, I did post pictures of the dress I bought in January. It is from Dressilyme. I would definitely recommend them, I think they did a great job on my dress. But...I did just order a second dress! I was just having a lot of mixed feeling about the dress, I think it is beautiful and really do love it, but the style that it is (slight mermaid) it isn't the most comfortable thing to move around in. I know that most wedding dresses aren't, but I want to feel a little comfy!! <br><br>\nI would for sure say to go and try on dresses and get a good feel for what you are looking for before deciding! <br><br>\nWill keep everyone posted on how this dress turns out! Even better too is that I am not telling anyone besides my sisters about this dress....so it will be a surprise! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f472e02d82e0763db5b9e7ecbf981340","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you @[member=\"candle23\"] I did see more of your pictures and they really did a great job. Your second dress is beautiful, hope you are comfy in it. Can&#039;t wait to see it!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864530,"PostDate":1407189318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"272291\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/272291-candle23\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">candle23<\/span><\/a> I did see more of your pictures and they really did a great job. Your second dress is beautiful, hope you are comfy in it. Can't wait to see it!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c45519465ff206cb2d9f96fa4e4b3a25","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Questiong for girls that used Jasmine. I emailed them on Sunday and still haven&#039;t heard anything from them. How long did it take for them to respond?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864732,"PostDate":1407273468,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Questiong for girls that used Jasmine. I emailed them on Sunday and still haven't heard anything from them. How long did it take for them to respond?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.23.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51bb59b171530cf81989adae99dc321d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lilian84\" post=\"1864732\" timestamp=\"1407287868\"]\nQuestiong for girls that used Jasmine. I emailed them on Sunday and still haven&#039;t heard anything from them. How long did it take for them to respond?[\/quote]In reading on the weddingbee site I know they are quite busy. \n\nI&#039;d wait another day or two and then maybe reach out to them there or on Facebook","Attachments":[],"Id":1864748,"PostDate":1407281222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilian84, on 05 August 2014 - 09:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Questiong for girls that used Jasmine. I emailed them on Sunday and still haven't heard anything from them. How long did it take for them to respond?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nIn reading on the weddingbee site I know they are quite busy. <br><br>\nI'd wait another day or two and then maybe reach out to them there or on Facebook \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1407282046,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdb356500f9a1124d0d2eaef1d520274","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;thanks @[member=\"kmk2016\"] I&#039;ll give it until Firday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864749,"PostDate":1407282033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a> I'll give it until Firday.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.47.49.223","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"365877e494eac34e956a90294ae11a31","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I did see some dresses online that were far less expensive than the original. &amp;nbsp;I opted not to go that route as I felt that it was too risky. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m glad to hear that lots of brides had success!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1868577,"PostDate":1408907513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I did see some dresses online that were far less expensive than the original. \u00a0I opted not to go that route as I felt that it was too risky. \u00a0I'm glad to hear that lots of brides had success!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408543857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9555c562a9ced56965adebcdc2c0b89b","RawContent":"Just got an email today that my dress and veil have been shipped! Yay! This dress is a surprise purchase that FI doesn&#039;t know about so I am sure hoping it doesn&#039;t come today since he decided to play hooky with work and stay home with me! Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1868800,"PostDate":1408975274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just got an email today that my dress and veil have been shipped! Yay! This dress is a surprise purchase that FI doesn't know about so I am sure hoping it doesn't come today since he decided to play hooky with work and stay home with me! Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.208.82","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d1aeb8ed455b4bab8b4ddf85f06b7826","RawContent":"[quote name=\"candle23\" post=\"1868800\" timestamp=\"1408989674\"]\nJust got an email today that my dress and veil have been shipped! Yay! This dress is a surprise purchase that FI doesn&#039;t know about so I am sure hoping it doesn&#039;t come today since he decided to play hooky with work and stay home with me! Lol[\/quote]awesome! Make sure you post pics of your inspiration and the final product!!!! Exciting! Its been slow here lately of brides getting their dresses!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1868815,"PostDate":1408977435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>candle23, on 25 August 2014 - 02:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Just got an email today that my dress and veil have been shipped! Yay! This dress is a surprise purchase that FI doesn't know about so I am sure hoping it doesn't come today since he decided to play hooky with work and stay home with me! Lol<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>awesome! Make sure you post pics of your inspiration and the final product!!!! Exciting! Its been slow here lately of brides getting their dresses!!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6330,"NextPage":6340,"PreviousPage":6320,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
