 to 5% on August 3rd. Hope she replies my email<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nThey post on wedding bee forum and yesterday that they are busy and replies may be delayed for 3-5 days.... Check out the thread... jasmines dresses part XVIII is the latest thread \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.93.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b42e089173149ec1b91db40c99fe8997","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kmk2016\"] I was reading last night and will continue today, honestly those dresses are stunning, I was amazed :D&amp;nbsp;and excited about their work. did you use Western,BOA or CC ? I read a few concerns about Western but did not finish to see if people have been able to wire the payment with no issues or flags. Also she offers the designer lace which seems to be gorgeous.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862957,"PostDate":1406617652,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@