Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80b3c04bb2d77bb165e8e5917d1261b4","RawContent":"Jasmines, Cara and dressily are the most talked about here and on other sites. jasmines is great for more intricate beading and lace. You have the wrong link though- it&#039;s jasmines bridal. Read through this thread as much as possible- it will give you a ton of information. I also recommend reading up on weddingbee forum where there are a lot of posts in super active forums.","Attachments":[],"Id":1862553,"PostDate":1406460283,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Jasmines, Cara and dressily are the most talked about here and on other sites. jasmines is great for more intricate beading and lace. You have the wrong link though- it's jasmines bridal. Read through this thread as much as possible- it will give you a ton of information. I also recommend reading up on weddingbee forum where there are a lot of posts in super active forums. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.93.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"556f240d89fd9aaf9a0b95a0e723dd25","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1862553\" timestamp=\"1406474683\"]\nJasmines, Cara and dressily are the most talked about here and on other sites. jasmines is great for more intricate beading and lace. You have the wrong link though- it&#039;s jasmines bridal. Read through this thread as much as possible- it will give you a ton of information. I also recommend reading up on weddingbee forum where there are a lot of posts in super active forums.[\/quote]Thank you @[member=\"kmk2016\"], Yes i am looking at a trumpet mermaid OR fit and flare lace with beads. I will look for jasmines bridal [url=\"http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/[\/url] which I think is what I saw. Dressily was one that I missed on my previous.\nas far as makeup what are you doing? thanks again","Attachments":[],"Id":1862573,"PostDate":1406462214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 27 July 2014 - 11:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Jasmines, Cara and dressily are the most talked about here and on other sites. jasmines is great for more intricate beading and lace. You have the wrong link though- it's jasmines bridal. Read through this thread as much as possible- it will give you a ton of information. I also recommend reading up on weddingbee forum where there are a lot of posts in super active forums.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a>, Yes i am looking at a trumpet mermaid OR fit and flare lace with beads. I will look for jasmines bridal\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/<\/a>\u00a0which I think is what I saw. Dressily was one that I missed on my previous.<\/p>\n<p>as far as makeup what are you doing? thanks again\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396867157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1431203346","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49b10d1b886d310d9b4cec15266df471","RawContent":"[quote name=\"linaco80\" post=\"1862573\" timestamp=\"1406476614\"]\nThank you @[member=\"kmk2016\"], Yes i am looking at a trumpet mermaid OR fit and flare lace with beads. I will look for jasmines bridal [url=\"http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/\"]http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/[\/url] which I think is what I saw. Dressily was one that I missed on my previous.\nas far as makeup what are you doing? thanks again[\/quote]I have a makeup artist in my bridal party so she will be doing my makeup. The bridal party will all be doing their own. (I also have a hair stylist who is attending- but who is not part of the bridal party. She will do everyone&#039;s hair.","Attachments":[],"Id":1862592,"PostDate":1406463947,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>linaco80, on 27 July 2014 - 11:56 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Thank you @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a>, Yes i am looking at a trumpet mermaid OR fit and flare lace with beads. I will look for jasmines bridal <a href='http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.JasminesBridalShop.com\/<\/a> which I think is what I saw. Dressily was one that I missed on my previous.<br>\nas far as makeup what are you doing? thanks again<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI have a makeup artist in my bridal party so she will be doing my makeup. The bridal party will all be doing their own. (I also have a hair stylist who is attending- but who is not part of the bridal party. She will do everyone's hair. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.93.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7d9da2d3abb77b4beec80bb4c0d0ed8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"kmk2016\"] awesome!!! thanks for helping out&amp;nbsp; :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862594,"PostDate":1406464090,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                  