> User jacquewedding (283943)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.31.207.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1406199341,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"49af1e11d81375b89788c6ced9deef24","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.dhresource.com\/albu_780752709_00\/1.thumb.jpg\" alt=\"1.thumb.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is the dress I want, I love the puffy style so pretty. :D&amp;nbsp;I also requested photos but she keeps ignoring me, I read that sunny doesn&#039;t post pics this is who im working with through emails about my product, But I wish she did!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862000,"PostDate":1406198603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.dhresource.com\/albu_780752709_00\/1.thumb.jpg\" alt=\"1.thumb.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is the dress I want, I love the puffy style so pretty. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>\u00a0I also requested photos but she keeps ignoring me, I read that sunny doesn't post pics this is who im working with through emails about my product, But I wish she did!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittkneexods@aol.com","IpAddress":"4.31.207.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406127259,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Imaculent","Id":279144,"Name":"Imaculent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ba466593291cde0a439bcd56bdb2fab","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Imaculent\" post=\"1862000\" timestamp=\"1406213003\"]\n[img]http:\/\/www.dhresource.com\/albu_780752709_00\/1.thumb.jpg[\/img]\n\n\nThis is the dress I want, I love the puffy style so pretty. :D I also requested photos but she keeps ignoring me, I read that sunny doesn&#039;t post pics this is who im working with through emails about my product, But I wish she did!![\/quote]Pretty! \n\nI&#039;m sure it will be fabulous! Yeah- my dresses are fairly detailed so I&#039;m thankful Jasmines has a \"mid production photo\" option. Just in case there are parts I need them to change\/fix. \n\nCan&#039;t wait to see it on you when it arrives! When&#039;s it&#039;s ETA? \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862004,"PostDate":1406199653,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Imaculent, on 24 July 2014 - 10:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.dhresource.com\/albu_780752709_00\/1.thumb.jpg\" alt=\"1.thumb.jpg\"><\/span><br><br><br>\nThis is the dress I want, I love the puffy style so pretty. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/> I also requested photos but she keeps ignoring me, I read that sunny doesn't post pics this is who im working with through emails about my product, But I wish she did!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nPretty! <br><br>\nI'm sure it will be fabulous! Yeah- my dresses are fairly detailed so I'm thankful Jasmines has a \"mid production photo\" option. Just in case there are parts I need them to change\/fix. <br><br>\nCan't wait to see it on you when it arrives! When's it's ETA? <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"4.31.207.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1458ec721d4cff4a67dd3acae712cb00","RawContent":"[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1862004\" timestamp=\"1406214053\"]\nPretty!\n\nI&#039;m sure it will be fabulous! Yeah- my dresses are fairly detailed so I&#039;m thankful Jasmines has a \"mid production photo\" option. Just in case there are parts I need them to change\/fix.\n\nCan&#039;t wait to see it on you when it arrives! When&#039;s it&#039;s ETA?\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\n\nThe ETA proposed is August 13 which still give me 30 days to find a dress if this one is just horrible and I cant do anything with it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1862009,"PostDate":1406202991,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 24 July 2014 - 11:00 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Pretty!<br><br>\nI'm sure it will be fabulous! Yeah- my dresses are fairly detailed so I'm thankful Jasmines has a \"mid production photo\" option. Just in case there are parts I need them to change\/fix.<br><br>\nCan't wait to see it on you when it arrives! When's it's ETA?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The ETA proposed is August 13 which still give me 30 days to find a dress if this one is just horrible and I cant do anything with it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittkneexods@aol.com","IpAddress":"4.31.207.18","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406127259,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Imaculent","Id":279144,"Name":"Imaculent","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.251.90.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45860eb2985ed15e6a9fcdff97e2a520","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I looked at a few but I was so worried baout sizing and if the quality was too poor to have altered well! Good luck though!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862294,"PostDate":1406292833,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I looked at a few but I was so worried baout sizing and if the quality was too poor to have altered well! Good luck though!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"becassidy@ymail.com","IpAddress":"151.151.109.15","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1392737096,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"becassidy","Id":276764,"Name":"becassidy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.25.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d13d3eef22a6d64f3b8e9f70ef32e70","RawContent":"[quote name=\"becassidy\" post=\"1862294\" timestamp=\"1406307233\"]\nI looked at a few but I was so worried baout sizing and if the quality was too poor to have altered well! Good luck though!![\/quote]Definitely- if you don&#039;t do research and choose a vendor that has done a ton of brides and who are happy- it could be a nightmare. Allowing time for alterations and going with a respected company (even if it&#039;s a bit more expensive) is soooo worth it! I&#039;m thrilled with Jasmines and can&#039;t wait to order and receive my dresses! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862300,"PostDate":1406293603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>becassidy, on 25 July 2014 - 12:53 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I looked at a few but I was so worried baout sizing and if the quality was too poor to have altered well! Good luck though!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDefinitely- if you don't do research and choose a vendor that has done a ton of brides and who are happy- it could be a nightmare. Allowing time for alterations and going with a respected company (even if it's a bit more expensive) is soooo worth it! I'm thrilled with Jasmines and can't wait to order and receive my dresses! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.168.187.46","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26696e51449bb39df50309a193b06a6b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn&#039;t have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862414,"PostDate":1406327052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn't have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1862414]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-57015200-1406341055.jpg\" title=\"melovely1 (1).JPG -  100.65KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-57015200-1406341055.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"melovely1 (1).JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1862414]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-71114700-1406341074.jpg\" title=\"melovely2 (1).JPG -  99.48KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-71114700-1406341074.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"melovely2 (1).JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1862414]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-33823900-1406341152.jpg\" title=\"melovely3 (1).JPG -  86.47KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_07_2014\/post-277623-0-33823900-1406341152.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"melovely3 (1).JPG\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.toney09@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.178.125.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397665961,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"atoney86","Id":277623,"Name":"atoney86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.37.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d73d6127c77adfd68b209a6fdef2f0a1","RawContent":"[quote name=\"atoney86\" post=\"1862414\" timestamp=\"1406341452\"]\nHi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn&#039;t have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28799\"]melovely1 (1).JPG[\/url][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28800\"]melovely2 (1).JPG[\/url][img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28801\"]melovely3 (1).JPG[\/url][\/quote]So pretty! You look great! Congrats!!! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862418,"PostDate":1406329221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>atoney86, on 25 July 2014 - 10:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi, I am new as well. I got my dress made by Carabridal and I absolutely love my dress. I am so happy I went this route. I just did not see anything I truly loved in my price range at the bridal salons. This is me at alterations. The bust was slightly big so she will take it in and I am a bit hippy, so my seasmstress is going to let it out a tiny bit. So glad she is doing it as a gift. Definitely budget for alterations... If I didn't have my wonderful seamstress, I probably would have paid some $$$$ to have my dress perfect.<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28799' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely1 (1).JPG<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28800' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely2 (1).JPG<\/a><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28801' class='bbc_url' title=''>melovely3 (1).JPG<\/a><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSo pretty! You look great! Congrats!!! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d453e8bba2f2a0a5f1e7558a4e877c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;HI,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am currently looking at a dress I really like from babyonline through dhgates. Anyone have experience with them? My main concern is the beading... that it might not be the same.&amp;nbsp; :wacko:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However it is quite cheap, and if ever I do not like it it wouldn&#039;t the end of the world... I could always try selling it. Just looking for some feedback.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862467,"PostDate":1406381141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>HI,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am currently looking at a dress I really like from babyonline through dhgates. Anyone have experience with them? My main concern is the beading... that it might not be the same.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However it is quite cheap, and if ever I do not like it it wouldn't the end of the world... I could always try selling it. Just looking for some feedback.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">I'm lucky I'm in love with my best friend<\/span><\/em>","Email":"lily_1202@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.157.233.83","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406376249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279175.jpg?_r=1406605860","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lilian84","Id":279175,"Name":"Lilian84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.37.138","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"304748e593503b13a773309be1caae8e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lilian84\" post=\"1862467\" timestamp=\"1406395541\"]\nHI,\n\nI am currently looking at a dress I really like from babyonline through dhgates. Anyone have experience with them? My main concern is the beading... that it might not be the same.  :wacko:\n\nHowever it is quite cheap, and if ever I do not like it it wouldn&#039;t the end of the world... I could always try selling it. Just looking for some feedback.\n\nThank you[\/quote]There are a lot of brides who have used them for simpler dresses... Many have pics. Read through this thread and I&#039;m sure you will see lots! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1862479,"PostDate":1406383883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lilian84, on 26 July 2014 - 01:25 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>HI,<br><br>\nI am currently looking at a dress I really like from babyonline through dhgates. Anyone have experience with them? My main concern is the beading... that it might not be the same.  <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><br><br>\nHowever it is quite cheap, and if ever I do not like it it wouldn't the end of the world... I could always try selling it. Just looking for some feedback.<br><br>\nThank you<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThere are a lot of brides who have used them for simpler dresses... Many have pics. Read through this thread and I'm sure you will see lots! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.117.93.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4abc0260aebecf4712b2b430007ec95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] @[member=\"tygrrlily\"] Hello Girls, this dress topic (among all that goes on the for a DW) is driving me very confused. I had almost made an order for the Maggie dress at $1,700 and after reading this thread I dont think i will move forward with that (saving cash will help tons)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If I understood well all your comments I can look for dresses online (see below websites mentioned), send pictures (if I have a special photo request perhaps will pay an extra fee $30 for the pic), order and also ask for pictures in the mid production?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Dresshop which apparently seems to buy dresses from China and re-sell them&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dresshop.com.au\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dresshop.com.au&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Judys Bridal&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.judysbridal.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.judysbridal.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Babyonline (hope this is the same website you were referring to)&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.babyonlinedress.com\/index.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.babyonlinedress.com\/index.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;DHgate which seems to have good reputation with the quality and very reasonable prices&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/wholesale+wedding+dresses.html#hp1403-lc-7-0&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/wholesale+wedding+dresses.html#hp1403-lc-7-0&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/wholesale+wedding+dresses.html#hp1403-lc-7-0&#039;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Light in the box &amp;nbsp;(previously mentioned)&lt;\/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Jasmine &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/ugC_Home.asp&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/ugC_Home.asp&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(this one takes me to a site that has a boutique locator in the US, it does not seem to be overseas where I can order unless i am looking at the wrong site)&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Carabridal which I read the following and I am not sure&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/forums.theknot.com\/discussion\/1011229\/beware-of-carabridal-on-etsy&#039;&gt;http:\/\/forums.theknot.com\/discussion\/1011229\/beware-of-carabridal-on-etsy&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;li&gt;Amazing Bridals also on Etsy from&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.amazingbridals.com\/index.php&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.amazingbridals.com\/index.php&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/li&gt;\n&lt;\/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;If I get a good deal I might end up buying two gowns (1 for my wedding day and the second for my TTD as my photographer suggested that) I was not looking at two gowns for the original cost of just one, but now that I found this boards, I feel more comfortable as I was super skeptical with ordering dresses online and I am a chicken when it comes to this specially because the boutique lady told me that I am just on time to order my dress since it takes 6 months to arrive and if I dont order they wont commit (very scary because dress will come in Jan\/feb and wedding is in April), any ways after reading enough I would feel comfortable and more learning that i will save $1,000 or about.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The question for you girls is ...which of the sites above do you recommend ? If I also provided the wrong links please advise as of which is the correct one. Thanks so much for your help, I appreciate it..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;ahh one more thing @[member=\"kmk2016\"], Are you using the beauty salon from Sensatori on your wedding date to get your hairdo and makeup or will you bring someone from outside?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am thinking to bring beso drides &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.yucatanhair.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.yucatanhair.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;after I read so many good things about them and have been communicating with them but I am not sure yet who I will use and if it is neccesary to bring someone from outside (I read the board about the Azul &amp;nbsp;beach bride who brought them). I am just not sure if I would like to have air brush or just prime (will have to try it on me first). Also I also feel super bad because I bringing all my outside vendor (photo, DJ) and not sure if many brides do that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you once again :) Linaco&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1862551,"PostDate":1406460017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> Hello Girls, this dress topic (among all that goes on the for a DW) is driving me very confused. I had almost made an order for the Maggie dress at $1,700 and after reading this thread I dont think i will move forward with that (saving cash will help tons)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If I understood well all your comments I can look for dresses online (see below websites mentioned), send pictures (if I have a special photo request perhaps will pay an extra fee $30 for the pic), order and also ask for pictures in the mid production?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<ul><li>Dresshop which apparently seems to buy dresses from China and re-sell them\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.dresshop.com.au\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dresshop.com.au<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Judys Bridal\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.judysbridal.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.judysbridal.com\/<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Babyonline (hope this is the same website you were referring to)\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.babyonlinedress.com\/index.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.babyonlin....com\/index.html<\/a><\/li>\n<li>DHgate which seems to have good reputation with the quality and very reasonable prices\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/wholesale+wedding+dresses.html#hp1403-lc-7-0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.dhgate.co...l#hp1403-lc-7-0<\/a><\/li>\n<li><a href='http:\/\/www.dhgate.com\/wholesale+wedding+dresses.html#hp1403-lc-7-0' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><u>Light in the box \u00a0(previously mentioned)<\/u>\u00a0<\/a><a href='http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.lightinthebox.com\/<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Jasmine <a href='http:\/\/www.jasminebridal.com\/ugC_Home.asp' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jasminebr...om\/ugC_Home.asp<\/a>\u00a0(this one takes me to a site that has a boutique locator in the US, it does not seem to be overseas where I can order unless i am looking at the wrong site)<\/li>\n<li>Carabridal which I read the following and I am not sure\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/forums.theknot.com\/discussion\/1011229\/beware-of-carabridal-on-etsy' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/forums.thekno...abridal-on-etsy<\/a><\/li>\n<li>Amazing Bridals also on Etsy from\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.amazingbridals.com\/index.php' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amazingbr...s.com\/index.php<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul><p>If I get a good deal I might end up buying two gowns (1 for my wedding day and the second for my TTD as my photographer suggested that) I was not looking at two gowns for the original cost of just one, but now that I found this boards, I feel more comfortable as I was super skeptical with ordering dresses online and I am a chicken when it comes to this specially because the boutique lady told me that I am just on time to order my dress since it takes 6 months to arrive and if I dont order they wont commit (very scary because dress will come in Jan\/feb and wedding is in April), any ways after reading enough I would feel comfortable and more learning that i will save $1,000 or about.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The question for you girls is ...which of the sites above do you recommend ? If I also provided the wrong links please advise as of which is the correct one. Thanks so much for your help, I appreciate it..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>ahh one more thing @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276231\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/276231-kmk2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">kmk2016<\/span><\/a>, Are you using the beauty salon from Sensatori on your wedding date to get your hairdo and makeup or will you bring someone from outside?<\/p>\n<p>I am thinking to bring beso drides <a href='http:\/\/www.yucatanhair.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.yucatanhair.com\/<\/a>\u00a0after I read so many good things about them and have been communicating with them but I am not sure yet who I will use and if it is neccesary to bring someone from outside (I read the board about the Azul \u00a0beach bride who brought them). I am just not sure if I would like to have air brush or just prime (will have to try it on me first). Also I also feel super bad because I bringing all my outside vendor (photo, DJ) and not sure if many brides do that.<\/p>\n<p>Thank you once again <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Linaco<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Check my planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79170-azul-sensatori-april-2015-wedding-many-pics-and-planning-tips\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10765;484\/st\/20150410\/e\/Our+Wedding+\/k\/3e00\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div>[\/url]<\/div>\n","Email":"tkandlina@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.134.72.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396867157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277499.jpg?_r=1431203346","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"linaco80","Id":277499,"Name":"linaco80","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6300,"NextPage":6310,"PreviousPage":6290,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
