{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.183.10.122","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b206dcf1bb726e3a25b9bb4c02d45a94","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Tinkerbell82\" post=\"1848030\" timestamp=\"1399062078\"]\nHi everyone! I&#039;m back! I wanted to do a youtube video to explain how I got my dream dress for less than $250. It took WAY longer to film and edit than I thought, haha. Here&#039;s the Link:\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=VrdpyuUTT5I\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=VrdpyuUTT5I[\/url][\/quote]Absolutely beautiful thanks for the video watching it move really helped!","Attachments":[],"Id":1848761,"PostDate":1399483733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Tinkerbell82, on 02 May 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone! I'm back! I wanted to do a youtube video to explain how I got my dream dress for less than $250. It took WAY longer to film and edit than I thought, haha. Here's the Link:<br><br><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=VrdpyuUTT5I' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....h?v=VrdpyuUTT5I<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Absolutely beautiful thanks for the video watching it move really helped!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"terrianncampbell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"65.183.10.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399479955,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277882.jpg?_r=1399907247","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Terriann","Id":277882,"Name":"Terriann","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.185.99.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5af39d5233b54aa168f5c841a83b3e1","RawContent":"Thank you ladies so much!  I actually accidentally posted it on my personal account - here&#039;s the link to my Frugal Fun &amp;amp; Fabulous account.  I&#039;m working on a follow up video with more info &amp;amp; the TTD pics! :)\n\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCg799mzzr6XmPOC3XgPbbdw\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCg799mzzr6XmPOC3XgPbbdw[\/url]\n[quote name=\"HappilyEverAfter\" post=\"1848504\" timestamp=\"1399410928\"]\nAbsolutely brilliant and now im comfortable to order online for my dress. Thank you[\/quote]\n[quote name=\"kmk2016\" post=\"1848505\" timestamp=\"1399411076\"]\nAwesome recap video! I was almost certain this would be my plan too- and your video sealed the deal for me!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\n[quote name=\"Terriann\" post=\"1848761\" timestamp=\"1399498133\"]\nAbsolutely beautiful thanks for the video watching it move really helped![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1848850,"PostDate":1399489561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you ladies so much! \u00a0I actually accidentally posted it on my personal account - here's the link to my Frugal Fun & Fabulous account. \u00a0I'm working on a follow up video with more info & the TTD pics! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/channel\/UCg799mzzr6XmPOC3XgPbbdw' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.youtube....r6XmPOC3XgPbbdw<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HappilyEverAfter, on 06 May 2014 - 05:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Absolutely brilliant and now im comfortable to order online for my dress. Thank you<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>kmk2016, on 06 May 2014 - 05:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Awesome recap video! I was almost certain this would be my plan too- and your video sealed the deal for me!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Terriann, on 07 May 2014 - 05:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Absolutely beautiful thanks for the video watching it move really helped!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinacavanaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.87.40.1","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369072692,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tinkerbell82","Id":269788,"Name":"Tinkerbell82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"72.185.99.211","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abf5fd34cb05a4f0ad188b928fbba288","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here it is ladies- Part 2 with TTD pics. :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=rrVsp6elgR4&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1848865,"PostDate":1399500522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here it is ladies- Part 2 with TTD pics. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/rrVsp6elgR4?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinacavanaugh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.87.40.1","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1369072692,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-269788.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tinkerbell82","Id":269788,"Name":"Tinkerbell82","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"95.145.61.143","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbce67e47993c74576e6b095d7e4749f","RawContent":"Wow Tinker bell the insight is really good and important for  me. Weddings cost so much and to get a dress as well constructed for \"silly\" money is awesome.  You looked incredible and I&#039;m definetly going to use the seller. Thanks again. I&#039;m so excited now!\n\n\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1848975,"PostDate":1399549406,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wow Tinker bell the insight is really good and important for  me. Weddings cost so much and to get a dress as well constructed for \"silly\" money is awesome.  You looked incredible and I'm definetly going to use the seller. Thanks again. I'm so excited now!<br><br>\nSent from my SM-N9005 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"divaexquisitehair@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.43.173.75","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1390088334,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276188.jpg?_r=1399653269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HappilyEverAfter","Id":276188,"Name":"HappilyEverAfter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd874ed56de1d550501726b01e29435e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Tinkerbell82&amp;nbsp; your dress is absolutely stunning! and I love your video!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;do you have a link to the seller? I can&#039;t seem to get the name to come up when I search for it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849014,"PostDate":1399556675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Tinkerbell82\u00a0 your dress is absolutely stunning! and I love your video!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>do you have a link to the seller? I can't seem to get the name to come up when I search for it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.181.77.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"88df8678ecc05a7843a691c4d67bee02","RawContent":"Ur dress is amazing!! Do you think you can post close up for the lace? I&#039;m really interested if it looks of good quality since the dress I want it&#039;s all lace :) thank you so much!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849136,"PostDate":1399591977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ur dress is amazing!! Do you think you can post close up for the lace? I'm really interested if it looks of good quality since the dress I want it's all lace <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thank you so much!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.40.144","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfb75b3d2cf78ec1ddc71843aca2a000","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Carlicardenas\" post=\"1849136\" timestamp=\"1399606377\"]\nUr dress is amazing!! Do you think you can post close up for the lace? I&#039;m really interested if it looks of good quality since the dress I want it&#039;s all lace :) thank you so much!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]As an FYI\/ after reading through this entire thread for a week, and deciding I would be definitely going this route- one thing that was clear was that some vendors were better of others at certain styles,,.. There are some that can send samples of multiple types of lace they use, and offer a variety of options, and some only have 1 or 2 types that they use. There are some great companies out there for sure! This looks to be one of them! \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1849138,"PostDate":1399592366,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Carlicardenas, on 08 May 2014 - 11:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Ur dress is amazing!! Do you think you can post close up for the lace? I'm really interested if it looks of good quality since the dress I want it's all lace <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> thank you so much!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nAs an FYI\/ after reading through this entire thread for a week, and deciding I would be definitely going this route- one thing that was clear was that some vendors were better of others at certain styles,,.. There are some that can send samples of multiple types of lace they use, and offer a variety of options, and some only have 1 or 2 types that they use. There are some great companies out there for sure! This looks to be one of them! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.24.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1400419785,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee6a78bdacf4062890f4728dc375ed74","RawContent":"There is a VERY active board on another forum about Jasmine&#039;s bridal (a custom shop out of a china) that is amazing.., I&#039;ve been following it and the dresses being created for brides are simply breath taking... So my decision has been made! I&#039;m going to set some appointments to go \"no limit\" dress shopping to get an idea of silhouettes that look great and designers I love- and then will have Jasmines make my dresses (ceremony\/TTD and reception). My BMs are excited that we get to go try on $20,000 dresses! \n\n\nThey will also have their BM dresses made over seas which allow me to treat them and keep their costs down considering their expenses in attending the wedding. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1851039,"PostDate":1400419592,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                There is a VERY active board on another forum about Jasmine's bridal (a custom shop out of a china) that is amazing.., I've been following it and the dresses being created for brides are simply breath taking... So my decision has been made! I'm going to set some appointments to go \"no limit\" dress shopping to get an idea of silhouettes that look great and designers I love- and then will have Jasmines make my dresses (ceremony\/TTD and reception). My BMs are excited that we get to go try on $20,000 dresses! <br><br>\nThey will also have their BM dresses made over seas which allow me to treat them and keep their costs down considering their expenses in attending the wedding. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d4290ab541794e144545b9aff3ca570","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;do you know whats the difference between babyonline in DHgate and Babyonline.com? are they both from the same company? thanks :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1851738,"PostDate":1400760958,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>do you know whats the difference between babyonline in DHgate and Babyonline.com? are they both from the same company? thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"8.28.150.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d88f39c501e916a1a43fd311f3dd29b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Carlicardenas\" post=\"1851738\" timestamp=\"1400775358\"]\ndo you know whats the difference between babyonline in DHgate and Babyonline.com? are they both from the same company? thanks :)[\/quote]I believe yes, they are one and the same... DHGate simply acts as a middle man which some people like because they arent handing the money direct to the dressmaker.","Attachments":[],"Id":1851746,"PostDate":1400764695,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Carlicardenas, on 22 May 2014 - 12:15 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>do you know whats the difference between babyonline in DHgate and Babyonline.com? are they both from the same company? thanks <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I believe yes, they are one and the same... DHGate simply acts as a middle man which some people like because they arent handing the money direct to the dressmaker.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390242208,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6240,"NextPage":6250,"PreviousPage":6230,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
