Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.251.28.184","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c74dccc949d60bf52b8c66f9d9749fcf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone! I just received my pictures from Babyonline of my dress. I asked for the top of Allure 8908 and the bottom of Mori Lee 8908 in Ivory. I also requested to detachable sashes in ivory and champagne as I wasn&#039;t sure which color I will wear on my wedding day. I asked for an ivory dress, but it looks white, guess I&#039;ll know better when I see it in person.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Overall, for $268&amp;nbsp;I&#039;m pleased with the top of the dress. The lace on the bottom seems a little cheap looking by the picture, but maybe with crinoline it will fill in better. My other concern was about the dress not having clear beadings on top of the lace appliques throughout the bottom of the dress. I could live without them because even with trying on the Mori Lee 3108 dress, in person you can only see the beading, not in pictures. I did request that they add them. I also wanted to be sure that in the front of the dress the underlay does lay flat like in the back. It seems whoever took the picture just didn&#039;t lay the dress out completely.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have attached my inspiration pics and pics from Babyonline. Please give me your suggestions&amp;nbsp;on any other changes&amp;nbsp;before I have them ship it to me. Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":27042,"Name":"1.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-95080700-1395148090.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-95080700-1395148090_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":1000},{"Id":27043,"Name":"2.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-05520600-1395148143.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-05520600-1395148143_thumb.jpg","Width":793,"Height":1200},{"Id":27044,"Name":"3.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-81094200-1395148167.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-81094200-1395148167_thumb.jpg","Width":745,"Height":1200},{"Id":27045,"Name":"4.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-81013800-1395148188.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-81013800-1395148188_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":27046,"Name":"5.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-44255400-1395148208.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-44255400-1395148208_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":1000},{"Id":27047,"Name":"other_595181980_00.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-02435300-1395148241.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-02435300-1395148241_thumb.jpg","Width":610,"Height":807},{"Id":27048,"Name":"other_595182127_00.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-96143500-1395148253.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-96143500-1395148253_thumb.jpg","Width":610,"Height":813},{"Id":27049,"Name":"other_595182275_00.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-09070800-1395148267.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-275013-0-09070800-1395148267_thumb.jpg","Width":605,"Height":814}],"Id":1838765,"PostDate":1395134818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone! I just received my pictures from Babyonline of my dress. I asked for the top of Allure 8908 and the bottom of Mori Lee 8908 in Ivory. I also requested to detachable sashes in ivory and champagne as I wasn't sure which color I will wear on my wedding day. I asked for an ivory dress, but it looks white, guess I'll know better when I see it in person.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Overall, for $268\u00a0I'm pleased with the top of the dress. The lace on the bottom seems a little cheap looking by the picture, but maybe with crinoline it will fill in better. My other concern was about the dress not having clear beadings on top of the lace appliques throughout the bottom of the dress. I could live without them because even with trying on the Mori Lee 3108 dress, in person you can only see the beading, not in pictures. I did request that they add them. I also wanted to be sure that in the front of the dress the underlay does lay flat like in the back. It seems whoever took the picture just didn't lay the dress out completely.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have attached my inspiration pics and pics from Babyonline. Please give me your suggestions\u00a0on any other changes\u00a0before I have them ship it to me. Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmhawkins_06@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.251.28.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384337429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275013.jpeg?_r=1386593628","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsGoodman","Id":275013,"Name":"MrsGoodman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cd1964a0d2b445dbd8546613ef096385","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;The dress looks beautiful! My only question would be are you happy with the way they&#039;ve attached the skirt part at the bottom? Maybe it&#039;s just the way it&#039;s hanging, but the seam doesn&#039;t seem straight, and I would wonder if it&#039;s supposed to just flow instead of looking like the bottom was attached?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Sorry, just curious?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838767,"PostDate":1395136002,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>The dress looks beautiful! My only question would be are you happy with the way they've attached the skirt part at the bottom? Maybe it's just the way it's hanging, but the seam doesn't seem straight, and I would wonder if it's supposed to just flow instead of looking like the bottom was attached?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sorry, just curious?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df94efc31dc5b53ede6317e6e07f0989","RawContent":"[quote name=\"MrsGoodman\" post=\"1838765\" timestamp=\"1395149218\"]\nHi everyone! I just received my pictures from Babyonline of my dress. I asked for the top of Allure 8908 and the bottom of Mori Lee 8908 in Ivory. I also requested to detachable sashes in ivory and champagne as I wasn&#039;t sure which color I will wear on my wedding day. I asked for an ivory dress, but it looks white, guess I&#039;ll know better when I see it in person.\n\nOverall, for $268 I&#039;m pleased with the top of the dress. The lace on the bottom seems a little cheap looking by the picture, but maybe with crinoline it will fill in better. My other concern was about the dress not having clear beadings on top of the lace appliques throughout the bottom of the dress. I could live without them because even with trying on the Mori Lee 3108 dress, in person you can only see the beading, not in pictures. I did request that they add them. I also wanted to be sure that in the front of the dress the underlay does lay flat like in the back. It seems whoever took the picture just didn&#039;t lay the dress out completely.\n\nI have attached my inspiration pics and pics from Babyonline. Please give me your suggestions on any other changes before I have them ship it to me. Thanks![\/quote]your dress is beautiful! the only concern of mine is the bottom... its not as \"full\" as in teh picture.. or maybe its the way its hanging or the lack of crinoline?\nAlso the sash is not the same as the picture.. are you ok with that?\nI like the lace i dont think it looks cheap! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1838795,"PostDate":1395140784,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>MrsGoodman, on 18 March 2014 - 09:26 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everyone! I just received my pictures from Babyonline of my dress. I asked for the top of Allure 8908 and the bottom of Mori Lee 8908 in Ivory. I also requested to detachable sashes in ivory and champagne as I wasn't sure which color I will wear on my wedding day. I asked for an ivory dress, but it looks white, guess I'll know better when I see it in person.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Overall, for $268\u00a0I'm pleased with the top of the dress. The lace on the bottom seems a little cheap looking by the picture, but maybe with crinoline it will fill in better. My other concern was about the dress not having clear beadings on top of the lace appliques throughout the bottom of the dress. I could live without them because even with trying on the Mori Lee 3108 dress, in person you can only see the beading, not in pictures. I did request that they add them. I also wanted to be sure that in the front of the dress the underlay does lay flat like in the back. It seems whoever took the picture just didn't lay the dress out completely.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have attached my inspiration pics and pics from Babyonline. Please give me your suggestions\u00a0on any other changes\u00a0before I have them ship it to me. Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>your dress is beautiful! the only concern of mine is the bottom... its not as \"full\" as in teh picture.. or maybe its the way its hanging or the lack of crinoline?<\/p>\n<p>Also the sash is not the same as the picture.. are you ok with that?<\/p>\n<p>I like the lace i dont think it looks cheap! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.251.28.184","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1dd64ebd5113218021937fcabd4a70d5","RawContent":"@acw271011@acw271011[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1838767\" timestamp=\"1395150402\"]\nThe dress looks beautiful! My only question would be are you happy with the way they&#039;ve attached the skirt part at the bottom? Maybe it&#039;s just the way it&#039;s hanging, but the seam doesn&#039;t seem straight, and I would wonder if it&#039;s supposed to just flow instead of looking like the bottom was attached?\n \nSorry, just curious?[\/quote]Thanks! I did notice the seam in the back seemed crooked, but I thought it was just me looking at the dress too long. I&#039;ll ask for a closer picture of the skirt to make sure. I noticed that when trying on the Mori Lee 3108, which where the bottom inspiration came from, in person it looked more attached rather than flowy. Once it was on me it didn&#039;t look as bad with crinoline, so I&#039;m hoping it will have the same effect when I try it on with crinoline.\n[quote name=\"Carlicardenas\" post=\"1838795\" timestamp=\"1395155184\"]\nyour dress is beautiful! the only concern of mine is the bottom... its not as \"full\" as in teh picture.. or maybe its the way its hanging or the lack of crinoline?\nAlso the sash is not the same as the picture.. are you ok with that?\nI like the lace i dont think it looks cheap! :)[\/quote]Thanks! It definitely needs crinoline. Without ot doesnt look as full from my experience trying on Mori Lee 3108. The sash should have looked like the one from Mori Lee 3108, but since they made me 2 sashes, I figured they would make the more simpler sash from the Allure dress. Push come to shove I will have more beading added myself or go with more flashy jewelry.  Thanks for you r comment about the lace. I was a little weary, but hopefully crinoline will give it a better look so it won&#039;t seem so separate from the dress.","Attachments":[],"Id":1838926,"PostDate":1395164968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @acw271011@acw271011<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 18 March 2014 - 09:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>The dress looks beautiful! My only question would be are you happy with the way they've attached the skirt part at the bottom? Maybe it's just the way it's hanging, but the seam doesn't seem straight, and I would wonder if it's supposed to just flow instead of looking like the bottom was attached?<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nSorry, just curious?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks! I did notice the seam in the back seemed crooked, but I thought it was just me looking at the dress too long. I'll ask for a closer picture of the skirt to make sure. I noticed that when trying on the Mori Lee 3108, which where the bottom inspiration came from, in person it looked more attached rather than flowy. Once it was on me it didn't look as bad with crinoline, so I'm hoping it will have the same effect when I try it on with crinoline.<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Carlicardenas, on 18 March 2014 - 11:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>your dress is beautiful! the only concern of mine is the bottom... its not as \"full\" as in teh picture.. or maybe its the way its hanging or the lack of crinoline?<br>\nAlso the sash is not the same as the picture.. are you ok with that?<br>\nI like the lace i dont think it looks cheap! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThanks! It definitely needs crinoline. Without ot doesnt look as full from my experience trying on Mori Lee 3108. The sash should have looked like the one from Mori Lee 3108, but since they made me 2 sashes, I figured they would make the more simpler sash from the Allure dress. Push come to shove I will have more beading added myself or go with more flashy jewelry.  Thanks for you r comment about the lace. I was a little weary, but hopefully crinoline will give it a better look so it won't seem so separate from the dress.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cmhawkins_06@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"69.251.28.184","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384337429,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275013.jpeg?_r=1386593628","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsGoodman","Id":275013,"Name":"MrsGoodman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.153.117.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c3212e7767956317d0b2d183141a192","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;awesome&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839037,"PostDate":1395176034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>awesome<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"curltop475@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.39.65.38","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1376387605,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272533.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":89,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci Felton","Id":272533,"Name":"Traci Felton","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"260554f8b69d296ca4b29466ed74dde8","RawContent":"I would love to see your pictures but alas, I have yet to hit the magic 150!! Any chance you can email them to me? Diggleswedding@[member=\"gmail\"].com\n\n\nThanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":1839038,"PostDate":1395176129,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I would love to see your pictures but alas, I have yet to hit the magic 150!! Any chance you can email them to me? Diggleswedding@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<br><br>\nThanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.19.250.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34becf4e062870a1b483bad2fbedbead","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Check out lightinthebox.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839715,"PostDate":1395413417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Check out lightinthebox.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lijohn66@gmail.com","IpAddress":"199.19.250.19","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395397397,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"soontobeONE","Id":277271,"Name":"soontobeONE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c19d90ad479e4807ca281c361ec77a3c","RawContent":"@MrsGoodman\n\nI think it&#039;s beautiful!! I agree with your comments but I think that it can be fixed quite easily!! Congrats in a beautiful purchase! I also bought my dress already, just check back a few pages and I posted pictures of mine. I am also really happy with my purchase!","Attachments":[],"Id":1839762,"PostDate":1395423874,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @MrsGoodman<br>\nI think it's beautiful!! I agree with your comments but I think that it can be fixed quite easily!! Congrats in a beautiful purchase! I also bought my dress already, just check back a few pages and I posted pictures of mine. I am also really happy with my purchase!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"503306c92a623ec177ff19db4ea605e1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;This thread is very helpful. I found a dress I love but can&#039;t afford. A replica is a great option. Does anyone know if I&amp;nbsp;babyonline makes dresses not on their page if I send a pic?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1839796,"PostDate":1395446447,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>This thread is very helpful. I found a dress I love but can't afford. A replica is a great option. Does anyone know if I\u00a0babyonline makes dresses not on their page if I send a pic?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.68.227","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5d20c4ba26a4f2791ffc5a88cd3312a","RawContent":"\n\n\nHello all,\n\n\nI&#039;m hoping to get something similar to the attached. I&#039;ve read through and see that Babyonline, dressilyme and jasmines are the top companies. Any opinion on which would be best for this type of dress?\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1839977,"PostDate":1395605838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839977]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-277246-139562007246.jpg\" title=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1395620074.581930.jpg -  81.79KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-277246-139562007246.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"ImageUploadedByTapatalk1395620074.581930.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n <br><br>\nHello all,<br><br>\nI'm hoping to get something similar to the attached. I've read through and see that Babyonline, dressilyme and jasmines are the top companies. Any opinion on which would be best for this type of dress?<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6210,"NextPage":6220,"PreviousPage":6200,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
