{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a79029d9fbd4817e3a49c616333b645","RawContent":"[quote name=\"candle23\" post=\"1835755\" timestamp=\"1393464633\"]\nMy dress has been shipped!! According to UPS it should arrive on Friday!! I am so nervous and excited![\/quote]\nDefinitely post pics when you get it!! I&#039;d be very curious to know your thoughts on what you receive. I&#039;m also curious - did you order a standard size, or did you do specific measurements? I want champagne colour or the blush pink - did you go with white? If not, how did you decide on the colour? Looking at the \"sample\" colours on the site I&#039;m worried about how close the dress would be to the colours they have posted.","Attachments":[],"Id":1835850,"PostDate":1393511020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>candle23, on 26 February 2014 - 09:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My dress has been shipped!! According to UPS it should arrive on Friday!! I am so nervous and excited!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely post pics when you get it!! I'd be very curious to know your thoughts on\u00a0what you receive. I'm also curious - did you order a standard size, or did you do specific measurements? I want champagne colour or the blush pink - did you go with white? If not, how did you decide on the colour? Looking at the \"sample\" colours on the site I'm worried about how close the dress would be to the colours they have posted.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53fbbdf13496b07976582dfcac3a1d5b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1835850\" timestamp=\"1393525420\"]\nDefinitely post pics when you get it!! I&#039;d be very curious to know your thoughts on what you receive. I&#039;m also curious - did you order a standard size, or did you do specific measurements? I want champagne colour or the blush pink - did you go with white? If not, how did you decide on the colour? Looking at the \"sample\" colours on the site I&#039;m worried about how close the dress would be to the colours they have posted.[\/quote]I am patiently waiting here for UPS to come deliver! Already had to call and argue with them as the online tracking states that delivery was attempted....but it was not!\n\nHopefully it will come soon, going to have dinner with my three sisters and want them there when I try it on!\n\nI chose an ivory color and did the custom sizing. I am hoping that it is perfect!!\n\nWill post when I have a chance to see it and try it on!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836059,"PostDate":1393613233,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 27 February 2014 - 02:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Definitely post pics when you get it!! I'd be very curious to know your thoughts on\u00a0what you receive. I'm also curious - did you order a standard size, or did you do specific measurements? I want champagne colour or the blush pink - did you go with white? If not, how did you decide on the colour? Looking at the \"sample\" colours on the site I'm worried about how close the dress would be to the colours they have posted.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI am patiently waiting here for UPS to come deliver! Already had to call and argue with them as the online tracking states that delivery was attempted....but it was not!<br><br>\nHopefully it will come soon, going to have dinner with my three sisters and want them there when I try it on!<br><br>\nI chose an ivory color and did the custom sizing. I am hoping that it is perfect!!<br><br>\nWill post when I have a chance to see it and try it on!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a9fc3c4f92e9924ab88bfbaa5fcbfc4","RawContent":"I got my dress!! \n\n\nI was shocked to see that the box was so tiny, but they said that they try to fit it in a small box to save in shipping so that was okay with me! I ended up having to pay about $23 extra on delivery...not sure if anyone else has had to do this?\n\n\nI left to my sisters house to meet up with my bridal party(my three sisters) and all had a good laugh about the box....we pulled it out to hang it up and air out before dinner, and it was perfect! Not a wrinkle on it!! So I tried it on!\n\n\nIt fits like a glove!! The lace is different than what the picture shows on the website but it is really pretty! I had it custom made for my measurements and changed the colour from white to ivory and I am very happy with the colour that it is!!\n\n\nFeeling so relieved! Also, the shipping was crazy fast, the whole process really! I ordered on February 9, and it was shipping on February 26 and here two days later!\n\n\nI can&#039;t figure out how to attach a picture on here though! I will work on it....","Attachments":[],"Id":1836129,"PostDate":1393682343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I got my dress!! <br><br>\nI was shocked to see that the box was so tiny, but they said that they try to fit it in a small box to save in shipping so that was okay with me! I ended up having to pay about $23 extra on delivery...not sure if anyone else has had to do this?<br><br>\nI left to my sisters house to meet up with my bridal party(my three sisters) and all had a good laugh about the box....we pulled it out to hang it up and air out before dinner, and it was perfect! Not a wrinkle on it!! So I tried it on!<br><br>\nIt fits like a glove!! The lace is different than what the picture shows on the website but it is really pretty! I had it custom made for my measurements and changed the colour from white to ivory and I am very happy with the colour that it is!!<br><br>\nFeeling so relieved! Also, the shipping was crazy fast, the whole process really! I ordered on February 9, and it was shipping on February 26 and here two days later!<br><br>\nI can't figure out how to attach a picture on here though! I will work on it....\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.181.77.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d00912b42e1413dcccb0e8c2983831a","RawContent":"Omg I can&#039;t wait to see your pictures! I&#039;m extra interested in the lace! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1836130,"PostDate":1393682448,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Omg I can't wait to see your pictures! I'm extra interested in the lace! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bf27558452f01d83997b37df697122e","RawContent":"Can anyone tell me how I can attach a photo?? I can&#039;t seem to figure it out and my fianc\u00e9 would know for sure but I don&#039;t want him to see the dress!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836366,"PostDate":1393809639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Can anyone tell me how I can attach a photo?? I can't seem to figure it out and my fianc\u00e9 would know for sure but I don't want him to see the dress!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d6ad6da57960a7511149ea1d39c0063","RawContent":"[quote name=\"candle23\" post=\"1836366\" timestamp=\"1393824039\"]\nCan anyone tell me how I can attach a photo?? I can&#039;t seem to figure it out and my fianc\u00e9 would know for sure but I don&#039;t want him to see the dress![\/quote]go to more reply options at the bottom of the screen and it will take you to another window where you will see attach file.\nGood luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1836383,"PostDate":1393842506,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>candle23, on 03 March 2014 - 01:20 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Can anyone tell me how I can attach a photo?? I can't seem to figure it out and my fianc\u00e9 would know for sure but I don't want him to see the dress!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>go to more reply options at the bottom of the screen and it will take you to another window where you will see attach file.<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.125.148.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a9613d43ee02225503c3496a393dffc8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, there is some great info on this thread!&amp;nbsp; Doing this never even crossed my mind before!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836391,"PostDate":1393844611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow, there is some great info on this thread!\u00a0 Doing this never even crossed my mind before!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicolefioravanti@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.125.148.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1386324218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"nicofio22","Id":275505,"Name":"nicofio22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f7c35f2825a645cf21f317446252feb","RawContent":"Ok ladies! Here are a couple pictures of the dress! Let me know what you think! And don&#039;t mind how I look!! Haha the end of a long week!","Attachments":[{"Id":26849,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272291-0-05649100-1393865711.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272291-0-05649100-1393865711_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200},{"Id":26850,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272291-0-97353800-1393865867.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-272291-0-97353800-1393865867_thumb.jpg","Width":900,"Height":1200}],"Id":1836426,"PostDate":1393851539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok ladies! Here are a couple pictures of the dress! Let me know what you think! And don't mind how I look!! Haha the end of a long week!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc63dad8fb64043baa5dc2b65b425017","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! that&#039;s gorgeous!! ok so ton of questions! lol&amp;nbsp; what style is it based on? are you happy with the quality of it? how close to size is it? do you need to have further alterations done? when you look at the style you ordered and the style you received, are they in line with what you wanted? would you change it if you could??&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think the dress is stunning, and now you&#039;ve got my curiousity aroused. I&#039;m going to go back and look at their website.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much for the pics!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1836427,"PostDate":1393851925,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! that's gorgeous!! ok so ton of questions! lol\u00a0 what style is it based on? are you happy with the quality of it? how close to size is it? do you need to have further alterations done? when you look at the style you ordered and the style you received, are they in line with what you wanted? would you change it if you could??<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think the dress is stunning, and now you've got my curiousity aroused. I'm going to go back and look at their website.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much for the pics!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3487e86a9a6b55a33a63aaba456027b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"candle23\" post=\"1836426\" timestamp=\"1393865939\"]\nOk ladies! Here are a couple pictures of the dress! Let me know what you think! And don&#039;t mind how I look!! Haha the end of a long week![\/quote]its wonderful!! yes please can you do a comparison of what you order and what you got? what about the quality of the lace? it looks SO GOOD! but what does it feel like?","Attachments":[],"Id":1836431,"PostDate":1393852943,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>candle23, on 03 March 2014 - 12:58 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ok ladies! Here are a couple pictures of the dress! Let me know what you think! And don't mind how I look!! Haha the end of a long week!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>its wonderful!! yes please can you do a comparison of what you order and what you got? what about the quality of the lace? it looks SO GOOD! but what does it feel like?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cardenas.carla@gmail.com","IpAddress":"171.159.194.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1378978345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Carlicardenas","Id":273425,"Name":"Carlicardenas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":6402,"TotalPages":641,"CurrentPage":6190,"NextPage":6200,"PreviousPage":6180,"LastPage":6400},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
