{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"144.9.40.131","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78892,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"318a792dbd362c912766cea55fe8e26e","RawContent":"for those that used Ipod system for music,  did you use your iphone, laptop, ipad or actual Ipod?    I have a Ipod touch.  I haven&#039;t used it in a while so recently updated it 6.1 but when I tried to download the Mywedding Dj app it needs to be 7 update or higher.\n\n\nalso may sound silly, but using the ipod I don&#039;t need to have wi-fi correct?","Attachments":[],"Id":1888890,"PostDate":1425996608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                for those that used Ipod system for music,  did you use your iphone, laptop, ipad or actual Ipod?    I have a Ipod touch.  I haven't used it in a while so recently updated it 6.1 but when I tried to download the Mywedding Dj app it needs to be 7 update or higher.<br><br>\nalso may sound silly, but using the ipod I don't need to have wi-fi correct?  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383038867,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":27465